(8762, N's8762', N'TV_SHOW', N'Act 2 - Series 3', N'2021-09-19', 2021, N'ALL', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'2'),
(8763, N's8763', N'TV_SHOW', N'Act 2 - Series 2', N'2021-09-19', 2021, N'13+', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'2'),
(8764, N's8764', N'TV_SHOW', N'ACT 2 - Series 10', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'1'),
(8765, N's8765', N'TV_SHOW', N'Act 2 - Series 1', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'1'),
(8766, N's8766', N'MOVIE', N'White Demise', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 70, N'MINUTES', N'70 min', N'A desperate woman embarks on a journey to find a life-saving bullet, seeking to reverse the tragic death of her daughter, but the only way to do that is through the man who revived her murderer.'),
(8767, N's8767', N'TV_SHOW', N'True Tori', NULL, 2014, N'TV-14', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'In True Tori, Tori Spelling has made a courageous decision to let audiences into her home as her marriage to Dean McDermott falters. Going through the most difficult period in her life, Tori will tell her story for the first time. Only time will tell if Tori and Dean''s marriage survives.'),
(8768, N's8768', N'MOVIE', N'The Proud Rebel', NULL, 1958, N'PG-13', 112, N'MINUTES', N'112 min', N'Civil War veteran Alan Ladd roams the frontier with his young son, who has not spoken a word after a traumatic shock during the war, searching for a doctor who can cure him. Along the way, Ladd acidentally runs afoul of sheep baron Dean Jagger and is forced into indentured servitude to farm woman Olivia De Havilland. Ladd falls in love with her, and vows to protect her land from the schemes of Jagger and his men. During the climatic final battle, Ladd''s young son is finally able to find his voice again.'),
(8769, N's8769', N'MOVIE', N'The Diesel Mystery', NULL, 2011, N'7+', 43, N'MINUTES', N'43 min', N'Rudolf Diesel''s invention is the backbone of our global economy. Today the diesel engine, that was developed in the late 19th century, drives trucks, cars and ocean liners, but it also fuels power plants that produce electricity and heat. Diesel wanted his engine to benefit all of mankind, to rid the world of poverty. Instead, he created a tool for achieving massive globalization.'),
(8770, N's8770', N'MOVIE', N'The Deeper You Dig', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Bogus tarot card reader Ivy and her teenage daughter Echo are an unconventional but loving team. But when reclusive Kurt moves in down the road, a tragic accident results in Echo''s murder, causing three lives to collide in mysterious and wicked ways. Kurt believes he can hide his secret beneath the earth but Echo, refusing to accept death, burrows into his head until he can feel her in his bones.'),
(8771, N's8771', N'MOVIE', N'Soul Food', NULL, 1997, N'R', 115, N'MINUTES', N'115 min', N'Matriarch Mama Joe has held her family together for 40 years around a Sunday dinner of soul food.'),
(8772, N's8772', N'MOVIE', N'Small Apartments', NULL, 2013, N'R', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Trapped in a seedy LA apartment, Franklin Franklin (Matt Lucas) has a dead landlord on the kitchen floor and is surrounded by eccentric neighbors: the delinquent (Johnny Knoxville) the wanna-be stripper (Juno Temple) and the artist (James Caan). To add to his chaos, a drunk investigator (Billy Crystal) is questioning him.'),
(8773, N's8773', N'MOVIE', N'Shaolin Fighters vs. Ninja', NULL, 1981, N'18+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'After her father is killed by the Deadly Blade, the Moon Goddess as she is now known sends out invitations to all the top fighters in the region to try to lure out the Deadly Blade and try to force him to kill his son.'),
(8774, N's8774', N'MOVIE', N'Scorned', NULL, 2014, N'R', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'A romantic weekend turns horrific when Sadie discovers her boyfriend Kevin is having an affair with her best friend Jennifer.'),
(8775, N's8775', N'MOVIE', N'Open Your Eyes', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'In a rush to complete an overdue screenplay a writer''s past explodes perilously into the present as his world unravels.'),
(8776, N's8776', N'MOVIE', N'Mind Games', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'An Army psychologist held captive by an unknown adversary must find her way out of an RV in the middle of nowhere to survive.'),
(8777, N's8777', N'MOVIE', N'In My Mind', NULL, 2017, N'ALL', 78, N'MINUTES', N'78 min', N'A feature documentary by award-winning filmmaker Chris Rodley, In My Mind was made to celebrate the 50th anniversary of enigmatic 1960s TV series The Prisoner. Featuring a series of frank archive interviews with creator Patrick McGoohan, new interviews with his daughter Catherine and never-before-seen archive footage, this is the definitive story of The Prisoner as told by its creator.'),
(8778, N's8778', N'MOVIE', N'Evan Almighty', NULL, 2007, N'PG', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Everyone''s favorite funnyman Steve Carell is at his hilarious best as junior congressman Evan Baxter, whose wish to "change the world" is heard by none other than God. When God appears with the perplexing request to build an ark, Evan is sure he is losing it.'),
(8779, N's8779', N'MOVIE', N'Clairevoyant', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'A spoiled rich girl hires a camera crew to document her journey as she attempts to shed her ego and attain enlightenment in the most oxymoronic ways.'),
(8780, N's8780', N'MOVIE', N'Bad Detectives', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 72, N'MINUTES', N'72 min', N'Two young women inherit their grandfather''s detective agency and reluctantly team up to solve their murders.'),
(8781, N's8781', N'MOVIE', N'Attack the Block', NULL, 2011, N'R', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'Attack the Block'' is a fast, funny, frightening action adventure movie that pits a teen gang against an invasion of savage alien monsters. It turns a London housing project into a sci-fi playground. A tower block into a fortress under siege. And teenage street kids into heroes. It''s inner city versus outer space.'),
(8782, N's8782', N'MOVIE', N'The Five Provocations', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'The Five Provocations is a magic realist drama about four intertwined stories of love, loss and unexpected confrontations by women too provocative to ignore. FIGHT ? FAWN? FEIGHT? FREEZE? or FLIGHT ?'),
(8783, N's8783', N'MOVIE', N'The Act of Reading', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'A retired high school English teacher is confronted by a former student who failed her class 15 years prior. He then prepares for her a belated book report – an off-kilter documentary on the magic of reading and teaching Moby-Dick.'),
(8784, N's8784', N'MOVIE', N'Symptoma 20', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 50, N'MINUTES', N'50 min', N'"Symptoma 20" is a video project that explores 9 different lives as they adapt to the strange new world caused by the COVID-19 crisis. Individual and collective struggles that mirror daily challenges of today take an experimental turn in this multiversed world where reality has two definitions.'),
(8785, N's8785', N'MOVIE', N'Strike Commando 2', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'Sgt Mike Ransom battles the KGB, rogue CIA agents, an army of ninjas, a tough bar owner and "all the stuntman craziness and explosions you can cram into 90 minutes.'),
(8786, N's8786', N'MOVIE', N'Strike Commando', NULL, 2021, N'R', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Writer/director Bruno Mattei borrowed from Rambo: First Blood Part II, Missing In Action and more to create their own mind-blowing ''Namsploitation masterpiece: Reb Brown stars as Sgt. Mike Ransom, a one-man war machine on a screaming-for-vengeance mission against brutal Vietcong, merciless Russians, double-crossing U.S. officers and acres of bullet-blasted Philippines jungle.'),
(8787, N's8787', N'TV_SHOW', N'Pinkfong! Healthy Habit Songs', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Sing with Pinkfong and learn how to form healthy habits. From teamwork to regulating emotions, Pinkfong and friends will guide your children to be a healthy kid!'),
(8788, N's8788', N'MOVIE', N'IWish', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 9, N'MINUTES', N'9 min', N'Audrey Arckles is new in town...Little does she know that excitement is just around the corner... Join her and some "MAGIcal" friends as she starts her first adventure!'),
(8789, N's8789', N'MOVIE', N'Hello UFO', NULL, 2004, N'13+', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'When a shy bus driver develops a crush on one of his passengers – a blind woman who moved into his neighborhood to escape a broken heart – he crafts a fake persona to win her over.'),
(8790, N's8790', N'MOVIE', N'Far More', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'Sean (Adrian Grenier) takes us on a powerful and emotional journey to learn that the secret to life is loving what you have. Sean now a successful fashion designer returns to his hometown for a painstaking family reunion that will take him back to his past, only to rebuild his future.'),
(8791, N's8791', N'MOVIE', N'Detective MJ: Shadow of a Hero', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 71, N'MINUTES', N'71 min', N'Detective Mason Jones aka Detective MJ, is a Washington DC homicide detective, who is caught in between a homicide case and a war between two gangsters that run the Washington DC underground scene.'),
(8792, N's8792', N'MOVIE', N'Cobby: The Other Side of Cute', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'Celebrity chimp COBBY was the star of short lived 60s children''s TV series Cobby''s Hobbies. Australian filmmaker Donna McRae was fascinated by the show as child and explores her own personal obsession with COBBY - the chimp himself and the TV show - piecing together the often bizarre story of an animal stolen from his natural habitat to work on TV before being retired at age 7.'),
(8793, N's8793', N'MOVIE', N'Babysitter Must Die', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 75, N'MINUTES', N'75 min', N'A wealthy family''s home is invaded during a game of hide-and-seek by a pack cultists. Josie, the babysitter hides in plain sight prepared and armed with a handful of survival skills. She battles the cult and her fears through a long night of terror. Ultimately good defeats evil and she triumphs, but not before a cruel twist reveals the cult were just foot soldiers for a much greater evil.'),
(8794, N's8794', N'MOVIE', N'ATF', NULL, 1999, N'16+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'Amy Brenneman (Judging Amy) stars as an agent at the Federal Bureau of Alcohol, Tobacco and Firearms in this two hour telefilm about the tragic events surrounding the Waco incident.'),
(8795, N's8795', N'MOVIE', N'Ashani Sanket', NULL, 1973, N'13+', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'Gangacharan is a village Brahmin who teaches, organises religious events and tries to prevent epidemics. However, things get difficult with a raging war and an approaching famine.'),
(8796, N's8796', N'MOVIE', N'Vakeel Saab (Malayalam)', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 153, N'MINUTES', N'153 min', N'Three girls find themselves accused of attempt to murder after escaping molestation. Their only hope is an alcoholic lawyer who agrees to take up the case.'),
(8797, N's8797', N'MOVIE', N'Tik Tik Tik', NULL, 1981, N'18+', 136, N'MINUTES', N'136 min', N'Dilip, a photographer, gets involved with a group of three supermodels on an international tour. Other models sent abroad seem to be dead, and when the cycle repeats, Dilip is suspected.'),
(8798, N's8798', N'MOVIE', N'Thiramai', NULL, 1985, N'18+', 149, N'MINUTES', N'149 min', N'Narendra, a police officer and a stern father, gets humiliated when his children are involved in criminal activities. Soon enough, a retired brigadier vows to change their behaviour.'),
(8799, N's8799', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Cat in the Hat Knows a Lot About That!', N'2021-09-22', 2018, N'TV-G', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'This series follows the adventures 6-year-old best friends, Sally and Nick, as they are whisked off on extraordinary voyages of scientific discovery with the Cat in the Hat. In the Cat''s Seussian vehicle, the Thinga-ma-jigger, they fly, float, rocket, and shrink down to the size of a bee to explore natural wonders from the bottom of the ocean to the treetops of the rain forest.'),
(8800, N's8800', N'MOVIE', N'The Ambassador''s Daughter', NULL, 1956, N'7+', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'The daughter of the American ambassador to France comes to the aid of American soldiers when a grumpy U.S. senator thinks about closing off Paris to the servicemen.');
INSERT INTO dbo.content (id, source_id, content_type, title, date_added, release_year, rating, duration_value, duration_unit, duration_text, description) VALUES
(8801, N's8801', N'MOVIE', N'Song for Our People', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 61, N'MINUTES', N'61 min', N'Go behind the scenes of an unforgettable recording session where an extraordinary group of artist activists come together to create a powerful new anthem to honor Black lives and inspire the fight for racial justice in America.'),
(8802, N's8802', N'MOVIE', N'Sniper: Special Ops', NULL, 2016, N'R', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'Steven Seagal (Machete) leads a cast that includes actual military personnel in this action-packed thriller, as he and his teammate struggle to survive in enemy territory.'),
(8803, N's8803', N'MOVIE', N'RiffTrax Live: House on Haunted Hill', NULL, 2011, N'13+', 116, N'MINUTES', N'116 min', N'Yes, horror classic House on Haunted Hill provides a mesmerizing walk down "people actually used to find this SCARY?!?" lane. The Vincent Price horror classic riffed Live! This feature is a parody and contains the original movie combined with a comedic commentary by Mike, Kevin and Bill from RiffTrax (formerly of MST3K aka Mystery Science Theater 3000) .'),
(8804, N's8804', N'TV_SHOW', N'Preacher', N'2021-09-22', 2019, N'TV-MA', 4, N'SEASONS', N'4 Seasons', N'As our story inches closer to the finale, God''s endgame for the universe begins to click into place. Trapped between heavenly prophecies, hellish prisons, and all-out nuclear war, Jesse, Tulip, and Cassidy make their bloody way to the Most High. Whether they can reach God in time – or whether all this carnage is part of His divine plan – will soon be revealed as Preacher barrels towards the end..'),
(8805, N's8805', N'MOVIE', N'Nurses from hell', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 120, N'MINUTES', N'120 min', N'Four nurses career minded to the point go neglecting their families, were relentless even at their jobs, They breached most of the medical ethics regarding the treatment they gave their patients and many lives had to pay...'),
(8806, N's8806', N'MOVIE', N'Mustang Saviors', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'Veteran suicide is a national tragedy on an epic scale. A remarkable treatment is proving more powerful than ever imagined: Pairing veterans with wild mustangs taken straight off the range; miraculously turning despair into enduring hope.'),
(8807, N's8807', N'MOVIE', N'Munduvareda Adhyaya', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'ACP Bala investigates the murder case of a prominent figure known as Contractor Vishwas Narayan and stumbles on many suspects, who is the real culprit?'),
(8808, N's8808', N'MOVIE', N'Manadhai Thirudivittai', NULL, 2001, N'13+', 152, N'MINUTES', N'152 min', N'Deva a music college student falls in love with Shruthi his college mate .As both fall in love and plan to marry,a huge shock twists deva''s life .'),
(8809, N's8809', N'MOVIE', N'Kadha Paranja Kadha', NULL, 2018, N'ALL', 134, N'MINUTES', N'134 min', N'Ebi and Jennifer were best friends from childhood itself, but they get separated as they grow up. People go out in search of a livelihood, leaving behind friends and family. But those who love each other will find a way to reunite.'),
(8810, N's8810', N'MOVIE', N'Kaadakalam', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'Kaadakalam movie talks about the relation between a tribal boy and his father. Murugans (father) wish is to send son out side the forest and teach him after him after his 4th standard but son loves to stay in forest he don''t want to go outside. Story of kaadakalam starts in this way and finally gives a meaning that every one has a space of their on where they have their own roles.'),
(8811, N's8811', N'MOVIE', N'I''ll Follow You Down', NULL, 2014, N'16+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'After the disappearance of an accomplished physicist (Rufus Sewell), his son Erol (Haley Joel Osment) and wife Marika (Gillian Anderson) struggle to cope. Years later, now a young scientist himself, Erol discovers a formula that could kill him, throw him into the unknown...or bring his family back together.'),
(8812, N's8812', N'MOVIE', N'Goodbye Honey', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'After escaping abduction, a frantic woman must coerce an exhausted truck driver to hide in the back of her truck for the night. The two women take refuge not knowing what the rest of the night has in store.'),
(8813, N's8813', N'MOVIE', N'Falling for You', NULL, 1995, N'16+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'Starring Jennie Garth. A serial killer attacks a commercial artist which leaves her with amnesia before moving into the apartment next door.'),
(8814, N's8814', N'TV_SHOW', N'F2 Kicks Off', NULL, 2014, N'7+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'''F2 Kicks Off'' is the F2''s journey through their city, their home and the place where everything for them began. In their first television series, Billy Wingrove and Jeremy Lynch journey across London, pulling off unbelievable feats of skill and breathtaking stunts astonishing everyone they meet, whether international footballers, chart topping musicians, or the everyday people of London.'),
(8815, N's8815', N'MOVIE', N'CUCU', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 8, N'MINUTES', N'8 min', N'Rafa and Julia are a young couple, who have a discussion back home. Rafa drank more than he owed at his brother-in-law Antonio''s party, and now Julia tries to make him see that he can not behave in such an immature way, they are no longer teenagers and they have to be responsible.'),
(8816, N's8816', N'MOVIE', N'Catching Hell in the City of Angels', NULL, 2017, N'18+', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'Catching Hell In The City Of Angels is a documentary about life in South Central Los Angeles. Focusing on both gang members and the Police the film creates an unflinching portrait of one of the world''s most notorious neighbourhoods.'),
(8817, N's8817', N'TV_SHOW', N'Blippi - Blippi''s Educational Adventures for Kids', N'2021-09-22', 2020, N'ALL', 5, N'SEASONS', N'5 Seasons', N'Blippi is an educational kids show tailored for children ages 2- 5 years old. Join Blippi as he embarks on an adventurous journey to an animal shelter, baseball stadium, indoor playground, and many more! Kids will learn colors, shapes, numbers, the letters of the alphabet and so much more with Blippi''s wonderful videos for kids!'),
(8818, N's8818', N'MOVIE', N'Bad Ben 7 The Haunted Highway', NULL, 2019, N'18+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'Tom Riley has a new job now as a ridesharing driver for the DropUOff service and the strange new experiences he has driving his clients on Halloween night in 2019 are all captured on his dashcam, body cam, and surveillance cameras. Among his clients are a young woman carrying a suspicious parcel, a witch, and an unfriendly scarecrow.'),
(8819, N's8819', N'MOVIE', N'Adoring', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 108, N'MINUTES', N'108 min', N'In this heart-warming ensemble rom-com, pets play match-maker as their humans learn to find connect with family, friends, and lovers through their furry friends.'),
(8820, N's8820', N'MOVIE', N'Whitefolks', NULL, 2017, N'18+', 101, N'MINUTES', N'101 min', N'Two con artists take us on a forbidden ride through the dark side of crime called "The Life" as they dodge a murder contract from the Russian Mafia.'),
(8821, N's8821', N'MOVIE', N'Underworld', NULL, 1997, N'R', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'A petty criminal fresh from a 7 year stint in jail embarks on a mission to find the group of men who murdered his father.'),
(8822, N's8822', N'MOVIE', N'Too Late to Die Young (Tarde Para Morir Joven)', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 110, N'MINUTES', N'110 min', N'During the summer of 1990 in Chile, a small group of families creates an isolated community right below the Andes, to start new lives following the recent end of the dictatorship. In this time of change and reckoning,16-year-old Sofía and Lucas, and 10-year-old Clara, struggle with parents, first loves, and fears, as they prepare a big party for New Year''s Eve. Winner Best Director Locarno.'),
(8823, N's8823', N'MOVIE', N'The Wonders of the Vatican Library - The Hall of Pope Sixtus V', NULL, 2004, N'13+', 39, N'MINUTES', N'39 min', N'An extraordinary trip inside the Vatican Library in this collection written and directed by Vincenzo Labella (Jesus of Nazareth). A veritable history of the Church of Rome. In this episode, the narrator guides us through the wonders of the apostolic library. Driven by the invention of printing, Sixtus V decides to create an appropriate space that could house the preservation of ancient documents.'),
(8824, N's8824', N'MOVIE', N'The Ratings Game', NULL, 1984, N'16+', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'A newly rich New Jersey trucker moves to Hollywood and creates a slew of hit TV shows by manipulating the ratings system with help from his girlfriend in the ratings business.'),
(8825, N's8825', N'MOVIE', N'The Celestine Prophecy', NULL, 2006, N'PG', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'Based on James Redfield''s worldwide best-selling novel, The Celestine Prophecy is a spiritual adventure film chronicling the discovery of ancient scrolls in the rainforests of Peru. The prophecy and its nine key insights predict a worldwide awakening, arising within all religious traditions, that moves humanity toward a deeper experience of spirituality.'),
(8826, N's8826', N'MOVIE', N'Sunny (4K UHD)', NULL, 2021, N'PG-13', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'The life of a failed musician, sunny takes a dramatic turn as he smuggles himself back from Dubai to Kerala in midst of a global pandemic and shuts himself from the society.'),
(8827, N's8827', N'MOVIE', N'Sunny', NULL, 2021, N'PG-13', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'The life of a failed musician, sunny takes a dramatic turn as he smuggles himself back from Dubai to Kerala in midst of a global pandemic and shuts himself from the society.'),
(8828, N's8828', N'MOVIE', N'Russian Raid', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'An ex soldier returns to Russia as a mercenary seeking to avenge his fathers death after he was brutally murder in a secret missile factory.'),
(8829, N's8829', N'MOVIE', N'RiffTrax: Beast of the Yellow Night', NULL, 2014, N'16+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'RiffTrax, the guys who make movies funny, bring their comedic riffing treatment to this cheesy horror classic! Go mad trying to figure out what is happening in Beast of the Yellow Night! This feature is a parody and contains the original movie combined with a comedic commentary by Mike, Kevin and Bill from RiffTrax (former stars of Mystery Science Theater 3000 aka MST3K).'),
(8830, N's8830', N'MOVIE', N'Rick Overton''s Set List', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 69, N'MINUTES', N'69 min', N'Rick Overton has to improvise an entire comedy set based on topics he''s never seen before.'),
(8831, N's8831', N'MOVIE', N'Nore Davis: You Guys Are Dope', NULL, 2018, N'18+', 58, N'MINUTES', N'58 min', N'Comedian Nore Davis brings down the house in his fresh, new stand-up special, as he shares his take on social media dependence, being in love, and the hard truths of protesting; all with a little help from his New York comedy crew.'),
(8832, N's8832', N'MOVIE', N'Nicholas and Alexandra', NULL, 1971, N'PG', 188, N'MINUTES', N'188 min', N'Nicholas and Alexandra covers the rise and fall of the last of the Russian Romanovs. From their lavish wedding, to involvement of the mystical holy man, Rasputin, the Czar and Czarina of Russia are out of touch with their people. This gives way to the rise of Lenin and Trotsky who sow the seeds of revolution thus sealing the Russian royal family''s doom.'),
(8833, N's8833', N'MOVIE', N'My Melancholy Baby', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 45, N'MINUTES', N'45 min', N'"My Melancholy Baby" takes a look at 48 hours into the difficult life of the Burrows family. This story is told through the eyes of the older son, Miles Burrows, a 19 year old drug addict who hasn''t been home because his home life is the underlying reason for his addiction.'),
(8834, N's8834', N'MOVIE', N'Morgue', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'After a harrowing accident, down on his luck Diego Martinez accepts a gig as a security guard at a local morgue. But when he spots the victim''s lifeless body, he''s left to wonder how much otherworldly rage does it take to wake the dead.'),
(8835, N's8835', N'MOVIE', N'Molly and Me', NULL, 1945, N'PG', 0, N'MINUTES', N'0 min', N'Molly (Fields), a poor struggling actress, decides to "play the part" of housekeeper for wealthy former politician John Graham (Wooley). However, Mr. Graham is hard to get along with, to the point that he has chased his wife and other servants away, and alienated his son Jimmy (McDowall). Graham''s only ally is butler Peabody (Gardiner), whom she later finds out is also a former actor. Molly won''t take Graham''s nonsense, and teaches him about how to treat other people, and reconcile with his son. And as the other servants quit, Molly steadily replaces them with her old theater friends, so that the house soon becomes a former actor refuge! A wonderful screwball comedy, and Gracie Field''s last movie appearance.'),
(8836, N's8836', N'MOVIE', N'Military State', NULL, 2017, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'America declares a State Of Emergency after terrorist attack on our soil. Private soldiers with drones are mobilized to spy on US citizens for potential terrorists. A lone drone controller discovers he is being watched for his Christian beliefs. With help of patriot fighters, he attempts to escapes with classified information. It''s now a race against time to ensure America''s Freedom is preserved.'),
(8837, N's8837', N'MOVIE', N'LOCO', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'A brilliant but troubled young man is thrust into a dark underworld when he becomes a pawn in a brutal struggle between two drug lords for a new street drug called LOCO. Alex''s only hope comes from a beautiful girl, Lydia, who is also caught up in the scheme, and together they try to escape their dangerous world.'),
(8838, N's8838', N'MOVIE', N'Liberty Stands Still', NULL, 2002, N'R', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'A gunman ties up an actor and locks him in his dressing room just before a performance. He also puts a bomb with a 90-minute timer next to the actor. Over the next 90 minutes, the story unfolds: as a result of his daughter''s death, the gunman wants a public debate on the Second Amendment.'),
(8839, N's8839', N'MOVIE', N'Jamie: Drag Queen at 16', NULL, 2011, N'13+', 56, N'MINUTES', N'56 min', N'This moving and uplifting documentary follows the emotional story of teenager Jamie Campbell as he makes a bold step on his difficult journey into adulthood. The film shows Jamie battling prejudice from his community, but also within his own family, whilst pursuing what he feels is his destiny: becoming a drag queen.'),
(8840, N's8840', N'TV_SHOW', N'Intrusion', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'After a security guard, named Joe, accidentally becomes entangled in the city''s largest underground drug operation his life is turned upside down. He is held prisoner by ruthless mercenaries in order to obtain control of the city. Luckily, the LAPD has two of their finest detectives picking up the pieces and solving the puzzle along the way.'),
(8841, N's8841', N'MOVIE', N'In the Line of Duty 3', NULL, 1988, N'16+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'Genji Nakamura and his soul-mate and partner Michiko Nishiwaki are thieves for the notorious Red Army terrorist organization in Japan. After pulling off the jewelry heist of the century, they are now planning to use the jewelry they''ve snatched to buy an arms cache from gun smugglers in Hong Kong for their movement.'),
(8842, N's8842', N'MOVIE', N'Here Are The Young Men', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Three high school grads celebrate their newfound freedom with an epic, debaucherous bender, but when a horrible accident sends them spiraling, each must grapple with the most daunting challenge of their lives: facing their own inner demons.'),
(8843, N's8843', N'MOVIE', N'Gonzo', NULL, 2008, N'R', 120, N'MINUTES', N'120 min', N'Oscar-winning director Alex Gibney presents a probing look into the uncanny life of Dr. Hunter S. Thompson - inventor of gonzo journalism and author of the landmark "Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas."'),
(8844, N's8844', N'MOVIE', N'Drive Thru', NULL, 2007, N'R', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Horror gets Super Sized when Horny The Clown, the demonic mascot of "Hella-Burger," starts slashing Orange County teenagers with his meat cleaver.'),
(8845, N's8845', N'MOVIE', N'Devineni', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 122, N'MINUTES', N'122 min', N'Devineni is a very power full pollution in Vijayawada city. An other position vangaveeti ranga is all so power full leader in Vijayawada city. Both are leaders good friends are beginning days.'),
(8846, N's8846', N'MOVIE', N'Desert Blue', NULL, 1999, N'R', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'When cable TV starlet Skye gets stuck in a tiny Californian town, the last thing she wants to do is get to know the eccentric local teens. When a mysterious chemical spill forces the FBI to put the town under quarantine Skye has no choice but to stay put. When she starts to fall in love with loner Blue she realizes she might not be in such a rush to get back to the big city after all.'),
(8847, N's8847', N'MOVIE', N'Death Machine', NULL, 1995, N'R', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'Engineering genius and psychopath, Jack, unleashes his newest and deadliest creation against the corporation that fired him.'),
(8848, N's8848', N'MOVIE', N'Creating Freedom: The Lottery of Birth', NULL, 2013, N'7+', 76, N'MINUTES', N'76 min', N'Do you shape the world or does it shape you? Drawing on leading thinkers from around the world, and with a torrent of mind-expanding ideas and information, The Lottery of Birth will make you think again about what it means to be free.'),
(8849, N's8849', N'MOVIE', N'Copperman', NULL, 2019, N'7+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'Anselmo (Luca Argentero) is a world traveler who has the innocence of a child and the heart of a lion. Abandoned by his father who believed he is a superhero, Anselmo lives with his mother, who has succeeded in convincing him that he is a special kind of human. He resembles Forrest Gump, a grown up with a pure heart, a disarming candor, a childish soul totally free from suspicions.'),
(8850, N's8850', N'MOVIE', N'Beauty Factory', NULL, 2013, N'16+', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'Beauty Factory follows five contestants over the course of four months as they compete for the coveted Miss Venezuela crown; offering an intimate look into the world of beauty, and the sometimes-ugly things people do to be a part of it. These are smart, savvy women using their beauty as a launchpad for something greater. But how far will these girls go to succeed?'),
(8851, N's8851', N'MOVIE', N'An American Girl Story: Summer Camp, Friends For Life', NULL, 2017, N'ALL', 32, N'MINUTES', N'32 min', N'Aspiring filmmaker, Z and Paz, a budding engineer, arrive at S.T.E.A.M. camp excited for tech heaven. When the administrator makes them explore nature and confiscates all tech, they think their summer’s doomed. Things take a mysterious turn when they meet Jordan, an enchanting “counselor” who sends them on an adventure, opening them up to a world of possibilities – like befriending Drew.'),
(8852, N's8852', N'TV_SHOW', N'Advancements', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Hosted by Ted Danson, Advancements is an educational series dedicated to informing the public about the latest innovations taking place today. Exploring the significant issues impacting society, our producers discover the practical solutions and best kept secrets to raise social awareness and solve global problems.'),
(8853, N's8853', N'TV_SHOW', N'#WASHED', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'2021 Daytime Emmy nominee. Desperate, pressed and #WASHED up, a group of aging millennials attain everything they NEVER wanted in pursuit of their dreams. Created by 2x regional Emmy Winner Jerod Couch.'),
(8854, N's8854', N'TV_SHOW', N'Titipo Titipo', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Titipo is the new train who just became official passenger train in town. He gets to meet a lot of train, bus and other vehicle friends and start to operate from the station. He may be little bus he''s ready to be a safe and brave train.'),
(8855, N's8855', N'MOVIE', N'The Port of Last Resort - Zuflucht in Shanghai', NULL, 1998, N'13+', 76, N'MINUTES', N'76 min', N'In the years 1938-41 nearly 18,000 European Jewish refugees fled to Shanghai, China, where most would spend a decade in exile. This little-known story is told through the recollections of former refugees and a collage of evocative archival materials: personal and published writings, relief reports, and secret documents, illustrated with home movies, photographs, newsreels, and propaganda films.'),
(8856, N's8856', N'MOVIE', N'The Omega Code', NULL, 1999, N'16+', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'Ancient codes hidden within the Torah reveal the secrets of global events, past, present, and future. One man is after the Code, seeking the power to change the world as we know it... for the worse. Another seeks the truth, risking his life and everything he stands for in order to stop him.'),
(8857, N's8857', N'MOVIE', N'The Heritage Hunters Journey Through The Past', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 52, N'MINUTES', N'52 min', N'Follow The Heritage Hunters as they travel the country in search of Truly Haunted Historical Places. They will research and investigate the rich history and intriguing encounters that many have experienced through the years. So come along and see what is found as you Journey Through The Past...'),
(8858, N's8858', N'MOVIE', N'Secrets of the Mega Resort', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 67, N'MINUTES', N'67 min', N'Secrets of the Mega Resort takes a fascinating look at how Baha Mar creates 1 million dream holidays a year. With access to the world''s largest luxury resort, this film has an access-all-areas pass into a hidden world of private jets, trained flamingos and exclusive penthouses run by a team of 5,000 staff who pamper guests around the clock in the Bahamian sun'),
(8859, N's8859', N'MOVIE', N'RiffTrax: Jack the Giant Killer', NULL, 2014, N'13+', 114, N'MINUTES', N'114 min', N'RiffTrax, the guys who make movies funny, bring their comedic riffing treatment to this cheesy 1960''s fantasy classic! Can Jack save Princess Elaine from the evil sorcerer Pendragon? This feature is a parody and contains the original movie combined with a comedic commentary by Mike, Kevin and Bill from RiffTrax (former stars of Mystery Science Theater 3000 - MST3K).'),
(8860, N's8860', N'MOVIE', N'Raame Aandalum Raavane Aandalum', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 112, N'MINUTES', N'112 min', N'Raame Aandalum Raavane Aandalum also known as RARA talks about a village, which is breaking news in all television channels in India but the people of the village don’t have electricity to watch Television.'),
(8861, N's8861', N'MOVIE', N'Mounam Pesiyadhe', NULL, 2002, N'ALL', 144, N'MINUTES', N'144 min', N'Gautham, who runs a restaurant, falls in love with his friend Kannan''s cousin, Sandhya. Problems arise when Gautham learns that Kannan''s parents want Kannan to marry Sandhya.'),
(8862, N's8862', N'TV_SHOW', N'Love Story of Court Enemies', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'The story is set in the Yuan year of the Yongzheng era. In the time of chaos, Yu Xing and her sister Cai Feng were separated. When Yu Xing knew that Cai Feng had entered the palace as a consort candidate, she decides to follow suit as a chef trainee. Her culinary skills deeply impressed the Emperor, and she was quickly promoted through the ranks.'),
(8863, N's8863', N'TV_SHOW', N'I Know What You Did Last Summer', NULL, 2021, N'TV-MA', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'I Know What You Did Last Summer is a murder mystery and modern coming-of-age story, all in one. In a sun-soaked Hawaiian town with a mysterious past, a group of friends is left with a dark secret after a tragic accident. One year later, a member of the group receives a threatening message, and the friends now know that someone intends to make them pay for last summer.'),
(8864, N's8864', N'MOVIE', N'Flashes - The Director''s Cut', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'John Rotit is quite happy, with his loving wife. In a "flash", he''s a rock star shooting up heroin. And after that...he''s something far more sinister. John unwillingly moves between parallel universes. He has no clue how or why this phenomenon is occurring. John''s judgment becomes even more clouded as his mind unravels, and he''ll do anything to remain in the one life where he''s truly happy.'),
(8865, N's8865', N'TV_SHOW', N'Disraeli: Portrait of a Romantic', NULL, 1978, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Lavish political drama. A penetrating look at one of British history''s most enigmatic and controversial figures, Benjamin Disraeli - a dandy, a womaniser and a Jew. Taking his seat in Parliament at the age of 32, Disraeli (Ian McShane) is nearly laughed out of the House by his rival Gladstone, and thus begins an animosity spanning over 50 years.'),
(8866, N's8866', N'MOVIE', N'Crossing Hennessy', NULL, 2010, N'13+', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'Set up on a blind date by their meddling families, Loy & Oi Lin initially aren''t attracted to each other at all – but as their determined aunts continue to throw them together, they develop a friendship that arouses the suspicions of everyone around them.'),
(8867, N's8867', N'MOVIE', N'Creature Cabin', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'After losing her boyfriend, a young woman travels to a remote cabin rumored to be haunted. Once there, she must battle against a cabal of demonic monsters and cultists who emerge in an attempt to create hell on earth.'),
(8868, N's8868', N'MOVIE', N'Birds of Paradise', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'Kate is an aspiring ballerina who is given a scholarship to attend a prestigious ballet school in Paris. Upon arrival her confidence is tested by a fellow dancer, Marine who recently lost her brother. While confrontational at first, their relationship evolves into an emotionally charged, competitive union beset by lies and sexual awakening as they risk it all to join the Opéra national de Paris.'),
(8869, N's8869', N'MOVIE', N'Arthur & Merlin: Knights of Camelot', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'Starring Game of Thrones'' legend, Richard Brake. 463 AD, England. King Arthur has been absent for five long years, fighting a war that has stricken his knights, left his throne defenceless and his queen at the mercy of Modred. But as he fights to preserve Camelot - the toughest conflict is within himself. Guided by wizard Merlin, Arthur must strive to become the king that his nation needs.'),
(8870, N's8870', N'MOVIE', N'The Black Tulip', NULL, 2012, N'13+', 120, N'MINUTES', N'120 min', N'The Mansouri family opens up a new restaurant after the fall of the Taliban in Kabul, Afghanistan only to be subsequently targeted by factional Taliban elements.'),
(8871, N's8871', N'MOVIE', N'The A-List', NULL, 2015, N'16+', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'Eric Schultz, the most popular student at Lake O''Dell High School, is coerced by his guidance counselor, Sylvia Martin, into fulfilling a list of her high school fantasies in order for him to graduate.'),
(8872, N's8872', N'TV_SHOW', N'Savage X Fenty Show', N'2021-09-25', 2021, N'16+', 3, N'SEASONS', N'3 Seasons', N'Rihanna’s Emmy nominated Savage X Fenty Show Vol. 3 is an immersive fashion experience that combines fashion, dance, and music with iconic architecture and unforgettable performances. Featuring an all-star cast debuting the latest Savage X Fenty styles, the show is a visually stunning cultural moment that redefines sexy.'),
(8873, N's8873', N'MOVIE', N'Romulus, My Father', NULL, 2008, N'R', 104, N'MINUTES', N'104 min', N'Despite their hardships in life, Romulus and his beautiful wife, Christina, struggle to raise their son, Raimond, to the best of their abilities. As the deeply moral Romulus struggles to make up for the absence and neglect of the boy''s depressive mother, father and son build an unbreakable bond that is only strengthened with the passing of time.'),
(8874, N's8874', N'MOVIE', N'Rifftrax: Supersonic Man', NULL, 2013, N'16+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'The stars of MST3K bring their comedic riffing treatment to this low-budget superhero classic. Just like The Pumaman - only better! It''s an action movie with a flamethrowing robot battling one of the cheesiest superheroes around! This feature is a parody and contains the original movie with a comedic commentary by Mike, Kevin and Bill from RiffTrax (Stars of Mystery Science Theater 3000).'),
(8875, N's8875', N'TV_SHOW', N'News Anchor', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Maya, a news reporter by profession, meets Rahul at a party. Rahul finds her attractive and approached her to make a relationship. Maya also shows interest but the story takes a turn when Maya kills Rahul. Maya reports the murder on the news channel even before the police arrive at a crime scene. Is she doing this just to get a promotion in her job?'),
(8876, N's8876', N'TV_SHOW', N'Jessy & Nessy', N'2021-09-25', 2021, N'TV-G', 4, N'SEASONS', N'4 Seasons', N'Jessy and Nessy is a series about Jessy, an innately curious little girl and her best friend, Nessy, a five-and-a-half-thousand-year-old purple sea monster. Jessy happens to see the world a little differently through her magical glasses called ‘Inspectacles’. Together this unlikely duo explore life’s curiosities and reveal how all of these seemingly everyday curiosities have fantastical answers.'),
(8877, N's8877', N'MOVIE', N'I Want Candy', NULL, 2008, N'R', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'Budding filmmakers Joe and Baggy know that they have a script made of gold, but lack the finances for production until a desperate producer throws them a bone.'),
(8878, N's8878', N'TV_SHOW', N'I Can See You: Truly Madly Deadly', NULL, 2020, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'After her affair with a married man unravels, a woman leaves the city for a remote resort, where she meets a man who turns her life upside down.'),
(8879, N's8879', N'MOVIE', N'Good Day to be Black and Sexy', NULL, 2008, N'R', 35, N'MINUTES', N'35 min', N'Black love and sexuality, shown through the interactions of several couples during a single day in Los Angeles.'),
(8880, N's8880', N'MOVIE', N'Golden Job', NULL, 2018, N'16+', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'A group of former mercenaries reunite to plan an epic heist: boosting a truck full of medicine held by a foreign intelligence agency to supply a refugee camp in need. But when they find the truck is actually filled with stolen gold, the band of brothers realize they''ve been double-crossed by one of their own - and putting the situation right will be all out war.'),
(8881, N's8881', N'MOVIE', N'Dead Bodies', NULL, 2006, N'NR', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'Tommyâ€™s world is altered unexpectedly when his ex-girlfriend, Jean, returns to overtake him and his apartment.'),
(8882, N's8882', N'TV_SHOW', N'Cross Minds', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'A tale of an ethical risk taker who wants to surprise his life partner, but a series of mysterious events drives him through an unethical venture.'),
(8883, N's8883', N'MOVIE', N'Big Brother', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 101, N'MINUTES', N'101 min', N'Martial arts legend Donnie Yen stars as a former soldier recruited for his toughest mission yet - teaching a class of teen delinquents. As he kicks his way into their school and home lives, it becomes clear that his unconventional teaching style might be just what they need.'),
(8884, N's8884', N'TV_SHOW', N'Baby Shark Brooklyn', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'A massive underwater earthquake sweeps the Shark Family to the opposite side of the ocean! For Baby Shark Brooklyn, who is curious about everything, this new place is an adventure playground. In a new home, Brooklyn makes new friends, and they explore the village together. When they face problems big or small, their different characteristics create synergy and help them overcome hardships.'),
(8885, N's8885', N'MOVIE', N'Architect', NULL, 2006, N'R', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'An architect engages in conflict with an activist who lives in a dangerous complex the architect designed.'),
(8886, N's8886', N'MOVIE', N'A Thousand Years of Good Prayers', NULL, 2007, N'UNRATED', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'A woman in her early 40s moves from China to America to start a new life. Her father comes to visit her because of her recent divorce. Their social and generational conflicts reveal the darker lies and cover-ups within her family during the Cultural Revolution.'),
(8887, N's8887', N'MOVIE', N'100 Girls', NULL, 2001, N'R', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'When a blackout knocks out an elevator in a college girl''s dorm, Matthew and a mystery girl connect carnally and emotionally but he''s left in the dark as to her true identity. He''s got 100 suspects, and a slew of hilarious schemes to worm his way into the hearts and panty drawers of each and every one.'),
(8888, N's8888', N'MOVIE', N'Tuck Jagadish (Kannada)', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 145, N'MINUTES', N'145 min', N'When a doting elder brother has a dispute with the younger one over the inheritance, the latter tries to establish peace and keep the family together.'),
(8889, N's8889', N'MOVIE', N'Touch of Pink', NULL, 2004, N'R', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A gay Canadian living in London has his perfectly crafted life upset when his devoutly Muslim mother comes to visit.'),
(8890, N's8890', N'TV_SHOW', N'Toddler Fun Learning - Educational Videos for Kids', N'2021-09-26', 2021, N'ALL', 3, N'SEASONS', N'3 Seasons', N'Toddler Fun Learning makes fun, free and educational videos, nursery rhymes, stories and songs for toddlers all over the world. In this collection you can learn about numbers, animals, colors and much more!'),
(8891, N's8891', N'TV_SHOW', N'This is Paris, 50 years of passion', N'2021-09-26', 2021, N'TV-NR', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'"PSG city of Lights, 50 years of legend" tells the story of the 2020-2021 season with exclusive access to the team, and revisits the greatest moments in the club''s history. Built around major themes such as ambition, training and solidarity in the face of adversity, the series retraces the Champions League campaign, the battle for the Ligue 1 and victory in the French Cup.'),
(8892, N's8892', N'MOVIE', N'The Deadly Treasure of Lake Kivu', NULL, 2010, N'7+', 51, N'MINUTES', N'51 min', N'In Lake Kivu, on the borders of Rwanda and Congo, there is enough methane gas to supply central Africa''s energy needs for generations. But if it explodes - which is a very real danger - it will kill up to two and a half million people living on its shores. This tragi-comic documentary gives us the viewpoints of politicians, fishermen, investors, volcanologists and physicists.'),
(8893, N's8893', N'MOVIE', N'T-34', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'During the greatest war in the history of mankind, young lieutenant Ivushkin assembles a courageous group of POWs to plan a daring escape from captivity. With the power of a half-destroyed T-34 tank, Ivushkin and his crew challenge an enemy battalion, ready to battle until the end - for family and for country.'),
(8894, N's8894', N'MOVIE', N'Something Like a Business', NULL, 2010, N'R', 79, N'MINUTES', N'79 min', N'An aspiring pimp struggles to make a mint after inheriting his late uncles escort service and discovering that competition on the streets is fierce.'),
(8895, N's8895', N'MOVIE', N'Severed Ties', NULL, 1992, N'R', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'When a regeneration experiment on his severed arm grows a deadly reptilian creature instead of a limb, a mad scientist uses the serum on homeless crippled veterans to create an army and get his research back from his evil mother.'),
(8896, N's8896', N'MOVIE', N'Robocop: Prime Directives-Meltdown', NULL, 2001, N'R', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'Part two. After the death of John Cable, Alex Murphy is plagued by haunting memories and seeks answers. Meanwhile, a new Robocop is created and goes after Murphy for crimes he didn''t commit.'),
(8897, N's8897', N'MOVIE', N'Rise of the Footsoldier: The Heist', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'Fresh out of prison, Pat Tate can''t stop brooding about the man who had him put away. Soon he''s off to find Frank Harris and seek his revenge.'),
(8898, N's8898', N'MOVIE', N'Prema Gulabi', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 119, N'MINUTES', N'119 min', N'A lady after her death marries a man to fulfill her father''s promise'),
(8899, N's8899', N'MOVIE', N'Ong Bak 2', NULL, 2008, N'R', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'Martial arts superstar Tony Jaa stars in and directs this epic tale of revenge set hundreds of years in the past. Featuring a huge cast and hordes of elephants, this prequel takes Jaa''s skills to the next level, showcasing him as a master of a wide range of martial arts styles - while proving him to be a promising director as well.'),
(8900, N's8900', N'MOVIE', N'Ong Bak - The Thai Warrior', NULL, 2005, N'R', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'Tony Jaa, the fighting superstar "destined for film''s martial arts pantheon," (New York Daily News) electrifies as a religious young warrior who swears an oath of peace. But when a gangster steals the head of Ong-Bak, his village''s deity, Ting heads for Bangkok to get it back. In a film Time Magazine calls "exhilarating" with relentless, fever-pitched action free of stunt ...'),
(8901, N's8901', N'MOVIE', N'Mojin: The Worm Valley', NULL, 2019, N'18+', 110, N'MINUTES', N'110 min', N'Following in the footsteps of blockbuster Mojin: The Lost Legend and based on the bestselling novel series, Mojin: The Worm Valley once again finds legendary tomb explorer Hu Bayi on a dangerous mission as he seeks out the Tomb of Emperor Xian, located on an island of monstrous creatures in this mystical action-adventure.'),
(8902, N's8902', N'MOVIE', N'Good Friday', NULL, 2020, N'7+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'A disillusioned attorney, estranged from his son and himself, faces a day of life-defining choices in this inspirational story of temptation and redemption, of family and faith and love.'),
(8903, N's8903', N'MOVIE', N'Finger of Guilt', NULL, 1956, N'13+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'A married movie studio executive''s life starts to unravel when he is stalked by a seductively beautiful woman he claims he does not know.'),
(8904, N's8904', N'TV_SHOW', N'Digley & Dazey - Vehicle Cartoons for Kids (Made by Little Baby Bum)', N'2021-09-26', 2021, N'ALL', 3, N'SEASONS', N'3 Seasons', N'Best friends Digley and Dazey are part of a construction team, who go around building and fixing things in need of repair. Working hard as a team and using their creativity, they always save the day and learn new things along the way! In this collection, Digley & Dazey save a kitten, go ice skating, and much more!'),
(8905, N's8905', N'MOVIE', N'Cosmoball', NULL, 2021, N'7+', 118, N'MINUTES', N'118 min', N'Life on earth is desolate after a brutal intergalactic war, brightened only by the dangerous, high-flying sport Cosmoball...but no one knows that at each match, four gifted humans are actually fighting to save humanity'),
(8906, N's8906', N'TV_SHOW', N'CoComelon - Kids Songs and Nursery Rhymes', N'2021-09-26', 2021, N'ALL', 11, N'SEASONS', N'11 Seasons', N'CoComelon is here to help preschoolers learn letters, numbers, animal sounds, colors, and more. The videos impart prosocial life lessons, providing parents with an opportunity to teach and play with their children as they watch together. Sing along to some of the popular nursery rhymes like Wheels on the bus, Mary had a little lamb, Twinkle Twinkle Little Star and more!'),
(8907, N's8907', N'MOVIE', N'Beautiful Joe', NULL, 2000, N'13+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Joe is a guy who runs a flower shop and has never had much luck. Things seem to go wrong for Joe when he is diagnosed with a brain tumor, but some luck appears on the horizon when he wins a jackpot. Hush, a stripper who is deeply indebted to a gang of thugs, steals Joe''s money to repay it.'),
(8908, N's8908', N'MOVIE', N'Bad Reputation', NULL, 2005, N'18+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'A high school girl embraces her ''bad reputation'' and takes revenge on the kids who have made her life a living hell.'),
(8909, N's8909', N'MOVIE', N'Asmee', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'Asmee is a dark love story revolving around a newlywed couple with a mysterious past. They must confront the harsh truths and pay a price for their actions.'),
(8910, N's8910', N'MOVIE', N'2:HRS', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'Tim and his two best friends stumble upon a mad scientist who created a way of predicting the time of death of any living creature. When Tim sneaks inside the invention, he discovers he only has 2:Hrs left to live! Tim and his friends start a bucket list that will cram a lifetime into the next two hours while the scientist tracks them down to fulfill the prophecy either way.'),
(8911, N's8911', N'MOVIE', N'13 Assassins (English Subtitled)', NULL, 2011, N'R', 125, N'MINUTES', N'125 min', N'In this thrilling samurai film, 13 warriors join forces to kill an evil tyrant pushing a nation to the brink of war. Facing suicidal odds, they must take on his deadly army in an epic fight to the death.'),
(8912, N's8912', N'MOVIE', N'Zero Tolerance', NULL, 2015, N'R', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'Scott Adkins and Dustin Nguyen star in this gritty action-packed story about two friends on a quest for vengeance, leaving carnage in their wake.'),
(8913, N's8913', N'MOVIE', N'White Girl Apokalypse', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 76, N'MINUTES', N'76 min', N'A basic white girl finds herself in the middle of the zombie apocalypse, forcing her to decide what is more important, survival or Starbucks? When she meets a group of survivors with conflicting personalities, tempers fly. In the apocalypse, humans pose more of a threat than the undead.'),
(8914, N's8914', N'MOVIE', N'Voices From a Locked Room', NULL, 1995, N'R', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A story about real life early 20th century British composer and music critic Philip Arnold Heseltine.'),
(8915, N's8915', N'MOVIE', N'The Disappearance of Vonnie', NULL, 1994, N'13+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'The true story of Corrine Kezmarek''s pursuit to solve the mysterious disappearance of her sister. Without a body, a weapon or any eyewitness, Corrine builds a convincing case of murder against her sister''s husband. The ensuing landmark case set new precedents in our judicial system.'),
(8916, N's8916', N'MOVIE', N'Swing Vote', NULL, 1999, N'13+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'The landmark U.S. Supreme Court case Roe v. Wade has been overturned and a woman stands convicted of murder after having an abortion. Now the Supreme Court must deliberate the controversial case, and the decision comes down to one new justice member, who''s the swing vote in this highly charged case.'),
(8917, N's8917', N'MOVIE', N'Split Images', NULL, 1992, N'13+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A journalist knows more about a grisly murder than is good for her. All her evidence points toward a mysterious millionaire but no one will believe her.'),
(8918, N's8918', N'MOVIE', N'Shades', NULL, 2016, N'16+', 72, N'MINUTES', N'72 min', N'Three young tourists buy a sunglass camera to record their trip to Los Angeles and get mixed up in a drug deal gone wrong.'),
(8919, N's8919', N'MOVIE', N'Sergei: Unplugged Cinema by Shailendra Singh', NULL, 2020, N'13+', 53, N'MINUTES', N'53 min', N'The world''s greatest ballet dancer, Sergei Polunin, as you''ve never seen him before - searching for answers, and himself. Raw, real, unplugged.'),
(8920, N's8920', N'MOVIE', N'Saravana', NULL, 2006, N'13+', 167, N'MINUTES', N'167 min', N'Saravana falls in love with his best friend Krishna''s sister, Sadhana. During the fight with rival thugs, he manages to save Sadhana, who watches her family perish before her eyes.'),
(8921, N's8921', N'MOVIE', N'Mitti', NULL, 2001, N'18+', 136, N'MINUTES', N'136 min', N'Deva, a villager, goes on a violent rampage to avenge his sister''s rape, and soon finds himself battling both the criminals responsible and the police.'),
(8922, N's8922', N'MOVIE', N'Life Is Tough, Eh Providence?', NULL, 1972, N'13+', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'In the Old West, bounty hunter Providence captures the bandit Hurricane Kid and sets him free multiple times to earn the reward in as many states as possible...'),
(8923, N's8923', N'MOVIE', N'Koch Brothers Exposed', NULL, 2014, N'16+', 56, N'MINUTES', N'56 min', N'Koch Brothers Exposed is a hard-hitting investigation of Charles and David Koch, two of the world''s richest and most powerful men, and how their billions and influence have changed the landscape of America.'),
(8924, N's8924', N'MOVIE', N'Kartha', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 112, N'MINUTES', N'112 min', N'Hero Venky and Actress Vaishu both are childhood friends. Vaishu brother will be murder by local Gunda Kattadhore as he taken deal from local minister for some valuable property. One day Venky and his friend will go to their friend Pinky''s birthday, while traveling Venky got to know that the reason behind Vaishu brother death. How he takes the revenge is the rest of the story.'),
(8925, N's8925', N'MOVIE', N'Kalavaani Mappillai (Hindi)', NULL, 2018, N'ALL', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'In order to marry the love of his life, Deva tries to hide the fact that he cannot drive a vehicle from his future mother-in-law.'),
(8926, N's8926', N'MOVIE', N'Inheritance', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'A young couple visits a property left from the late fathers'' estate. A haunted and disturbing past unravels. The main character has to overcome his personal issues and how to move forward.'),
(8927, N's8927', N'MOVIE', N'Haseena Maan Jaayegi', NULL, 1967, N'13+', 155, N'MINUTES', N'155 min', N'Two army officers, Kamal and Rakesh, are lookalikes. Rakesh plans to kill Kamal and woo his beautiful wife Archana. However, things don''t go as planned.'),
(8928, N's8928', N'MOVIE', N'Haitian Nights', NULL, 2013, N'R', 78, N'MINUTES', N'78 min', N'A woman comes up missing and a voodoo priest becomes the primary suspect.'),
(8929, N's8929', N'MOVIE', N'Guerillas in Pink Lace', NULL, 1964, N'13+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'An American expatriate gambler''s luck runs from bad to worse. 27 days after the attack on Pearl Harbor, Murphy has lost his fortune in a poker game, gets beaten up by some of his many creditors and is trapped in the Philippines during the Japanese invasion. So Murphy takes his place on a plane that gets shot down and he finds himself on an island with five women who were also on the plane.'),
(8930, N's8930', N'MOVIE', N'Girls Vs Gangsters', NULL, 2018, N'13+', 114, N'MINUTES', N'114 min', N'A bachelorette weekend spins hilariously out of control when three friends wake naked on a beach to find themselves handcuffed to a mysterious briefcase, with local gangsters in pursuit. They must retrace their steps if they hope to make it back home and to the altar.'),
(8931, N's8931', N'MOVIE', N'Gajendra', NULL, 2004, N'13+', 157, N'MINUTES', N'157 min', N'Gajendra, an orphan, is brought up by his wealthy master and soon is to marry the latter''s granddaughter. However, he also has a soft corner for a mentally deranged girl for reasons best known to him.'),
(8932, N's8932', N'MOVIE', N'Enclosed', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 188, N'MINUTES', N'188 min', N'Three freinds with different phases in marriage, regardless of their controversy, they came to one point of solution...'),
(8933, N's8933', N'MOVIE', N'Dead On', NULL, 1992, N'R', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Detective Sam Dietz is paired with a shady FBI agent to track down another serial killer terrorizing Los Angeles.'),
(8934, N's8934', N'MOVIE', N'Daily Qigong with Don Fiore - 20 minutes', NULL, 2019, N'ALL', 22, N'MINUTES', N'22 min', N'Join in 20 minutes of Daily Qigong with Don Fiore for beginners and seniors. These common Qigong movements are practiced around the world. Daily practice can help one''s overall health. Don uses easy instructions and gives benefits for each movement. Please modify any movements as needed. Don uses "mirror-imaging." His DVDs can be found on TaiChiHealthProducts. Copyright 2019. All rights reserved.'),
(8935, N's8935', N'MOVIE', N'Cult Following', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'Distinguished author and cult expert, Robert Regis and his newly hired cinematographer, Tyler Sternberg, find themselves in grave danger when they investigate a mythical, evil cult for a documentary they are attempting to make'),
(8936, N's8936', N'MOVIE', N'Come On Get Happy: The Partridge Family Story', NULL, 1999, N'13+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'Danny Bonaduce is a consulting producer on this telefilm that tells the story of how he and his fellow actors of the 1970s CTIT television show The Partridge Family were changed by the series'' success.'),
(8937, N's8937', N'MOVIE', N'American Drug War: The Last White Hope', NULL, 2011, N'18+', 118, N'MINUTES', N'118 min', N'With commentary from soldiers on both sides of the conflict, filmmaker Kevin Booth''s incisive documentary wades into the murky waters of the American war on drugs, the longest and costliest war in U.S. history.'),
(8938, N's8938', N'MOVIE', N'3 Pints and a Rabbi', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 73, N'MINUTES', N'73 min', N'When three dazed and confused strangers wake up in a pub to a dead woman lying on the table with three hefty chunks of flesh missing, they must figure out what happened to her in order to ensure they don''t meet the same fate.'),
(8939, N's8939', N'MOVIE', N'Tripwire', NULL, 1989, N'R', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'A terrorist (Warner) and an FBI agent (Knox) fight out a personal feud with one another.'),
(8940, N's8940', N'MOVIE', N'Three', NULL, 2016, N'16+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'When a police sting goes bad, a master criminal makes a desperate choice when he forces the cops to shoot him. Once there, he refuses treatment, instead waiting for his cohorts to break him out. Caught between an obsessed cop and the troubled surgeon assigned to save his life, the hospital is now a taught-and-tense situation that could turn into a bloody battleground at any moment.'),
(8941, N's8941', N'MOVIE', N'The Last Outlaw', NULL, 2014, N'13+', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'Johnny Ringo teams up with his nemesis Bat Masterson in order to stop a counterfeit Ringo from committing crimes in his name.'),
(8942, N's8942', N'TV_SHOW', N'Srugim', NULL, 2014, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Srugim is a drama series which deals with the life of religious bachelors from Jerusalem. The series offers a glance into the lives of intelligent and educated young males and females which can''t find their place in the existing religious frames.'),
(8943, N's8943', N'MOVIE', N'Sound! Euphonium: The Movie - Welcome To The Kitauji High School Concert Band', NULL, 2016, N'7+', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'A recap movie of the first season of Sound! Euphonium (2015).'),
(8944, N's8944', N'MOVIE', N'Red Water', NULL, 2003, N'R', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A group of oil workers being held hostage by a group of gangsters on a small oil rig are attacked by a freshwater bull shark.'),
(8945, N's8945', N'MOVIE', N'Me, Myself, and I', NULL, 1993, N'18+', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'A wild, romantic comedy about a woman with a split personality who falls for the down-and-out ladies'' man next door, and how, her two selves can''t decide whether to marry him or maim him.'),
(8946, N's8946', N'TV_SHOW', N'Landscape 101 with Ahmed Hassan', NULL, 2019, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'This is Home & Garden Pinterest in video form. Celebrity Landscaper Ahmed Hassan is a licensed and experienced horticulturalist with an eye for design. If you need ideas for your own backyard landscape, this is the place to get it. And while you''re at it, enjoy Ahmed just as you did when he hosted Yard Crashers on HGTV and DiY Network.'),
(8947, N's8947', N'MOVIE', N'Gauthamante Radham', NULL, 2020, N'ALL', 127, N'MINUTES', N'127 min', N'Gauthaman, an 18-year old car enthusiast, finds himself baffled in a situation where his dream ''first car'' arrives in the form of a cheap little, second hand Nano. When, his parents and grandmother happily welcome the car into their mediocre family and treats it like a family member, our hero''s life would now, never be the same.'),
(8948, N's8948', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Tormented', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira becomes paralyzed by a spider bite and is forced to watch "Tormented."'),
(8949, N's8949', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: The Werewolf Of Washington (2010)', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira decides to throw her "ring into the hat" and campaign for office. To improve election odds, she masquerades as Sarah Palin and accepts a phone call from the dreaded Breather.'),
(8950, N's8950', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: The Terror', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira mocks Roger Corman classic "The Terror" until she falls asleep.'),
(8951, N's8951', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: The Satanic Rites Of Dracula', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira decides that the film she''s hosting is so boring that she catches up on her reading and various personal chores.'),
(8952, N's8952', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: The Manster', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira tries to figure out a way to avoid being deported.'),
(8953, N's8953', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: The Killer Shrews', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 78, N'MINUTES', N'78 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark.'),
(8954, N's8954', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: The Giant Gila Monster', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira pet-sits six animals while hosting "The Giant Gila Monster," but complications quickly arise when the pets begin feasting upon each other.'),
(8955, N's8955', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: The Brain That Wouldn''t Die', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira prepares to compete on a game show while hosting "The Brain That Wouldn''t Die."'),
(8956, N's8956', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Teenagers From Outer Space', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira gets in touch with her inner child while hosting "Teenagers from Outer Space."'),
(8957, N's8957', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Scared To Death', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira prepares for her annual Halloween party by kidnapping Martha Stewart and holding her captive in a wooden crate.'),
(8958, N's8958', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Santa Claus Conquers The Martians', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira celebrates Christmas with a stop-motion animated segment, a variety of puppets, stockings stuffed with amputees'' legs, gingerdead men cookies and a special yuletide appearance by her longtime nemesis, The Breather.'),
(8959, N's8959', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Night Of The Living Dead', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira decides to clean out her basement, relaunch "Movie Macabre," and host "Night of the Living Dead."'),
(8960, N's8960', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Manos: The Hands Of Fate', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira tries to elevate the material by hosting Manos as if it were an episode of Masterpiece Theater.'),
(8961, N's8961', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Lady Frankenstein', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. The son Elvira never knew she had abruptly appears and tries to take over her show.'),
(8962, N's8962', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: I Eat Your Skin', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. While hosting "I Eat Your Skin," Elvira complains that there''s no actual flesh eating in the film, so she invents the I Eat Your Skin Diet and hawks Zombatrim pills.'),
(8963, N's8963', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Hercules And The Captive Women', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira''s stuck hosting this Greek tragedy about Hercules and his voyage to Atlantis to rescue his son and battle an army of identical men and a strange up-right dragon.'),
(8964, N's8964', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Eegah', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira celebrates the achievements of "Eegah" (or lack thereof) by honoring the film at the Elvie Awards.'),
(8965, N's8965', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Don''t Look In The Basement', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. While hosting "Don''t Look in the Basement," Elvira hears radio reports of a deranged killer on the loose in her neighborhood.'),
(8966, N's8966', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Beast From Haunted Cave', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark.'),
(8967, N's8967', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: Attack Of The Giant Leeches', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 77, N'MINUTES', N'77 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark.'),
(8968, N's8968', N'MOVIE', N'Elvira''s Movie Macabre: A Bucket Of Blood', NULL, 2011, N'16+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'A revamping, if you will, of the 1980''s classic horror movie showcase, hosted by Elvira, Mistress of the Dark. Elvira tries her hand at being an artist in a variety of mediums. Also, Breather presents the Mistress of the Dark with The Publisher''s Wet T-Shirt Contest Award.'),
(8969, N's8969', N'MOVIE', N'Children of the Night', NULL, 1991, N'R', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'A schoolteacher teams up with with a priest to stop a town being overrun by vampires.'),
(8970, N's8970', N'MOVIE', N'Chhoto Bou', NULL, 1988, N'13+', 136, N'MINUTES', N'136 min', N'Mamta, Tandra, and Deepa live with their mother-in-law, who likes Tandra as her husband earns the most. Mamta and Deepa take more care of her, yet she does not appreciate them, until she falls ill and the money for her operation is given by them.'),
(8971, N's8971', N'MOVIE', N'Blood Crime', NULL, 2002, N'R', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'A thriller about a cop who flees the big city with his wife for a better life in a small town. After making the move, the wife is brutally assaulted on the same night the son of the local sheriff is killed. The local officer and the big city cop are then forced to find the perpetrators together.'),
(8972, N's8972', N'TV_SHOW', N'You Are Wanted', N'2021-09-29', 2018, N'13+', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'In Season 2, a new nightmare begins for Lukas Franke. He loses his memory and control of Burning Man, a classified data collection program that everyone from intelligence agencies to international criminals, hackers and activists want to get their hands on. As a result, Lukas is forced on the run, his only chance at survival is retrieving Burning Man, the world’s most powerful cyber weapon.'),
(8973, N's8973', N'MOVIE', N'Two Cents From a Pariah', NULL, 2021, N'R', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'All is perfect for Donovan Strathmore, lifecoach to the rich and famous, until a mysterious figure emerges, threatening to reveal a hidden past. As he searches for clues, his life begins to unravel, culminating in an onslaught of public humiliation. Donovan is forced to reconcile secrets long buried, and confront the one person he''s spent his life running from.'),
(8974, N's8974', N'MOVIE', N'The Waterfall Murder', NULL, 2016, N'13+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'A young girl is found dead in a waterfall with a heart-shaped stone in her hand. The investigation leads to an esoteric cult: The Dragon Maiden.'),
(8975, N's8975', N'MOVIE', N'The Last Party', NULL, 1993, N'R', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Searching for answers about politics and government, Robert Downey Jr. takes to the streets to examine the 1992 presidential campaign from a youthful perspective.'),
(8976, N's8976', N'MOVIE', N'Tangerines', NULL, 2014, N'13+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'The war rages in Georgia, an Estonian man stays behind to harvest his crop of tangerines.The war arrives at his door.'),
(8977, N's8977', N'MOVIE', N'Reel Injun', NULL, 2010, N'13+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'Cree filmmaker Neil Diamond takes an entertaining and insightful look at the portrayal of North American Indigenous people throughout a century of cinema. Featuring hundreds of clips from old classics as well as recent releases, candid interviews with celebrities like Clint Eastwood, Robbie Robertson and Jim Jarmusch, the film traces the evolution of the Hollywood Indian.'),
(8978, N's8978', N'TV_SHOW', N'My Magic Pet Morphle - Adventures of Mila & Morphle', N'2021-09-29', 2021, N'ALL', 14, N'SEASONS', N'14 Seasons', N'Morphle can morph into anything his human companion Mila wants. From dinosaurs to cars, and animals like cats, dogs, and lions! Your kids will love these fun, and educational videos for kids! They will learn colors, shapes, numbers, the alphabet, and more!'),
(8979, N's8979', N'TV_SHOW', N'Message from Space Galactic Wars', NULL, 1978, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Centuries after the people of Earth master interstellar travel, humanity is thriving across the galaxy. But this all changes when the Gavanas Empire arrives, as the merciless despot Roxair XIII quickly conquers the 15th Solar System and enslaves all life there to his cause!'),
(8980, N's8980', N'TV_SHOW', N'Gamma smoke test', NULL, 2020, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'new season'),
(8981, N's8981', N'MOVIE', N'Chiara Ferragni: Unposted [English Dubbed]', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'[Dubbed in English. Original Version also available – search: Chiara Unposted Subbed] Chiara Ferragni, the first fashion influencer in the world, reveals how the digital revolution has disrupted the worlds of business, communication, fashion, and culture, through a portrait in which she''s the protagonist – both as a woman and as digital entrepreneur.'),
(8982, N's8982', N'MOVIE', N'Best Night Ever', NULL, 2014, N'R', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'Bride-to-be Claire, her sister Leslie, fun-loving Zoe, and quirky new friend Janet set off to Las Vegas for a one-night bachelorette party that turns out to be more than they bargained for.'),
(8983, N's8983', N'MOVIE', N'Zana', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Haunted by her long suppressed past and pressured by family to seek treatment from mystical healers for her infertility, a Kosovar woman struggles to reconcile the expectations of motherhood with a legacy of wartime brutality.'),
(8984, N's8984', N'TV_SHOW', N'When Hope Calls', NULL, 2019, N'TV-G', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Sisters Lillian and Grace establish an orphanage in Lillian''s hometown.'),
(8985, N's8985', N'MOVIE', N'What Have We Done to Deserve This?', NULL, 2018, N'13+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Wanda''s world has been turned upside down when her teenage daughter Nina suddenly turns up in a hijab. Nina has secretly converted to Islam.'),
(8986, N's8986', N'MOVIE', N'We Had it Coming', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'Anna looks to avenge her sister''s suicide to the hands of a dangerous Pimp. In the process, she encounters a mysterious female recruiter of younger more vulnerable girls.'),
(8987, N's8987', N'MOVIE', N'Two Worlds Colliding', NULL, 2004, N'13+', 49, N'MINUTES', N'49 min', N'When Night comes forward with his story of being dumped by two police officers in -20 C temperatures in a barren field on the city outskirts, he sets into motion a chain of events: a major RCMP investigation into several suspicious deaths, the conviction of the two constables who abandoned him and the reopening of an old case, leading to a judicial inquiry.'),
(8988, N's8988', N'MOVIE', N'TREASURE 8', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 6, N'MINUTES', N'6 min', N'From their headquarters in the Bay Area, Treasure 8 is aiming to revolutionise the global food system, using technology to reduce food waste, lower the cost of nutrition and increase food security worldwide. One of their technological approaches dehydrates food while maintaining most of its nutrients; not just cutting waste but reducing also emissions on shipping and lowering costs to consumers.'),
(8989, N's8989', N'MOVIE', N'The Wrong Path', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'A small town electrician with anger issues gets extreme therapy from a noted Pyschiatrist, Dr. Eric Poslowe, but is soon framed for a robbery and then a murder. Even with the help of Dr. Poslowe''s female assistant Bonnie, he soon learns to trust no one but himself and becomes entrapped in a web of deceit, greed and corruption.'),
(8990, N's8990', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Trouble with Maggie Cole', NULL, 2020, N'TV-14', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'When Maggie Cole tells a journalist far more details about the locals than he was counting on, she gets into hot water. Full of comedy, intrigue and suspense, this is a humorous yet cautionary tale about the perils of unfounded gossip.'),
(8991, N's8991', N'MOVIE', N'The Swindlers', NULL, 2017, N'16+', 117, N'MINUTES', N'117 min', N'High stakes and fast talk are the game in this crime caper where allies from different sides of the law must work together to trap the world''s most legendary con man.'),
(8992, N's8992', N'MOVIE', N'The Minis', NULL, 2007, N'13+', 76, N'MINUTES', N'76 min', N'A talented team of basketball players made up of little people enters a tournament to help a teammate''s son go to college.'),
(8993, N's8993', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Latino Americans', NULL, 2013, N'TV-PG', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Latino Americans chronicles the rich and varied history and experiences of Latinos, who have for the past 500-plus years helped shape what is today the United States. Narrated by Benjamin Bratt.'),
(8994, N's8994', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Hunter', NULL, 2020, N'TV-MA', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Italy and the mafia were at war in the early 1990s. Saverio Barone, a determined young prosecutor, steps in to fight for the innocents caught up in the carnage. Based on a true story. From Walter Presents, in Italian with English subtitles.'),
(8995, N's8995', N'MOVIE', N'The Boss and the Worker', NULL, 1975, N'7+', 104, N'MINUTES', N'104 min', N'Social/sexual farce focusing on a boss and his workers in a faucet factory.'),
(8996, N's8996', N'TV_SHOW', N'Terror Lake Drive', NULL, 2020, N'TV-MA', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'A single mother and her defiant teenager relocate to another city and end up moving into an ominous apartment complex.'),
(8997, N's8997', N'MOVIE', N'Tempest Eye', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'A man with amnesia is a suspect in a murder case, while the lead detective and his therapist are his only chance of freedom, he battles with mental health issues.'),
(8998, N's8998', N'TV_SHOW', N'Suspense', NULL, 2017, N'NR', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Each show features a different star or stars in this dramatic anthology produced by the successful team by Four Star Productions, there are many young actors that went onto bigger things.'),
(8999, N's8999', N'MOVIE', N'Steal This Movie', NULL, 2000, N'R', 108, N'MINUTES', N'108 min', N'A unique journey into the life of activist and radical Abbie Hoffman (Vincent D''Onofrio), as he battles for social justice and travels through the maze of music and politics that defined the late sixties and early seventies.'),
(9000, N's9000', N'MOVIE', N'Simha (Kannada)', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 120, N'MINUTES', N'120 min', N'Srimann Narayana is a college professor who''s hot-blooded by nature & doesn''t tolerate injustice. New student, Janaki joins his college & falls in love with him. Janaki has a violent past,which is closely linked to Srimann''s own past. Srimann Narayana''s grandmother narrates about his past, his father & his family. What is his past? How his past affects his present & how he clears his issues?');
INSERT INTO dbo.content (id, source_id, content_type, title, date_added, release_year, rating, duration_value, duration_unit, duration_text, description) VALUES
(9001, N's9001', N'MOVIE', N'Senior Entourage', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'A wild, wacky "Mockumentary" comedy featuring a zany, multi-racial cast ranging in age from 9 to 90. It''s "Seinfeld for seniors" starring Ed Asner, Helen Reddy, Charlie Robinson, Marion Ross and Mark Rydell.'),
(9002, N's9002', N'TV_SHOW', N'Roadkill Garage', NULL, 2017, N'TV-NR', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Roadkill Garage'),
(9003, N's9003', N'TV_SHOW', N'Pompon Little Bear', NULL, 2020, N'TV-Y', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Pompon is a six-year-old - in bear years. He is mischievous, cheerful, and playful. But above all things, he has an incredible and precious talent that his best friend Rita and his parents enjoy tremendously: he can make extra out of ordinary! Thanks to his imagination taking him on creative detours, growing day by day becomes child’s play!'),
(9004, N's9004', N'MOVIE', N'Open Door', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 78, N'MINUTES', N'78 min', N'Married Rudina sets off on a long journey with her pregnant sister, Elma, to meet their strict, traditional father in the Albanian village where they were born. As Rudina''s car makes its way across the mountains, Elma comes up with a plan to enlist an ex-classmate to play the part of her husband.'),
(9005, N's9005', N'MOVIE', N'One Step From Me', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'Tatiana is a journalist with a routine life in all its aspects and a recent failed love relationship. Motivated by her best friend, she decides to make a stop and travel around Costa Rica to find herself and inner peace.'),
(9006, N's9006', N'TV_SHOW', N'One Lane Bridge', NULL, 2020, N'NR', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'In this dark crime drama with a supernatural edge, a Māori detective reawakens his second sight while investigating the death of a man on a mysterious one-lane bridge.'),
(9007, N's9007', N'TV_SHOW', N'NOVA: The Planets', NULL, 2019, N'TV-PG', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'From the rocky inner worlds to the gas giants, every planet of our solar system has a fascinating story. Their extreme features give us clues to how the solar system formedâ€”and what hope there may be for life on other worlds.'),
(9008, N's9008', N'TV_SHOW', N'Murders in Vienna', NULL, 2016, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'The most vicious crimes in Vienna are investigated by an elite detective team.'),
(9009, N's9009', N'MOVIE', N'McCanick', NULL, 2014, N'R', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Set over the course of one day, a narcotics detective hunts for a seemingly harmless young criminal who knows a truth about the cop''s past.'),
(9010, N's9010', N'MOVIE', N'Martha of the North', NULL, 2009, N'13+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'In the mid-1950s, lured by false promises of a better life, Inuit families were displaced by the Canadian government and left to their own devices in the Far North. In this icy desert realm, Martha Flaherty and her family lived through one of Canadian history''s most sombre and little-known episodes.'),
(9011, N's9011', N'TV_SHOW', N'Manhunt', NULL, 2019, N'TV-NR', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Martin Clunes (Doc Martin) stars in this true-crime drama as DCI Colin Sutton, the lead detective on a case that captivated Britain. When a young French woman is killed in London, the investigation yields no forensics, motive, or witnesses. But when Sutton connects the crime to two other murders, he realizes he must hunt down a serial killer. “Clunes is a revelation” -The Telegraph (UK).'),
(9012, N's9012', N'MOVIE', N'Life on the Rocks', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'Five Directors tell Five Stories. We meet their "characters" at a local bar - where they find love, misfortune and redemption.'),
(9013, N's9013', N'MOVIE', N'Let Me Be Frank', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'A young rapper moves to Los Angeles in search of stardom and instead finds an unlikely friend in his dispirited apartment manager whose dreams led him to the same city twenty years prior.'),
(9014, N's9014', N'MOVIE', N'LEGO Monkie Kid: A Hero Is Born', NULL, 2021, N'7+', 45, N'MINUTES', N'45 min', N'After the release of the Demon Bull King, MK accidentally grabs Monkey King''s magical staff and goes on a journey to return the staff to Monkey King'),
(9015, N's9015', N'TV_SHOW', N'Last Frontier', NULL, 1932, N'TV-NR', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Newspaper reporter Kirby battles Tiger Morris, the outlaw, who is looking to drive away settlers by stirring up trouble with Indians in an attempt to claim a gold deposit on his own. With the help of General Custer though, he is able to come out on top. Starring: Lon Chaney jr, Dorothy Gulliver'),
(9016, N's9016', N'TV_SHOW', N'Killer Kids', NULL, 2013, N'TV-14', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Killer Kids provides an in-depth examination of kids who kill. What were the warning signs? What drives a young person to commit criminal acts and even murder?'),
(9017, N's9017', N'MOVIE', N'JJ Barrows: Doodle All Day', NULL, 2019, N'7+', 33, N'MINUTES', N'33 min', N'JJ Barrows was raised in South Carolina as the middle child of a preacher''s family. Having always felt a little different, JJ uses humor to navigate through the realities of life, being single through her thirties, and adjusting to life changes brought about by age, a cross country move, and eventually.'),
(9018, N's9018', N'MOVIE', N'Jeff Allen: I Can Laugh About it Now', NULL, 2019, N'7+', 42, N'MINUTES', N'42 min', N'Jeff Allen combines clean, hilarious humor like no other comedian working today. Besides performing at corporate functions and fundraisers, he regularly appears on television, radio, and casinos across the country.'),
(9019, N's9019', N'TV_SHOW', N'Hightown', NULL, 2020, N'TV-MA', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Set in beautiful but bleak Cape Cod, Hightown follows one woman''s journey to sobriety, overshadowed by an unfolding murder investigation.'),
(9020, N's9020', N'MOVIE', N'Halloween Heroes', NULL, 2021, N'7+', 77, N'MINUTES', N'77 min', N'When a group of teens become magically infused with the powers of their Halloween costumes, they band together to investigate several local spooky legends. Will these haunted folk tales wind up getting the better of them?'),
(9021, N's9021', N'MOVIE', N'Finding Dawn', NULL, 2006, N'13+', 74, N'MINUTES', N'74 min', N'Filmmaker Christine Welsh brings us a compelling documentary that puts a human face on a national tragedy -the epidemic of missing or murdered Indigenous women in Canada. The film takes a journey into the heart of these women''s experience, from Vancouver''s skid row, down the Highway of Tears in northern BC, and on to Saskatoon, where the murders and disappearances of these women remain unsolved.'),
(9022, N's9022', N'MOVIE', N'Eddie Izzard: Dress To Circle', NULL, 2002, N'18+', 56, N'MINUTES', N'56 min', N'A one-hour rough-cut of Eddie Izzard''s Dress To Kill show in Paris (spoken in French). Previously released on the Dress To Kill DVD.'),
(9023, N's9023', N'TV_SHOW', N'Couple of Mirrors', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'You Yi is a younger, innocent, and type-hearted socialite and a successful creator, residing with anyone''s adoration and envy. Her ideal lifestyles is grew to become upside-down while she discovers a betrayal by way of the two most trusted human beings in her existence. With no one left to turn to, she unearths safe haven in the friendship and guide of Yan Wei.'),
(9024, N's9024', N'TV_SHOW', N'Cities of the Underworld', NULL, 2008, N'TV-PG', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'*Season 1 included with Prime until 10/31* Descend hundreds of feet below the streets to explore the remnants of past civilizations.'),
(9025, N's9025', N'MOVIE', N'Chinese Speaking Vampires', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'A desperate actor becomes a vampire and uses his new powers to land a movie role and the girl, but then must choose between life and the undead.'),
(9026, N's9026', N'MOVIE', N'Cerebrum', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 121, N'MINUTES', N'121 min', N'To make ends meet, Tom signs on as a guinea pig at a home-based lab, but when he commits a crime he cannot remember, he must risk his own sanity to reveal the truth.'),
(9027, N's9027', N'MOVIE', N'BoBoiBoy: Elemental Heroes', NULL, 2021, N'7+', 116, N'MINUTES', N'116 min', N'BoBoiBoy and his friends have been attacked by a villain named Retak''ka who is the original user of BoBoiBoy''s elemental powers. He seeks to take back his elemental powers from BoBoiBoy to become the most powerful person and dominate the galaxy. Together with his friends, BoBoiBoy must find a way to defeat Retak''ka before his powers fall into the wrong hands.'),
(9028, N's9028', N'MOVIE', N'Blunderpuss', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 74, N'MINUTES', N'74 min', N'Mike Bruton is a clown with a drinking problem. Seriously – a real clown. Eager to pick up where he left off after a stint in rehab, Mike hops on his unicycle and takes off on an apology tour, starting with a visit to his childhood home in New Jersey and ending up in Brooklyn. Mike soon realizes that not everyone is ready to forgive him and his best bet at a life in recovery is to start small.'),
(9029, N's9029', N'MOVIE', N'Blue Call', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'AN lEMT suffering from PTSD Spends her days making split second decisions with lives that hang in the balance. One night on a routine call, she is faced with a moral decision, taking matters into her own hands and mercy kills a young woman. Now, falling deeper and deeper into a rabbit hole, she gets caught up in a world of underground drugs and a sadistic killer who''s made her his next victim.'),
(9030, N's9030', N'MOVIE', N'Blind Ghost', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A blind young woman receives an experimental surgery to restore her vision which also conjures dark spirits.'),
(9031, N's9031', N'MOVIE', N'Bicycle Kick', NULL, 2013, N'13+', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'When a football coach meets a gifted footballer who could not make his mark on the sport due to an unforeseen trauma, he decides to find a way to get the young man back into the game.'),
(9032, N's9032', N'TV_SHOW', N'Beau Séjour', NULL, 2017, N'TV-MA', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'After Kato wakes up in Hotel Beau Séjour and finds her own dead body in the bathtub, she realizes she’s only visible to a few select people. Do they hold the key to her murder or will dark secrets get in the way?'),
(9033, N's9033', N'MOVIE', N'Battered', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 44, N'MINUTES', N'44 min', N'After Piper''s alcoholic boyfriend sends her to the hospital, she joins a group of battered women who decide to kill their exes, only to discover that these guys won''t go down without a fight.'),
(9034, N's9034', N'MOVIE', N'American Masters: Raul Julia: The World''s a Stage', NULL, 2019, N'NR', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'Raúl Juliá: The World’s A Stage examines the life and career of entertainer Raúl Juliá. The documentary is a revealing portrait of the actor, who earned recognition for his versatility on stage and on screen.'),
(9035, N's9035', N'MOVIE', N'All Creatures Here Below', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'Gensan (David Dastmalchian) and Ruby (Karen Gillan) struggle in the face of poverty which is made worse when Gensan loses his job. Forced to break the law to make ends meet, he sets out on the run with Ruby across the country hoping to finally find their freedom.'),
(9036, N's9036', N'TV_SHOW', N'Alf: The Animated Series', N'2021-09-30', 1988, N'TV-Y', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'When the evil Larson Petty returns to invade the planet, Gordon becomes an unlikely ally and helps Melmac.'),
(9037, N's9037', N'MOVIE', N'Adrift in Soho', NULL, 2020, N'NR', 108, N'MINUTES', N'108 min', N'A philosopher and a group of filmmakers begin a new era. Soho in the 1950s where the seeds of the 1960s were sown. Adrift In Soho takes an uncompromising look at what really happened in the decade where it all began.'),
(9038, N's9038', N'MOVIE', N'Adam and Evelyn', NULL, 2018, N'18+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'An East German couple is looking for their way of life after the political situation drastically changes by the fall of the Wall in 1989. Adam and Evelyn have to decide in which world - Eastern or Western - they want to live in order to find a happy life.'),
(9039, N's9039', N'MOVIE', N'Acting Out', NULL, 1980, N'18+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'Before the dawn of reality T. V., the film Acting Out showed everyday people revealing their most private fantasies. Ten people were selected after answering an ad in Gallery Magazine. From there, they were provided with a naked cast, a private setting and film crew. In front of the cameras and without a script, they were given the opportunity to "act out" their sexually deviant dreams.'),
(9040, N's9040', N'TV_SHOW', N'13 Ghosts of Scooby-Doo!', NULL, 1985, N'TV-NR', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Hunt for ghosts with super sleuths Daphne, Shaggy and Scooby-Doo, because 13 of the world''s meanest ghosts are on the loose! Joined by Flim-Flam, a pint-sized fast-talking magician/con artist, and guided by the world''s greatest mystic, Vincent van Ghoul (voiced by Vincent Price), the gang causes mayhem hunting ghosts around the world. Don''t be scared!'),
(9041, N's9041', N'MOVIE', N'Write to Kill', NULL, 1991, N'R', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'A writer is framed for murder while investigating his brother''s death.'),
(9042, N's9042', N'MOVIE', N'Windcroft', NULL, 2007, N'18+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'On a remote farm in the sweeping hills of Pennsylvania, three lives are torn apart by love, abandonment, deception and murder. After the death of his father, John and his new wife, Diane, arrive to claim the estate - but, John''s father bequeathed to him more than just the family farm, and he is forced to face a heritage of madness and violence.'),
(9043, N's9043', N'MOVIE', N'What Makes a Family', NULL, 2001, N'13+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'Based on a true story of two women who form a partnership and eventually have a child. When the biological mother is stricken with a fatal disease, her partner discovers she has no legal rights to the child. This heartwarming story examines our cultural and legal perceptions of what makes a family.'),
(9044, N's9044', N'MOVIE', N'What Is My Name', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'17-year-old Muscovites Olya and Sasha go to Crimea to meet Olya''s father Sergei. Sergei has lived all his life in a small seaside village and has never seen his only daughter. On the threshold of his house, Olya is frightened of the upcoming meeting and asks Sasha to "change places." Sasha introduces herself as Olya, that is, her daughter, and Olya pretends to be her friend.'),
(9045, N's9045', N'MOVIE', N'Viyabari', NULL, 2007, N'18+', 163, N'MINUTES', N'163 min', N'Suryaprakash, an ambitious businessman, wishes to accumulate a lot of wealth for himself. He asks a scientist to clone him to replace him at home, while he gives his time to his business.'),
(9046, N's9046', N'MOVIE', N'Vivaramana Aalu', NULL, 2002, N'ALL', 153, N'MINUTES', N'153 min', N'Mayilsamy, a thief, deserts his wife Pappu when he meets a rich woman. When he realises his mistake, he comes back to Pappu and must win her trust once again.'),
(9047, N's9047', N'TV_SHOW', N'Vir the robot boy', NULL, 2012, N'7+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Dr. Prem Sahay, a noted scientist in the field of robotics, invents an Artificial Intelligence Robot, named Vir which is more human-like and has a strong emotional quotient and heightened empathy factor. Vir along with Dr. Prem Sahay lives in Fursatganj. Intelligent, smart, fun-loving & generous are the qualities that best describe Vir.'),
(9048, N's9048', N'MOVIE', N'Uptown Girls', NULL, 2003, N'PG-13', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Molly Gunn (Brittany Murphy, Clueless) is the freewheeling daughter of a late rock legend, and the toast of the New York City social scene. But when her inheritance is stolen, Molly is forced to do something she''s never done before – she''s forced to get a job. Molly becomes a nanny to a precocious little girl, who is "eight going on forty."'),
(9049, N's9049', N'MOVIE', N'Untamed Heart', NULL, 1993, N'PG-13', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Two of today''s hottest young actors, Christian Slater and Marisa Tomei, star in this tender romance about lonely souls destined to find one another. Co-starring Rosie Perez.'),
(9050, N's9050', N'MOVIE', N'Unsurety', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'Olivia Moore is a broken, hardworking, single parent who supports her daughter by running an outpatient clinic, where she is reconnected with ex-NFL player Corey Mack As Olivia makes efforts to allow her heart to be mended by Corey, adversity settles in.'),
(9051, N's9051', N'MOVIE', N'Universal Soldier', NULL, 1992, N'R', 104, N'MINUTES', N'104 min', N'Luc Devreaux (Jean-Claude Van Damme) and Sgt. Andrew Scott (Dolph Lundgren) are two soldiers who kill each other in Vietnam and are brought back to life 25 years later for a secret government program.'),
(9052, N's9052', N'MOVIE', N'Tuck Jagadish (Tamil)', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 145, N'MINUTES', N'145 min', N'When a doting elder brother has a dispute with the younger one over the inheritance, the latter tries to establish peace and keep the family together.'),
(9053, N's9053', N'MOVIE', N'Troll', NULL, 1986, N'PG-13', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'When an evil troll named Torok attempts to bring about cataclysmic changes that will forever erase mankind, an ancient sorceress and a young boy join forces to stop him before he can carry out his diabolical plan.'),
(9054, N's9054', N'MOVIE', N'Topkapi', NULL, 1964, N'7+', 120, N'MINUTES', N'120 min', N'Peter Ustinov won an Oscar for Best Supporting Actor in director Jules Dassin''s lighthearted thriller about five thieves (including Melina Mercouri, Maximilian Schell and Robert Morley) who undertake an "absolutely impossible" grand theft in Istanbul.'),
(9055, N's9055', N'MOVIE', N'Things You Can Tell Just By Looking At Her', NULL, 2001, N'PG-13', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'Set in Los Angeles, tells five loosely related stories about the loves and losses in the lives of five women.'),
(9056, N's9056', N'MOVIE', N'The Whereabouts of Jenny', NULL, 1991, N'13+', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'This powerful, heart-wrenching story about Jimmy O''Meara (Ed O''Neill), who discovers that his ex-wife has married an ex-drug dealer turned government informer, making him eligible for the witness relocation program. With his daughter in mind, Jimmy is determined to find the whereabouts of Jenny.'),
(9057, N's9057', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Village', NULL, 2014, N'TV-14', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'The story of 20th century England is played out through a family in a Derbyshire village.'),
(9058, N's9058', N'MOVIE', N'The Thing (2011)', NULL, 2011, N'R', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'HD. A team of scientists uncover a shape-shifting monster in remote Antarctica in this prequel to John Carpenter''s ''The Thing.'''),
(9059, N's9059', N'MOVIE', N'The Squid And The Whale', NULL, 2005, N'R', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'In his third feature, director Noah Baumbach scores a triumph with an autobiographical coming-of-age story about a teenager whose writer-parents are divorcing. The father (Jeff Daniels) and mother (Laura Linney) duke it out in half-civilized, half-savage fashion, while their two sons adapt in different ways, shifting allegiances between parents. The film is squirmy-funny and nakedly honest ab..'),
(9060, N's9060', N'MOVIE', N'The Sneak Over', NULL, 2021, N'7+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'It''s the summer before fifth grade and Henry Hudson hasn''t found his place in the world. Then he meets a group of immature film geeks who give him the courage to lead a battle against the neighborhood bullies and finally become one of the guys.'),
(9061, N's9061', N'MOVIE', N'The Rookies', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'Extreme sport lover Zhou Feng got involved in an international illegal trade by accident. So he had to follow an international special agent Bruce to Budapest.'),
(9062, N's9062', N'MOVIE', N'The Rage: Carrie 2', NULL, 1999, N'R', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'Rachel (Emily Bergl) is a high school misfit who gets caught in the middle of a prank orchestrated by a group of jocks a prank that turns deadly.'),
(9063, N's9063', N'MOVIE', N'The Pudgie Movie', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 41, N'MINUTES', N'41 min', N'A hilarious inner city comedy about a young man trying to fit in.'),
(9064, N's9064', N'MOVIE', N'The Outer Darkness', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 22, N'MINUTES', N'22 min', N'On Friday evenings in Lynnsmouth Community Centre, meets a group led by Father Jonathan Crowe. Together they share their stories - tales of strange occurrences, horrific events and bizarre encounters that have scarred their lives. Tonight, a young tormented woman called Jenny will share a story of her experience with a game of chance that sealed the fate of her family... Presented by ALTER.'),
(9065, N's9065', N'MOVIE', N'The Organization', NULL, 1971, N'PG-13', 108, N'MINUTES', N'108 min', N'The dangerous world of international heroin trafficking is exposed in this elaborate and suspenseful crime thriller which reprises Sidney Poitier''s role as Lt. Virgil Tibbs.'),
(9066, N's9066', N'MOVIE', N'The Midnight After', NULL, 2014, N'16+', 121, N'MINUTES', N'121 min', N'On a night just like any other, a minibus full of passengers drives through a tunnel and arrives in another dimension; the eclectic group of passengers seek refuge in a deserted cafe and make a horrific discovery.'),
(9067, N's9067', N'MOVIE', N'The Michelle Apartments', NULL, 1995, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A straight-laced tax man (Henry Czerny) sent to audit the crooked books of a small town chemical company gets intertwined with lust and corruption when drawn to a seductress (Mary Elizabeth Rubens), her violent husband (Daniel Kash), and other weird tenants of Michelle Apartments.'),
(9068, N's9068', N'MOVIE', N'The Life Aquatic with Steve Zissou', NULL, 2004, N'R', 119, N'MINUTES', N'119 min', N'An oceanographer sets out after the shark that killed his partner.'),
(9069, N's9069', N'MOVIE', N'The Joyriders', NULL, 1999, N'PG-13', 101, N'MINUTES', N'101 min', N'A suicidal older man, Gordon Trout, is kidnapped for his car and money by three runaway teenagers who live on the streets. Their experiences together make them a close-knit family, but the nature of the crime committed could tear them apart. The intricacies of these complex relationships are explored through an emotional story with twists and turns.'),
(9070, N's9070', N'MOVIE', N'The Grudge 2', NULL, 2006, N'PG-13', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Acclaimed producers Sam Raimi, Rob Tapert and Taka Ichise have re-teamed with director Takashi Shimizu and screenwriter Stephen Susco to present this heart-stopping sequel to the smash-hit thriller, The Grudge.'),
(9071, N's9071', N'MOVIE', N'The Great Train Robbery', NULL, 1979, N'PG', 111, N'MINUTES', N'111 min', N'Sean Connery, Donald Sutherland and Lesley-Anne Down star in this true-life action thriller, based on director/screenwriter Michael Crichton''s best-selling novel, about a daring gold heist that shocked Victorian society.'),
(9072, N's9072', N'MOVIE', N'The Great Hypnotist', NULL, 2014, N'16+', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Ren sees dead people, and it''s driving her mad. She''s also demonstrating psychic abilities, but psychiatrist Xu Ruining thinks it''s a hoax, and his radical new therapy could uncover the truth - through experimental hypnosis.'),
(9073, N's9073', N'MOVIE', N'The Graduate', NULL, 1967, N'PG', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'Hollywood darlings Dustin Hoffman, Anne Bancroft and Katharine Ross create one outrageous love triangle in this groundbreaking American film classic.'),
(9074, N's9074', N'MOVIE', N'The Forest Killer', NULL, 2014, N'13+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A young police detective is assigned to a brutal murder case in her hometown. When her brother becomes the prime suspect, she is forced to confront the demons of her past.'),
(9075, N's9075', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Dream Motel', NULL, 2019, N'7+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Guests at The Dream Motel find themselves face to face with their past, their future, and their present. All things are possible for the guests of The Dream Motel.'),
(9076, N's9076', N'MOVIE', N'The Crocodile Hunter: Collision Course', NULL, 2002, N'PG', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'Aussie adventurer Steve Irwin – a.k.a. "The Crocodile Hunter" – has avoided the death-roll and nabbed another feisty croc, hoping to save it from poachers. What Steve doesn''t know is that the crocodile has innocently swallowed a top secret U.S. satellite beacon, and the poachers are actually American special agents sent to retrieve it. Crikey!'),
(9077, N's9077', N'MOVIE', N'The Comedy of Terrors', NULL, 1964, N'7+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'Vincent Price stars as Waldo Trumbull, a lazy New England funeral parlor owner, who blackmails Peter Lorre into helping him increase business by killing people. Price meets resistance from his landlord (Basil Rathbone), wife and senile old father-in-law (Boris Karloff).'),
(9078, N's9078', N'MOVIE', N'The Burning Bed', NULL, 1984, N'13+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'A battered wife sets her husband on fire one night after living with his beatings and humiliations for years.'),
(9079, N's9079', N'MOVIE', N'The Brain (1988)', NULL, 1988, N'R', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'With the help of an alien organism, a man brainwashes audiences through television; a troubled high school student is determined to stop them.'),
(9080, N's9080', N'MOVIE', N'The Boat', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'A solo sailor is locked inside the head of a sailboat which is under steam on autopilot.'),
(9081, N's9081', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Best of I Love Lucy', NULL, 1954, N'TV-PG', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'The Best of I Love Lucy (Volume 2) contains many classic episodes from seasons two and three of I Love Lucy. The show welcomes Lucy and Ricardos baby in ''Lucy Goes To The Hospital.'' In ''The Camping Trip'' Lucy and Ethel insist on going with Ricky and Fred to their camping trip. And other classic episodes such as the gang not believing Lucy can''t go a day without lying in ''Lucy Tells the Truth.'''),
(9082, N's9082', N'MOVIE', N'The Best Exotic Marigold Hotel', NULL, 2012, N'PG-13', 124, N'MINUTES', N'124 min', N'British pensioners on a tight budget move to a retirement home in india; their adventures there giving them a new lease on life.'),
(9083, N's9083', N'MOVIE', N'The Bad News Bears (1976)', NULL, 2021, N'NR', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'A beer-guzzling ex-minor leaguer reluctantly agrees to coach a bunch of clumsy, misfit Little League baseball players to compete for a high-stakes championship in California.'),
(9084, N's9084', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Alchemists', NULL, 1999, N'TV-14', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'A fast-paced thriller based on Peter James'' best-selling novel set in the chilling world of genetic engineering.'),
(9085, N's9085', N'MOVIE', N'That Day We Sang', NULL, 2014, N'13+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'This musical rooted in Manchester in 1969 tells the story of two lonely middle-aged people who are able to grab a second chance at life, reconnected to their emotions by the power of music.'),
(9086, N's9086', N'MOVIE', N'Terror in a Texas Town', NULL, 1958, N'7+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'A greedy financier and a gang of gunmen force people to sell land.'),
(9087, N's9087', N'MOVIE', N'Ten Minutes to Midnight', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 73, N'MINUTES', N'73 min', N'A veteran late night radio host on the eve of forced retirement is trapped inside the station after being bitten by a rabid bat while her mysterious replacement follows her every move.'),
(9088, N's9088', N'MOVIE', N'Taller Than The Trees', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'A man embarks on a mysterious journey deep into the wilderness in search of the one thing he''s been studying his entire life. Meanwhile, his daughter knows something he doesn''t and is in pursuit to track him down and stop him from the point of no return.'),
(9089, N's9089', N'MOVIE', N'Taken', NULL, 2009, N'PG-13', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'When his estranged daughter is kidnapped in Paris, a former spy (Liam Neeson) sets out to find her at any cost. Relying on his special skills, he tracks down the ruthless gang that abducted her and launches a one-man war to bring them to justice and rescue his daughter.'),
(9090, N's9090', N'MOVIE', N'Swimming for Gold', NULL, 2020, N'UNRATED', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'A US women’s swim team Olympic hopeful suffers an injury that forces her to put aside her dreams and help the Australian men’s swim team get competition ready.'),
(9091, N's9091', N'MOVIE', N'Summer Rebels', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Jonas wants to visit his cool grandpa for a summer of fun on the river, but his mom has other plans. Undeterred, Jonas takes off on an adventure of his own in this tale of rebellion, friendship, catastrophe and, ultimately, redemption.'),
(9092, N's9092', N'MOVIE', N'Sugar Hill', NULL, 1974, N'PG', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'Pray you never cross a woman out for revenge and her squad of zombie hitmen! When a nightclub entrepreneur gets taken out by the mob, his girlfriend, Diana "Sugar" Hill, calls upon the voodoo high priest Baron Samedi to summon up the undead to carry out an unholy plan for revenge. Packed with horror, action, and loads of 70s funk, "Sugar Hill" will slay you! Starring Robert Quarry and Zara Cully.'),
(9093, N's9093', N'MOVIE', N'Sudden Terror: The Hijacking of Schoolbus 17', NULL, 1996, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A chilling story of a courageous school bus driver''s nerve shattering ordeal confronting a deranged hijacker who seizes command of her busload of mentally challenged youngsters. Meanwhile, Lt. Kathy Leone and Lt. Dominick Caroselli attempt to stay one step ahead of the hijacker''s lethal plan and plot the rescue of the hostages.'),
(9094, N's9094', N'MOVIE', N'Stormy Weathers', NULL, 1992, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Samantha "Sam" Weathers, armed with a black belt in karate and a wisecracking view of life, is a police officer''s daughter, who has a love for L.A.''s opulence, tempered with a knowledge of its lethal undercurrents. Things start to sizzle when an Italian aristocrat hires her to track down a missing relative.'),
(9095, N's9095', N'MOVIE', N'Still of the Night', NULL, 1982, N'PG', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'Roy Scheider and Meryl Streep star in a highly charged, Hitchcock- inspired murder mystery set among New York''s chic world of high- rolling antique brokers. Co-stars Jessica Tandy.'),
(9096, N's9096', N'TV_SHOW', N'Steve and Maggie - Magical Maggie Madness', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Come along with Steve and Maggie in this special Magical Maggie Madness series! Watch as Maggie uses her Magic to play tricks on Steve! This show includes funny videos where Maggie plays hide and seek with teddy bear and the royal family, does funny animal magic, and shrinks Steve! Join in on the fun and learn about your farm animals, sweet foods, using the potty, and more!'),
(9097, N's9097', N'MOVIE', N'Stargate', NULL, 1994, N'PG-13', 121, N'MINUTES', N'121 min', N'When an ancient Egyptian artifact is discovered, two men unlock its secret power as a portal through time and space.'),
(9098, N's9098', N'MOVIE', N'Starblack', NULL, 1966, N'13+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'Starblack is a hero who dresses in black and his face is covered by a black scarf and he carries in his shirt a black star, which he always leaves at the scene of his enterprises, as a symbol of justice.'),
(9099, N's9099', N'MOVIE', N'Squirm', NULL, 1976, N'PG', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'During the worst electrical storm in the history of a small fishing village in Georgia, a power line topples near a worm farm and electro- cutes the bugs. The electrified worms turn into man-eaters, devouring everything in their path!'),
(9100, N's9100', N'MOVIE', N'Snow', NULL, 2006, N'13+', 68, N'MINUTES', N'68 min', N'Isolated in the vast oil fields of the Canadian North is a tiny town of Zama, with a population of only two hundred. The cold, the darkness and the isolation effect each one in different ways, where sometimes the distinction between what is real and surreal disappear.'),
(9101, N's9101', N'MOVIE', N'Sleepaway Camp II: Unhappy Campers', NULL, 1988, N'R', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'The grisly murders that terrorized Camp Arawak have become favorite ghost stories around Camp Rolling Hills six years later. As each of the campers learn the secrets about the murders, their carefree days at summer camp come to an end.'),
(9102, N's9102', N'MOVIE', N'Sign of the Gladiator', NULL, 1959, N'16+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Zenobia, Queen of Palmira, revolts against Rome and defeats the Roman troops but she makes a big mistake when she falls in love with enemy officer Marco Valerio.'),
(9103, N's9103', N'MOVIE', N'Shots Fired', NULL, 2015, N'18+', 124, N'MINUTES', N'124 min', N'An action-packed comedy about two opposite detectives, forced to work together. Kevin, a burned out, thrill-seeker, has cost the city millions. Marcus, a weed-smoking, alcoholic who''s had his uncle/captain, reprimanded him on several occasions. Both these men have differences but they somehow work with each other to solve the biggest case of their careers.'),
(9104, N's9104', N'MOVIE', N'She Never Died', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'Lacey, a socially detached loner is cursed with immortality and a never-ending tedium of existence. In her attempts to keep her compulsions in check, she seeks out the darkest souls humanity has to offer. Lacey must now face her own inner demons while simultaneously finding her next meal.'),
(9105, N's9105', N'TV_SHOW', N'Secret of the Sword', NULL, 1991, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'A high-flying martial arts chase for an ancient document which can unlock the Secret of the Sword, which is rumored to give the possessor the ultimate Kung-Fu power.'),
(9106, N's9106', N'MOVIE', N'Sea Ghost', NULL, 2004, N'16+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'A secret drilling platform in the Gulf of Mexico retrieves a dormant alien creature from the bottom of the ocean. It soon awakens and goes on a telepathic rampage.'),
(9107, N's9107', N'MOVIE', N'Scream and Scream Again', NULL, 1970, N'PG-13', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'A deranged scientist, seeking to create a race of super humans by means of organic transplant, commits a series of brutal murders in order to utilize the bodies. Screen and horror legends Vincent Price, Christopher Lee and Peter Cushing star!'),
(9108, N's9108', N'MOVIE', N'Scorpio', NULL, 1973, N'PG', 115, N'MINUTES', N'115 min', N'In a chilling scenario of international espionage and intrigue, Burt Lancaster and Alain Delon star as two adversaries, one a C.I.A. agent, the other a French assassin hired to kill him.'),
(9109, N's9109', N'MOVIE', N'Scarecrows', NULL, 1988, N'R', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'Five crooks rob an army base payroll and kidnap a pilot and his daughter, who are forced to fly them to Mexico. One crook parachutes out with the money – followed closely by the others. All five land in a mysterious, abandoned graveyard at night, where they are terrorized by ghouls.'),
(9110, N's9110', N'MOVIE', N'Saving Mr. Wu', NULL, 2015, N'18+', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'Four devious criminals, one chilling scam: pose as cops, kidnap a victim, and if no ransom comes in 24 hours, the target dies. Tonight they caught a movie star (Andy Lau) and the countdown begins.'),
(9111, N's9111', N'MOVIE', N'Salvador', NULL, 1986, N'R', 123, N'MINUTES', N'123 min', N'Compelling drama based on the real experiences of journalist Richard Boyle in strife-ridden El Salvador in 1980-81.'),
(9112, N's9112', N'MOVIE', N'Saginaw Trail', NULL, 1953, N'13+', 56, N'MINUTES', N'56 min', N'Gene Autry is sent to investigate the murders of settlers with the help of Smiley Burnette and two young homesteaders. Gene soon discovers that rich fur trader is behind the staged Indian raids.'),
(9113, N's9113', N'MOVIE', N'Rugrats Go Wild', NULL, 2003, N'PG', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'The Rugrats get tangled in an exotic adventure, where they''re helped by the Thornberrys, a family that travels the world making nature documentaries.'),
(9114, N's9114', N'MOVIE', N'Rolling Thunder', NULL, 1996, N'18+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'The greatest team ever, is assembled to fight the dark forces threatening our lives, our country and our world. A highly secretive, officially nonexistent unit of well-trained warriors, Roling Thunder, combines top technological know-how and high-tech equipment with superior brainpower and military might to seek out trouble and eliminite it - once and for all.'),
(9115, N's9115', N'MOVIE', N'Rival', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Nine-year-old Roman follows his mother Oksana to Germany where she is working illegally. She is living there with the 62-year-old widower Gert who suffers from diabetes. Gert tries to make friends with the boy, but Roman struggles for his mother''s attention. When Oksana suddenly falls ill, Roman is left alone with his rival.'),
(9116, N's9116', N'MOVIE', N'Resident Evil: Retribution (4K UHD)', NULL, 2012, N'R', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'A sequel to "Resident Evil: Afterlife 3D".'),
(9117, N's9117', N'MOVIE', N'Resident Evil: Retribution', NULL, 2012, N'R', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'A sequel to "Resident Evil: Afterlife 3D".'),
(9118, N's9118', N'MOVIE', N'Ratter', NULL, 2016, N'R', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'A beautiful graduate student (Benson) falls prey to an insidious cyber-stalker, watching every moment from the all-seeing eyes of her phone, laptop and television.'),
(9119, N's9119', N'MOVIE', N'Raising Arizona', NULL, 1987, N'PG-13', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'A couple help themselves to another family''s quintuplets,'),
(9120, N's9120', N'MOVIE', N'Pumpkin', NULL, 2002, N'R', 118, N'MINUTES', N'118 min', N'Carolyn''s (Christina Ricci) sorority sisters set their sights on the Sorority of the Year award and coaching challenged athletes is their ticket to the trophy. But when the queen of formals finds herself mentoring Pumpkin (Hank Harris), a disabled athlete, their two worlds collide. Despite the hostility they feel from all sides, a tender romance grows in this inspiring comedy about fitting in.'),
(9121, N's9121', N'MOVIE', N'Prisoners of the Sun', NULL, 2014, N'16+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'A multinational expedition discovers a lost city beneath a pyramid, where they must stop the reawakened gods of ancient Egypt from initiating the Apocalypse.'),
(9122, N's9122', N'MOVIE', N'Possession: The Ingloda Within', NULL, 2013, N'13+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'One girl''s mysterious past leaves her with unresolved issues that begin to haunt her everyday life, while her friends try to save her from herself.'),
(9123, N's9123', N'MOVIE', N'Pokémon the Movie 2000', NULL, 2000, N'G', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'Just one person can make a difference...'),
(9124, N's9124', N'MOVIE', N'Play or Die', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'Lucas and Chloe, two passionate gamers, decide to participate in Paranoia, a very exclusive escape game. Based in a remote, abandoned mental hospital, they find four other participants waiting to play. They soon realize that only one of them will make it out alive.'),
(9125, N's9125', N'MOVIE', N'Play', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'The 17-year-old Jennifer and her parents recently moved to a new city but the shy and dreamy girl can''t make friends. She takes refuge in the virtual reality of the online game ''Avalonia'' and spends more and more time in the artificial world. As a result, she neglects her obligations at school and at home. Parental prohibitions do not help - the desire to play has long become a menacing addiction.'),
(9126, N's9126', N'MOVIE', N'Pitruroon', NULL, 2013, N'ALL', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'Professor Vyankatesh Kulkarni commits to fulfil his father''s final wish during his last rites. A chance visit to a village brings him face to face with Sangeetappa, his look alike, and Bhagirathi, Sangeetappa''s widowed mother. In his quest to figure out his father''s wish, Vyankatesh finds answers to many questions he hasn''t even begun to ask.'),
(9127, N's9127', N'MOVIE', N'Pinky Moge Wali 2', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 121, N'MINUTES', N'121 min', N'A complicated love story between Fateh, Pinky and Roger. While Fateh is a pure Punjabi desi guy, Pinky goes to Canada for further studies. She returns after 5 years with a boyfriend, Roger. Who will she choose in the end?'),
(9128, N's9128', N'TV_SHOW', N'Phungus & Mowld', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Hired gun Mowld, always on some dubious "mission", is repeatedly dragging Phungus, an anxious alien, from his cushy life as bartender into countless outlandish adventures. Accompanied by ALIS, their hacked imperial robot, they travel in a spaceship with an experimental Framistan Drive sought after by various shady characters.'),
(9129, N's9129', N'TV_SHOW', N'Paranormal Solutions Inc.', NULL, 2016, N'16+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Six hapless but passionate, semi-successful ghost hunters attempt to grow their business and become real players in the supernatural game. Presented by ALTER.'),
(9130, N's9130', N'MOVIE', N'Pack Train', NULL, 1953, N'13+', 57, N'MINUTES', N'57 min', N'Gene Autry sets out to aid frontier settlers, threatened by a shortage of food and medicine. When storekeepers divert the supplies to gold miners, Gene and Smiley Burnette must ride to the rescue.'),
(9131, N's9131', N'MOVIE', N'Ouija Japan', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 78, N'MINUTES', N'78 min', N'Karen, an American living in Japan, desperately wants to fit in and plays the Japanese Ouija with her peers, unwittingly disrespecting a local deity who sets her up to fight her newfound friends in a deadly game of battle royal.'),
(9132, N's9132', N'MOVIE', N'One More Flip', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'A final drug deal go wrong landing Demarco Beasley in jail with no one else to turn so he turns to his girlfriend Taji adds dealing drugs already full plate.'),
(9133, N's9133', N'MOVIE', N'Once Upon A Time In Mexico', NULL, 2003, N'R', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Returning from exile to avenge his slain family, the gun-slinging, guitar-toting "Desperado" dispenses justice the hard way.'),
(9134, N's9134', N'MOVIE', N'Once Upon A Crime', NULL, 1992, N'PG', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'A murder-mystery spoof in which an out-of-work actor finds a huggable little dachshund that turns out to be the hottest dog in Europe. If he can return it to Monte Carlo he''ll collect a huge reward.'),
(9135, N's9135', N'MOVIE', N'On Top Of Old Smoky', NULL, 1953, N'13+', 59, N'MINUTES', N'59 min', N'Gene Autry, who is mistaken for a Texas Ranger, helps the owner of a toll road, while she is being pressured by bad characters to relinquish her property, which contains valuable mica deposits.'),
(9136, N's9136', N'MOVIE', N'On Golden Pond', NULL, 1981, N'PG', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'In his final role, Henry Fonda plays Norman Thayer, a prickly retired professor who visits his Maine summer home with his loving wife Ethel (Hepburn). Soon, they are joined by their daughter Chelsea (Jane Fonda), her fiancé Bill, and his son Billy. Norman develops a bond with Billy, providing the framework for a summer in which the Thayers'' strained relationships are finally allowed to heal.'),
(9137, N's9137', N'MOVIE', N'Off The Lip', NULL, 2004, N'R', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'A young woman''s life falls apart while filming a surfing documentary.'),
(9138, N's9138', N'MOVIE', N'Now Is the Time', NULL, 2019, N'7+', 16, N'MINUTES', N'16 min', N'When internationally renowned Haida carver Robert Davidson was only 22 years old, he carved the first new totem pole on British Columbia''s Haida Gwaii in almost a century. On the 50th anniversary of its raising, Haida filmmaker Christopher Auchter revisits that day in August 1969, when the village of Old Massett gathered to celebrate the event that would signal the rebirth of the Haida spirit.'),
(9139, N's9139', N'MOVIE', N'Not Like Everyone Else', NULL, 2006, N'16+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'When a teenage girl is accused of putting a hex on a teacher, a modern day witch hunt ignites in Oklahoma.'),
(9140, N's9140', N'MOVIE', N'No Secrets', NULL, 1991, N'R', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Three teenage girls – each with her own personal ""problem"" – are sent by their parents to spend spring break alone in the country, away from the city. Their solitary vacation is interrupted by the arrival of a smooth, enigmatic fugitive, who teaches each of them something about themselves.'),
(9141, N's9141', N'MOVIE', N'Night of the Demons', NULL, 2011, N'R', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'A group of kids go to a Halloween party, only to have to face down a group of demons.'),
(9142, N's9142', N'MOVIE', N'New Year''s Evil', NULL, 1980, N'R', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'A Different Kind Of New Year''s Resolution! Diane "Blaze" Sullivan, the host of a nationally televised punk-rock show on New Year''s Eve, is receiving calls from a mysterious killer who tells her of his plans to off someone at midnight in each of America''s major time zones and she will be the last.'),
(9143, N's9143', N'TV_SHOW', N'Mysteries of the Superstition Mountains', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'The Mysteries continue to grow in season 4 of Mysteries of the Superstition Mountains'),
(9144, N's9144', N'MOVIE', N'My Story', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Elizabeth, a flourishing ballerina, tippy toes through an abusive marriage. Her husband, an evil man, beats her up constantly until one day she mysteriously ends up in hospital barely clinging on to her life. Based on a true story, Elizabeth has to learn from scratch how to live again and, more importantly, how to love again.'),
(9145, N's9145', N'MOVIE', N'My Name is Pauli Murray', NULL, 2021, N'PG-13', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Overlooked by history, Pauli Murray was a legal trailblazer whose ideas influenced RBG’s fight for gender equality and Thurgood Marshall’s civil rights arguments. This is a portrait of their impact as a non-binary Black luminary: lawyer, activist, poet, and priest who transformed our world.'),
(9146, N's9146', N'MOVIE', N'My Kingdom Come', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'SIMÓN GONZÁLEZ, a thirteen times World Spanish Kickboxing Champion; has a dream. A dream to walk again. After being the King of the World, Simón suffers a home accident that puts him in a wheel chair. But this is a story of finding hope and perseverance in the next generation of fighters. Far from hanging on to pain, Simón turned to the others finding the strength that he uses to walk again.'),
(9147, N's9147', N'MOVIE', N'My Grandpa Is An Alien', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 79, N'MINUTES', N'79 min', N'The entire life of a girl named Una is turned upside down when she witnesses that her grandpa is abducted by aliens. Una, in her basement, discovers that her grandpa is an alien himself whose spaceship hit the planet some time ago, and there''s still his pilot, a small grumpy robot. Una and the robot have less than 24 hours to find and rescue her grandpa.'),
(9148, N's9148', N'MOVIE', N'Motel Hell', NULL, 1980, N'R', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Veteran actor Rory Calhoun stars as the delightfully fiendish Farmer Vincent in this deliciously ghoulish tale of the macabre that has now become a cult classic.'),
(9149, N's9149', N'MOVIE', N'More Sex and The Single Mom', NULL, 2005, N'16+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'Single, divorced lawyer Jess Gradwell returns in this sequal as she tries to raise her new three-year-old son, Jake, while dealing with her teenage daughter, Sara''s, growing carnal desires with a photographer she meets while planning her high school graduation.'),
(9150, N's9150', N'MOVIE', N'Mick Jagger: The Ultimate Performer', NULL, 2021, N'7+', 60, N'MINUTES', N'60 min', N'Mick Jagger gained fame as the lead singer of the Rolling Stones. His career has spanned over five decades and he has been described as one of the most popular and influential frontmen in the history of rock and roll. This biography of the Rolling Stones front man is rich in both thoughts on Jagger from the likes of Mick Taylor and Bob Geldof as well as footage of him in action.'),
(9151, N's9151', N'MOVIE', N'Max Bishop', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'An out of work hitman finds employment as a janitor at the local elementary school.'),
(9152, N's9152', N'MOVIE', N'Man from Del Rio', NULL, 1956, N'13+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'When a Mexican gunslinger (Anthony Quinn) rids a town of several notorious gunfighters, he is named the sheriff, but must win over the rest of the residents who are yet to warm to his hard-hitting ways. Katy Jurado and Peter Whitney co-star.'),
(9153, N's9153', N'MOVIE', N'Makoki: A Deadly Love', NULL, 2019, N'18+', 110, N'MINUTES', N'110 min', N'The life of the best hit man in the country, Makoki, changes when he gets Chloe pregnant, a good girl with whom he will have to live for a week until his family gives him the go-ahead for the wedding and everything returns to normal .'),
(9154, N's9154', N'MOVIE', N'Madurey', NULL, 2004, N'13+', 147, N'MINUTES', N'147 min', N'Madureyvel is a vegetable vendor and is intolerable towards injustice. He wins over many people with his good ways but unfortunately, he is blamed for a murder. Eventually, it is found that Madureyvel is no ordinary vegetable vendor. Madureyvel now tries his best to prove his innocence.'),
(9155, N's9155', N'MOVIE', N'Madison', NULL, 2005, N'PG', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'A father-son action/drama based on the inspiring true story of the tiny river town of Madison, Indiana and its legendary efforts during the hydroplane racing season of 1971. In addition to the thrills of 180-mph flat-bottomed boat racing, the picture captures the spirit of a small American river town struggling to stay alive as water transportation has virtually disappeared.'),
(9156, N's9156', N'MOVIE', N'Lucy', NULL, 2003, N'13+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'The life story of comic genius and icon Lucille Ball depicts her rise from poverty and struggle in 1930s New York to the pinnacle of Hollywood success. Lucy finally gets her big break when she lands a television show based on her real-life marriage to dashing young Cuban bandleader Desi Arnaz. I Love Lucy would become one of the most successful and influential shows in the history of television.'),
(9157, N's9157', N'MOVIE', N'Lovely', NULL, 2001, N'ALL', 152, N'MINUTES', N'152 min', N'Mahadevan does not believe in love and hates the word, but his daughter Nivedha loves Chandru. In order to get his consent, the couple comes up with an intricate plan and executes it.'),
(9158, N's9158', N'MOVIE', N'Love Letters', NULL, 1999, N'PG-13', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'An ambitious U.S. Senator reflects back on his life after the death of a woman whom he loved and kept in contact with only through correspondence. The movie is told in flashbacks as the two first meet as children and begin their lifelong correspondence. He grows into his political aspirations and leaves her behind, as she becomes a struggling artist. While he is successful, she has a rocky life.'),
(9159, N's9159', N'MOVIE', N'Love Field', NULL, 1992, N'PG-13', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'Michelle Pfeiffer and Dennis Haybert turn in stellar performances as two strangers whose lives become irrevocably intertwined as they travel to Washington to attend President John F. Kennedy''s funeral. Stephanie McFadden and Brian Kerwin also star.'),
(9160, N's9160', N'MOVIE', N'Lost in Hong Kong', NULL, 2015, N'16+', 114, N'MINUTES', N'114 min', N'Xu Lai had Dreams. He just wanted to be an Artist with a Hot Girlfriend. Now he designs bras, humors his baby-crazy wife, and caters to his loopy in-laws. But he''s got a Secret Plan to find his Old Flame, and dodging his DVD-pirating, aspiring-documentarian brother-in-law may be the least of his problems. There''s been a murder, and his new Hot Pursuit...might just be from the cops.'),
(9161, N's9161', N'MOVIE', N'Little Man Tate', NULL, 1991, N'PG', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'A single, working-class mother can''t give her musically, scientifically and emotionally gifted 7-year-old son the support and stimulation he needs – and neither can the director of a school for exceptional children, who takes him under her wing.'),
(9162, N's9162', N'TV_SHOW', N'Life In Between Gates', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Life In Between Gates is a documentary series that profiles the athletes competing ion the World Pro Ski Tour. This series dives deeper into the lives of the racers on the tour, giving viewers a window into the daily lives of some of the most exciting professional skiers racing on the tour today.'),
(9163, N's9163', N'TV_SHOW', N'LEGO Monkie Kid - US', N'2021-10-01', 2021, N'TV-Y7', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'When the evil Demon Bull King is released, a young boy "MK" must go on a journey of self-discovery to become the hero this generation needs.'),
(9164, N's9164', N'MOVIE', N'Last Of The Pony Riders', NULL, 1953, N'13+', 59, N'MINUTES', N'59 min', N'Gene Autry tries to set up a stage line to carry government mail. Schemers try to get the government assignment for their own stage line, and plan to discredit the Pony Express by causing accidents.'),
(9165, N's9165', N'MOVIE', N'Last Action Hero (4K UHD)', NULL, 1993, N'PG-13', 131, N'MINUTES', N'131 min', N'Don''t miss this action-packed thrill ride!'),
(9166, N's9166', N'MOVIE', N'Last Action Hero', NULL, 1993, N'PG-13', 131, N'MINUTES', N'131 min', N'Don''t miss this action-packed thrill ride!'),
(9167, N's9167', N'MOVIE', N'Lara Croft Tomb Raider: The Cradle of Life (4K UHD)', NULL, 2003, N'PG-13', 117, N'MINUTES', N'117 min', N'Lara Croft sets out on a quest to save Pandora''s box from landing into the wrong hands. Join her as she races through furious hand-to-hand battles, blazing shoot-outs and breathtaking sky-diving escapes to try to save the ancient artifact.'),
(9168, N's9168', N'MOVIE', N'Lara Croft Tomb Raider: The Cradle of Life', NULL, 2003, N'PG-13', 117, N'MINUTES', N'117 min', N'Lara Croft sets out on a quest to save Pandora''s box from landing into the wrong hands. Join her as she races through furious hand-to-hand battles, blazing shoot-outs and breathtaking sky-diving escapes to try to save the ancient artifact.'),
(9169, N's9169', N'MOVIE', N'La Condesa', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'Brothers Felipe & Eduardo with their girlfriends sojourn to their late grandmother''s old home, but plunge into a nightmare when they discover a dark family secret hidden for generations. 40 years later, their niece Sandra and her girlfriend Debora return to the house and confront the same struggle to uncover the mystery and the consequences of revealing it, trapping them in a harrowing reality.'),
(9170, N's9170', N'MOVIE', N'Killers', NULL, 2010, N'PG-13', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'Spencer Aimes (Ashton Kutcher) is just your average, undercover, government-hired super-assassin. When he meets Jen Kornfeldt (Katherine Heigl), he finds true love... Enjoying a picture-perfect marriage, Spencer becomes the target of a multi-million dollar hit. Now Spencer and Jen are on the run for their lives.'),
(9171, N's9171', N'TV_SHOW', N'Judge Faith', N'2021-10-01', 2016, N'TV-PG', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'Faith Jenkins, a former Louisiana beauty queen, to a Wall Street attorney, to a tough New York City prosecutor, returns for a second season on with her nationally syndicated, arbitration based court show with her tough no-nonsense style of justice. So put your faith in her and her decisions, because she is Judge Faith!'),
(9172, N's9172', N'MOVIE', N'Jiminy Glick in Lalawood', NULL, 2005, N'R', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'Mockumentary starring Martin Short, Janeane Garofalo, and Carlos Jacott with interviews with Whoopi Goldberg, Sharon Stone and Steve Martin. Short stars as his Jiminy Glick persona at the Toronto Film Festival and other locations with a slew of celebrity cameos.'),
(9173, N's9173', N'MOVIE', N'Je Suis A Stand-Up: Eddie Izzard Abroad', NULL, 1996, N'18+', 48, N'MINUTES', N'48 min', N'BBC2 documentary of Eddie Izzard''s first foray into world touring. Beginning in her "hometown" of Eastbourne and and culminating in his month long show in the East village of New York, Izzard travels to Paris (her first, unsuccessful French language show,) Copenhagen, Reykjavik, and Stockholm.'),
(9174, N's9174', N'MOVIE', N'Jay Stevens: Life Is Hilarious', NULL, 2019, N'7+', 25, N'MINUTES', N'25 min', N'Jay Stevens has been a professional comedian for almost 20 years. Growing up, he was known as a hilarious outgoing character by friends, family, colleagues and those he would meet on a first encounter.'),
(9175, N's9175', N'MOVIE', N'Jaguar (Kannada)', NULL, 2016, N'13+', 159, N'MINUTES', N'159 min', N'Krishna, a young medical student, strikes against corrupt figures of power as a vigilante and tries to decribes his father''s injustice death while trying to win the love of his friend''s sister as a college student.'),
(9176, N's9176', N'MOVIE', N'Jack Ryan: Shadow Recruit', NULL, 2014, N'PG-13', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'Jack Ryan must quickly evolve from soldier to analyst to full-fledged operative to stop a devastating terrorist plot against the United States.'),
(9177, N's9177', N'MOVIE', N'It''s a Wonderful Afterlife', NULL, 2021, N'PG-13', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'A feel-good romantic comedy about an Indian mom whose matchmaking efforts turn deadly after she tries to marry off her only daughter. From the director of Bend It Like Beckham.'),
(9178, N's9178', N'MOVIE', N'Interview', NULL, 1970, N'ALL', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'Ranjit has been assured a lucrative job by a friend if he shows up for the interview dressed in a western style suit but due to unforeseen events, he ends up going dressed in Indian attire.'),
(9179, N's9179', N'TV_SHOW', N'Intentions', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Three former law students run an illegal operation, disguised as a consulting firm, that specializes in helping clients catch their spouses cheating in order to receive high-dollar divorce settlements.'),
(9180, N's9180', N'MOVIE', N'Inside Moves', NULL, 1980, N'13+', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'After a failed suicide attempt leaves him partially crippled, Rory begins spending a lot of time at a neighborhood bar full of interesting misfits. When Jerry the bartender suddenly finds himself playing basketball for the Golden State Warriors, Rory and the rest of the bar regulars hope his success will provide a lift to their sagging spirits.'),
(9181, N's9181', N'MOVIE', N'Hotel Limbo', NULL, 2020, N'13+', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'Diana thinks she''s the next Paris Hilton. After all, she''s just received an unexpected inheritance - a hotel in an upscale Canadian mountain resort. She''s an heiress! But Diana''s dreams of glitz and glamour are dashed when she arrives with her two rescue dogs to find the hotel is far from what she''d imagined...'),
(9182, N's9182', N'MOVIE', N'Highway to Hell', NULL, 1992, N'R', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Chad Lowe and Kristy Swanson star as young lovers, Charlie and Rachel, who elope to Las Vegas. But Satan has taken a liking to the lovely Rachel and has sent his Hell Cop to bring her down to Hell. And Charlie has only 24 hours to rescue her.'),
(9183, N's9183', N'TV_SHOW', N'Heartland', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'"Heartland" is an award-winning multi-generational drama that tells the story of a family making it through life together in both happy and trying times.'),
(9184, N's9184', N'MOVIE', N'Heartbreakers', NULL, 2001, N'PG-13', 124, N'MINUTES', N'124 min', N'Sigourney Weaver and Jennifer Love Hewitt star as a mother-daughter con team that makes a career out of swindling men after marriage.'),
(9185, N's9185', N'MOVIE', N'Hathat Neerar Jonyo', NULL, 2004, N'18+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Rani is a housewife who looks after her family. One day her old friend from college Abinash comes into her life. Abinash says to Rani that he has had relationships with a few women, but cannot offer himself up fully because the memory of Rani. He asks her to spend a day with him so that he can get over her. Rani, torn between principles and passion, succumbs to Abinash''s persistence.'),
(9186, N's9186', N'MOVIE', N'Hamlet', NULL, 1948, N'13+', 154, N'MINUTES', N'154 min', N'Laurence Olivier directs himself in this classic rendition of William Shakespeare''s tale of the brooding Danish prince who decides to exact revenge on his uncle for the murder of his father.'),
(9187, N's9187', N'MOVIE', N'Hackers', NULL, 1995, N'PG-13', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'A neophyte "hacker" becomes the target of the FBI after he unknowingly taps into a high-tech embezzling scheme which could cause a horrific environmental disaster in this suspenseful drama. Starring Angelina Jolie & Johnny Lee Miller.'),
(9188, N's9188', N'MOVIE', N'Grizzly Mountain', NULL, 1996, N'G', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Present-day Portland suburbs kids Dylan and Nicole go on the camping trip with their family, and when they enter a mysterious cave in the mountains, they''re transported back in time to 1870.'),
(9189, N's9189', N'MOVIE', N'Good Old Friends', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'Three good old friends reunite in Berlin for a party reminiscent of their college days, but when a prank goes horribly wrong, two of the friends must dispose of the body of the third, truly putting their friendship to the test.'),
(9190, N's9190', N'MOVIE', N'Goldtown Ghost Riders', NULL, 1953, N'13+', 59, N'MINUTES', N'59 min', N'Gene Autry carries the law into a ghost-ridden gold town as a district judge who deals out swift six-gun justice. Gene and Smiley must unravel a murder and a band of outlaws disguised as ghost riders.'),
(9191, N's9191', N'MOVIE', N'Gentlemen of Fortune', NULL, 1971, N'13+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'The head of the kindergarten Troshkin was fatally unlucky. He was found to be incredibly alike the bandit named "Docent", who stole the unique helmet of Alexander the Great. The police implement the good-natured Troshkin under cover to the thieves and he has no choice but to diligently portray his double-villain, confusing everyone around him.'),
(9192, N's9192', N'MOVIE', N'Garden State', NULL, 2004, N'R', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'A man who returns to his hometown falls in love with an adorably eccentric woman.'),
(9193, N's9193', N'MOVIE', N'Future Shock', NULL, 1994, N'PG-13', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'Horror anthology about a psychiatrist who uses virtual reality to probe the minds of three unsuspecting patients, a paranoid woman home alone, a meek man with a roommate from hell (Paxton) and a man obsessed with his own death.'),
(9194, N's9194', N'TV_SHOW', N'Frustrated Man', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Frustration of a man who gets free advices from others which irritates him to the core.'),
(9195, N's9195', N'MOVIE', N'Fort Massacre', NULL, 1958, N'13+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'Joel McCrea gives a compelling performance as a cavalry sergeant apparently leading his men to safety, but actually slowly going mad in an insane attempt to avenge an Indian massacre.'),
(9196, N's9196', N'MOVIE', N'Fort Defiance', NULL, 1951, N'7+', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'The story of a young blind man, the brother he worships and a Civil War veteran who intends to kill the latter.'),
(9197, N's9197', N'MOVIE', N'Fools Rush In', NULL, 1997, N'PG-13', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'Sparks fly and cultures collide in this romantic comedy about a casual night of passion that turns into the love of a lifetime. Matthew Perry and Salma Hayek star.'),
(9198, N's9198', N'MOVIE', N'Flight Of The Phoenix (2004)', NULL, 2004, N'PG-13', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'HD. It''s high tension among the dunes when a cargo jet crashes in the uninhabited Gobi desert leaving the crew desperate to find a way out.'),
(9199, N's9199', N'MOVIE', N'Flash of Genius', NULL, 2008, N'PG-13', 120, N'MINUTES', N'120 min', N'Academy Award nominee Greg Kinnear stars in this inspiring true story about an ordinary man and his extraordinary fight against one of the most powerful corporations in the country.'),
(9200, N's9200', N'MOVIE', N'First Shot', NULL, 2002, N'PG-13', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'The President of the United States is shot in a remote location and cannot be moved. Our secret service woman must protect him while trying to discover who did it.');
INSERT INTO dbo.content (id, source_id, content_type, title, date_added, release_year, rating, duration_value, duration_unit, duration_text, description) VALUES
(9201, N's9201', N'MOVIE', N'Fellini Forward', NULL, 2021, N'7+', 45, N'MINUTES', N'45 min', N'What is the future of creative genius? What if technology could revive an artist''s legacy? Marrying both creativity and innovation in cinema with the most forward-looking technology, Campari has created the first short movie using A.I. to bring the creative genius of Federico Fellini to life. The full endeavour was captured in a one-of-a-kind documentary showcasing the process throughout.'),
(9202, N's9202', N'MOVIE', N'Fatal Contact: Bird Flu in America', NULL, 2006, N'16+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'Follows an outbreak of an Avian Flu from its origins in a Hong Kong market through its mutation into a virus transmittable from human to human around the world.'),
(9203, N's9203', N'MOVIE', N'Fascination', NULL, 2005, N'R', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'Weeks after his father mysteriously drowns, Scott Doherty is baffled when his mother returns from a cruise with a new lover, Oliver. Scott and Oliver''s daughter Kelly both suspect foul play, but Scott learns that Kelly has dark secrets of her own!'),
(9204, N's9204', N'TV_SHOW', N'Explore With the Note 2021', NULL, 2021, N'TV-MA', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Wu Xie, Zhang Qi Ling andWang Pang Zi find themselves on a train headed to mountainous border in search of a mysterious palace. They have no idea why Wu San Sheng has sent the message that brought them all together again, but they soon discover that they are not alone. Ning is on the same trail and a guid Shun Zi joined. They begin to wonder if this adventure will be their final quest.'),
(9205, N's9205', N'MOVIE', N'Exorcist: The Beginning', NULL, 2004, N'R', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'Prequel. Exorcist: The Beginning traces the story of Father Merrin back to his first encounter with the Devil during his missionary work in Africa.'),
(9206, N's9206', N'MOVIE', N'EVA', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 110, N'MINUTES', N'110 min', N'Eva is a story of a girl in her 20s who lives with her supposedly parents but never knew they were not her biological parents. It is intriguing, suspenseful filled with morals for all family to watch'),
(9207, N's9207', N'MOVIE', N'Eternal', NULL, 2004, N'16+', 108, N'MINUTES', N'108 min', N'Detective Raymond Pope is a detective of questionable morals, searching for his missing wife. His investigation leads him to the wealthy estate of the enigmatic Elizabeth Kane and her young maid Irina, neither of which are quite what they seem.'),
(9208, N's9208', N'MOVIE', N'Emerald Falls', NULL, 2008, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'After a brutal divorce, a mother and her son relocate to the Blue Mountains to run a Bed and Breakfast.'),
(9209, N's9209', N'MOVIE', N'El Topo', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'Daniel, loner and hermit, is required to give overnight shelter to Anna, his neighbor''s niece. The need of affection and human warmth of these two peoples will emerge over their injured lives turning into a romance. Things get complicated when Anna''s husband appears.'),
(9210, N's9210', N'MOVIE', N'Eddie Izzard: Unrepeatable', NULL, 1994, N'18+', 76, N'MINUTES', N'76 min', N'Unrepeatable was recorded one night at the Albery Theatre in March 1994, when Eddie Izzard was playing a limited seven week sold-out run of his celebrated stand-up show. A completely new show from her previous thirteen week run at the Ambassadors Theatre the year before, she played to 34,000 people and received more rave reviews than last time.'),
(9211, N's9211', N'MOVIE', N'Eddie Izzard: Stripped', NULL, 2009, N'18+', 104, N'MINUTES', N'104 min', N'The acclaimed comedian of the surreal performs another unique stream-of-consciousness monologue in this latest live outing. Eddie ponders, among other things, the history of the world, cows in cars, and the existence of God.'),
(9212, N's9212', N'MOVIE', N'Duplicity', NULL, 2009, N'PG-13', 125, N'MINUTES', N'125 min', N'Julia Roberts and Clive Owen star as two sexy spies-turned-corporate operatives who put everything on the line to remain one double-cross ahead in a high-stakes game of cat-and-mouse.'),
(9213, N's9213', N'MOVIE', N'Doorways', NULL, 1994, N'16+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'A woman from a parallel world enters present day earth through the "door" and befriends a doctor, who she takes on a life-threatening chase in a different universe.'),
(9214, N's9214', N'MOVIE', N'Dolls', NULL, 1986, N'R', 78, N'MINUTES', N'78 min', N'The Hartwicke''s vast collection of dolls is fun to play with and nice to look at, but beneath the painted faces of their lifelike dolls lie murderous creatures with a vengeance for blood!'),
(9215, N's9215', N'MOVIE', N'Die Hard: With a Vengeance (4K UHD)', NULL, 1995, N'R', 129, N'MINUTES', N'129 min', N'In this third film of the Die Hard series, McClane''s past comes back to haunt him when a terrorist bomber gives McClane clues as he plants bombs in public places.'),
(9216, N's9216', N'MOVIE', N'Die Hard with a Vengeance', NULL, 1995, N'R', 129, N'MINUTES', N'129 min', N'A German terrorist plans to rob the Federal Reserve.'),
(9217, N's9217', N'MOVIE', N'Die Hard', NULL, 1988, N'R', 132, N'MINUTES', N'132 min', N'John McClane, officer of the NYPD, tries to save his wife.'),
(9218, N's9218', N'MOVIE', N'Dennis Gaxiola: Before the Wall Goes Up', NULL, 2017, N'7+', 47, N'MINUTES', N'47 min', N'Dennis Gaxiola is one of America''s funniest clean comedians. The preacher''s son gained notoriety from his appearances with Jamie Foxx on Comedy Central, The Latin Kings of Comedy Tour with Paul Rodriguez, BET''s Comic View, Que Locos and the 2010 season Martin Lawrence''s First Amendment Stand Up.'),
(9219, N's9219', N'MOVIE', N'Death Wish V: The Face of Death', NULL, 1994, N'R', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'Having finally settled into a calmer lifestyle as an architecture professor, former vigilante Paul Kersey (Charles Bronson) must pick up his old ways when a mob boss threatens his new family.'),
(9220, N's9220', N'MOVIE', N'DC Sniper', NULL, 2010, N'18+', 75, N'MINUTES', N'75 min', N'A mysterious shooter randomly kills innocent citizens in public; one after the other in broad daylight. All murders happen not far from the White House; not far from the President.'),
(9221, N's9221', N'MOVIE', N'Creepy Clowns', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'Haunted by childhood abuse, a mild mannered man develops a Killer Clown alter ego to channel his rage.'),
(9222, N's9222', N'MOVIE', N'Corey Rodrigues: People Whisperer', NULL, 2018, N'7+', 45, N'MINUTES', N'45 min', N'Corey is a highly sought after national touring college, club and corporate and cruise ship performer. He was the winner of The Catch a New Rising Star, The Funniest Comic in New England and the 2017 Big Sky Comedy Festivals.'),
(9223, N's9223', N'MOVIE', N'Come Away Home', NULL, 2005, N'PG', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Featuring an outstanding cast, this film is a genuine delight.'),
(9224, N's9224', N'MOVIE', N'Color of Love: The Jacey Story', NULL, 2000, N'7+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'Louis Gossett, Jr. and Gena Rowlands find themselves in a dispute over the custody their young adorable bi-racial grandchild. The child''s (Jacey''s) parents are Gossett''s son and Rowland''s daughter, who died in a tragic accident leaving the granddaughter''s custody up in the air.'),
(9225, N's9225', N'MOVIE', N'Clip: Validation Check CAPI', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 1, N'MINUTES', N'1 min', N'Validation CAPI Check'),
(9226, N's9226', N'MOVIE', N'Chehre', NULL, 2021, N'NR', 139, N'MINUTES', N'139 min', N'Chehre is a story about rights and wrongs. It’s a story about the decisions one makes in his / her lifetime and the fact that every decision has its repercussions, hearing and judgement.'),
(9227, N's9227', N'MOVIE', N'Chattahoochee', NULL, 1990, N'R', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'An American war hero attempts a bizarre suicide and ends up in the nightmarish Chattahoochee State Mental Hospital. Once inside, he devotes himself to exposing the horrific treatment of the patients.'),
(9228, N's9228', N'TV_SHOW', N'Chaos And Kindness', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'After 3 seasons as a self-produced television show earning more than 2 dozen Emmy Nominations and 7 total awards, Chaos and Kindness Season 4 aims even higher. With the addition of the eccentric and hilarious Jimmy Luv, Ryan''s long-time friend Davin and several other new faces, this season welcomes new levels of laughter, insanity, and most importantly, humanity.'),
(9229, N's9229', N'MOVIE', N'Caveman', NULL, 1981, N'PG', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Former Beatle Ringo Starr, Barbara Bach, Dennis Quaid and Shelley Long bond together in a hilarious love story for the ages...the stone ages...as a weakling caveman (Starr) struggles to win the heart of the lovely Lana (Bach)!'),
(9230, N's9230', N'MOVIE', N'Case Sensitive: The Point of Rescue', NULL, 2011, N'18+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'New Detective Superintendent Charlie Zailer finds herself working with DC Simon Waterhouse for the first time. When Geraldine Bretherick and her five-year-old daughter are found dead, Sally Thorne is shocked. Months before, she''d had a brief but passionate affair with a man called Mark Bretherick. Now she feels the need to get in touch with him again to offer her sympathy.'),
(9231, N's9231', N'MOVIE', N'Carrington', NULL, 1995, N'R', 123, N'MINUTES', N'123 min', N'The story of the unique and tragic friendship between English painter Dora Carrington and author Lytton Stracey is vividly brought to life by the brilliant Emma Thompson and Jonathan Pryce in "Carrington," directed by Christopher Hampton.'),
(9232, N's9232', N'MOVIE', N'Capricorn One', NULL, 1978, N'16+', 123, N'MINUTES', N'123 min', N'It was supposed to be the crowning moment in the history of space travel. But when the first manned flight to Mars is deemed unsafe and scrubbed on the launch pad, anxious authorities must scramble to save face and retain their funding-and so an unthinkable plot to fake the mission is hatched.'),
(9233, N's9233', N'MOVIE', N'Calcutta 71', NULL, 1972, N'ALL', 117, N'MINUTES', N'117 min', N'Short stories are showcased of the common men and women, who struggle for a living and how the rich and famous enjoy their life not being aware of the misery of the common man.'),
(9234, N's9234', N'MOVIE', N'Butterflies', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 112, N'MINUTES', N'112 min', N'Eniola''s must marry her late father''s prodigy for three years if she must claim the shares he willed her.'),
(9235, N's9235', N'MOVIE', N'Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid (4K UHD)', NULL, 1969, N'PG', 110, N'MINUTES', N'110 min', N'Paul Newman and Robert Redford shine in the roles that will forever identify them as suave, daring outlaws on the run who fall in love with the same woman (Katharine Ross).'),
(9236, N's9236', N'MOVIE', N'Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid', NULL, 1969, N'PG', 110, N'MINUTES', N'110 min', N'Sundance is a mighty quick draw, and his partner Butch is a gifted get-rich-quick schemer. With the law on their trail, the two pack their guns, and, along with Sundance''s girlfriend, head for Bolivia, away from the men trying to bring them to justice.'),
(9237, N's9237', N'MOVIE', N'Burning Man: The Musical', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'In this musical comedy – Follow Molly, a promising young tech grad, as she returns to the playa of Black Rock City - this time employed by the very tech company that, unbeknownst to her, seeks to destroy it. After being given the task of acquiring drugs for her boss''s exclusive party, Molly finds herself on a journey inward - and through the community of Burning Man - finds her truest self.'),
(9238, N's9238', N'MOVIE', N'Burn Country', NULL, 2016, N'7+', 104, N'MINUTES', N'104 min', N'Leaving behind his life as a fixer for Western journalists covering the war in Afghanistan, an Afghan journalist (Dominic Rains) finds himself in a small town in Northern California working as a crime reporter. And when his friend (James Franco) goes missing, he is drawn deep into the community''s dark peculiarities and is forced to confront the untenable reality of his new life in the U.S.'),
(9239, N's9239', N'MOVIE', N'Bulworth', NULL, 1998, N'R', 108, N'MINUTES', N'108 min', N'A veteran US Senator decides to end his life by hiring an assassin - then, on no sleep and with nothing to lose, he becomes a hip-hop rapper, bluntly speaking truth to power! With Don Cheadle, Oliver Platt.'),
(9240, N's9240', N'MOVIE', N'Bullets Don''t Argue', NULL, 1964, N'13+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'Rivertown Sheriff Pat Garrett must abandon his young wife in the same church where they just got married in order to catch a couple of dangerous bank robbers.'),
(9241, N's9241', N'TV_SHOW', N'Bucket', NULL, 2017, N'TV-14', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Fran is a reserved high school history teacher in a rut. Mim is an eccentric free spirit who believes 70 is the new 40. They are also mother and daughter, and their relationship is not exactly easy. But when Mim reveals she is dying, she wants to go on a road trip to tick off items on her bucket list and Fran feels that she has no choice but to come along for the ride.'),
(9242, N's9242', N'MOVIE', N'BT: My Life as I Know It Now!', NULL, 2018, N'7+', 32, N'MINUTES', N'32 min', N'With an act that crosses all boundaries, BT will surely have you rolling with laughter. His physical performance style and charm landed him two performances on NBC''s Friday Night Videos and a performance at the prestigious HBO U.S.'),
(9243, N's9243', N'MOVIE', N'Broken English', NULL, 1994, N'R', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Ivan is an embittered Croatian who fled to his wife''s native Aukland when war broke out in Bosnia. His drug-running business allows him a comfortable lifestyle, but he''s still irritated that his young adult daughters won''t mind him. The eldest, Nina, is a waitress who takes up with a colleague, a Maori cook named Eddie, in part because he''s attractive but also to annoy her father.'),
(9244, N's9244', N'MOVIE', N'Boris and Natasha: The Movie', NULL, 1992, N'PG', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'The live-action version of animator Jay Ward''s most famous no-goodnicks, the Cold War klutzes from Potsylvania who bedeviled Rocky and Bullwinkle. Our "heroes" are sent to the United States... little knowing their beloved "Fearless Leader" has merely set them up as bait.'),
(9245, N's9245', N'MOVIE', N'Blue Crush 2', NULL, 2011, N'PG-13', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'From the filmmakers of Blue Crush comes an unforgettable surf odyssey about a young woman who finds fun, friendship and a thrilling adventure of a lifetime along the coasts of South Africa.'),
(9246, N's9246', N'MOVIE', N'Blizzard', NULL, 2004, N'ALL', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'An enchanting tale of Katie and her magical friendship with Blizzard, one of Santa''s newest reindeer. Blizzard uses her special powers to help Katie realize her own inner, strength and potential. By doing so Blizzard risks being banished from Santa''s village – only the most powerful gift of call can save them.'),
(9247, N's9247', N'MOVIE', N'Blippi''s Spooky Spells Halloween', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 41, N'MINUTES', N'41 min', N'Halloween is in the air and Blippi is in the spooky spirit after finding an old, leather-bound book of "Spooky Spells." Excited to make the most of the holiday, Blippi has decked out a Halloween campfire, hopeful that these spells will offer him everything he needs to make the best Halloween ever! This episode is starring Clayton Grimm as Blippi.'),
(9248, N's9248', N'MOVIE', N'Blacula', NULL, 1972, N'PG', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'Transformed into a vampire, an African Prince emerges in 70s LA as Blacula.'),
(9249, N's9249', N'MOVIE', N'Black Coal, Thin Ice', NULL, 2014, N'18+', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'With more than 30 premieres and 20 awards from top film festivals around the world, Black Coal, Thin Ice is the story of a disgraced cop and his partner, still seeking the truth behind the high-profile murders that ended their careers - because it seems the killer is at it again.'),
(9250, N's9250', N'MOVIE', N'Black As Night', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'A resourceful teenage girl driven by revenge, alongside her trusted friends, spends her summer battling vampires terrorizing her city of New Orleans.'),
(9251, N's9251', N'MOVIE', N'Bingo Hell', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'A feisty senior citizen fights to protect her beloved neighborhood from an evil force that’s taken over the local bingo hall and is killing the residents in gruesome ways.'),
(9252, N's9252', N'MOVIE', N'Bhaloo', NULL, 1980, N'ALL', 135, N'MINUTES', N'135 min', N'When Sajjal comes of age, her guardian Appakaka finds a suitable partner for her in Jayant, a young lawyer. The cunning village chief Ramrao tries to oppose this union, and poisons Jayant when everything else fails. Now its upto Sajjal and her trusted canine companion Bhalu, to save the day.'),
(9253, N's9253', N'MOVIE', N'Beer', NULL, 1985, N'R', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'Ambitious advertising executive B.D. Tucker (Loretta Swit) turns three ordinary guys into America''s new macho heroes as part of an advertising campaign to boost beer sales. Rip Torn, Kenneth Mars and David Alan Grier co-star in this biting satire.'),
(9254, N's9254', N'MOVIE', N'Banshiwala', NULL, 2010, N'13+', 101, N'MINUTES', N'101 min', N'Mridul suffers a huge loss in his business and decides to return to his ancestral house for selling the property. However, the property is taken care of by an old headmaster and his daughter Lakshmi.'),
(9255, N's9255', N'MOVIE', N'Bad Influence', NULL, 1990, N'R', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'Alex (Rob Lowe) is a drifter who enters the life of Michael Boll (James Spader) , an ambitious young businessman, introducing him to L.A.''s seductive underground, but things quickly escalate into violence and betrayal in this Hitchcockian thriller.'),
(9256, N's9256', N'MOVIE', N'Babes in Toyland (1997)', NULL, 1997, N'G', 74, N'MINUTES', N'74 min', N'It''s two days before Christmas and the Toyland Toy Factory is in jeopardy of being shut down. Who you gonna call? Jack and Jill, of course, along with several other nursery rhyme characters who come to the rescue in another entertaining rendition of saving Christmas.'),
(9257, N's9257', N'MOVIE', N'Babes in Toyland (1986)', NULL, 1986, N'G', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'A young girl learns that she must believe in the existence of toys or Toyland and Christmas will be ruined by the evil Barnaby Barnacle. Beloved storybook characters come to the little girl''s rescue by convincing her to see the light in this delightful tale about saving Christmas.'),
(9258, N's9258', N'MOVIE', N'Atonement', NULL, 2007, N'R', 123, N'MINUTES', N'123 min', N'Nominated for 7 Academy Awards, including Best Picture, this stunning epic love story stars Keira Knightley and James McAvoy and is hailed by critics as "a ravishing romance."'),
(9259, N's9259', N'MOVIE', N'Assassination', NULL, 2015, N'16+', 140, N'MINUTES', N'140 min', N'Snipers. Marksmen. Hired Guns. Double Agents. A group of exiled rebels are planning a hit on an Army Commander in Japanese-occupied Korea, but the only killer for the job is in prison. Now, the Resistance must devise a jailbreak, escape a hitman...and discover which of them is a traitor.'),
(9260, N's9260', N'MOVIE', N'Andy Woodhull: World''s Greatest Stepdad', NULL, 2018, N'7+', 42, N'MINUTES', N'42 min', N'Andy recently appeared on Conan on TBS. Around that same time, his half-hour special premiered on Comedy Central.'),
(9261, N's9261', N'MOVIE', N'An All Dogs Christmas Carol', NULL, 1998, N'G', 73, N'MINUTES', N'73 min', N'Three canines itch and scratch their way through everything and anything in an effort to save Christmas from an evil spirit (Carface) who wants to use dogs from all over the world to ruin Christmas.'),
(9262, N's9262', N'MOVIE', N'Amazing Grace (1974)', NULL, 1974, N'G', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'A train porter and his girlfriend become campaign organizers for the first black mayor in the history of Baltimore, the amazing Grace Teasdale Grimes. Moms Mabley stars in this hysterical comedy with heart along with Moses Gunn and Slappy White.'),
(9263, N's9263', N'MOVIE', N'All''s Faire in Love', NULL, 2009, N'PG-13', 108, N'MINUTES', N'108 min', N'A theatre troupe is about to lose its prime gig at Ye Olde Times Renaissance Faire to a rival troupe of conceited, classically-trained Shakespearean actors. This group must revive their act and find help from an unexpected source.'),
(9264, N's9264', N'MOVIE', N'Agathiyar', NULL, 1972, N'ALL', 153, N'MINUTES', N'153 min', N'Agathiyar Muni, an avatar of Lord Brahma and a member of the seven sages, performs supernatural feats of strength and daring in order to serve his people and the gods.'),
(9265, N's9265', N'MOVIE', N'Adios, Sabata', NULL, 1971, N'PG', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'Under the brutal rule of local garrison leader Colonel Skimmel and European tyranny, a group of Mexican revolutionaries hire gunslinger Sabata (Yul Brynner) to rob a transport of Austrian gold in order to buy weapons. But Colonel Skimmel has other plans, taking the gold for himself and blaming the revolutionaries, but no scheming colonel is going to keep Sabata from earning his pay.'),
(9266, N's9266', N'MOVIE', N'Acts of Defiance', NULL, 1992, N'16+', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'This feature-length documentary recounts the events that surrounded and led to the Oka Crisis of the summer of 1990. The film focuses on the Mohawk territory of Kahnawake, in Quebec, but also reflects on the relationship between Canada and Indigenous peoples at a particular time in history.'),
(9267, N's9267', N'MOVIE', N'Across the Moon', NULL, 1994, N'13+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'Two young women bond while living together out in the California desert to be close to their boyfriends who are serving time at the nearby state prison.'),
(9268, N's9268', N'MOVIE', N'A Good Year', NULL, 2006, N'PG-13', 118, N'MINUTES', N'118 min', N'HD. Russell Crowe stars as a bond trader whose life is changed by a trip to Provence to dispose of his uncle''s estate.'),
(9269, N's9269', N'MOVIE', N'A Chorus Line', NULL, 1985, N'PG-13', 118, N'MINUTES', N'118 min', N'After narrowing down hundreds of Broadway hopefuls, choreographer Zach (Michael Douglas) leads a select group of dancers on an audition that could change their lives forever in this stunning adaptation of the hit Broadway musical.'),
(9270, N's9270', N'MOVIE', N'A Bucket of Blood', NULL, 1959, N'7+', 65, N'MINUTES', N'65 min', N'Café busboy Walter ventures into the world of sculpting with a small statue called "Dead Cat." Unfortunately, "Dead Cat" is followed by "Murdered Man." By the time we reach Walter''s interest in the female form...well, you get the picture.'),
(9271, N's9271', N'MOVIE', N'83 degrees - ski the north', NULL, 2019, N'7+', 55, N'MINUTES', N'55 min', N'Seeking to find the most remote places...'),
(9272, N's9272', N'MOVIE', N'66 Sadashiv', NULL, 2019, N'ALL', 135, N'MINUTES', N'135 min', N'''66 Sadashiv'' is an emotional yet humorous story of Prabhakar Shrikhande, a typical Punekar, who is a master at arguing. He starts an institute to teach people the art of fighting for one''s rights, which is the 66th Art, while trying to gain recognition in the art world.'),
(9273, N's9273', N'MOVIE', N'1984', NULL, 1985, N'R', 111, N'MINUTES', N'111 min', N'The classic George Orwell story set in a world where absolute conformity in action, word and thought including loyalty to Big Brother is demanded.'),
(9274, N's9274', N'MOVIE', N'10 to Midnight', NULL, 1983, N'R', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Charles Bronson plays a tough L.A. cop whose daughter is stalked by a cunning sex-killer in this riveting police thriller that offers a first-rate cast including Wilford Brimley.'),
(9275, N's9275', N'MOVIE', N'Zombie Warz: Falls The Shadow', NULL, 2011, N'18+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'Three years after the War, the United States is destroyed. Civilization has devolved into anarchy and tribalism.'),
(9276, N's9276', N'MOVIE', N'Zameer', NULL, 1975, N'13+', 130, N'MINUTES', N'130 min', N'A king''s son is kidnapped by a dacoit. Years later, a boy claiming to be the son arrives at the palace, but he falls in love with the king''s daughter.'),
(9277, N's9277', N'MOVIE', N'Youth in Oregon', NULL, 2017, N'7+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'"Youth In Oregon" is a dark comedy about a man who agrees to drive his cantankerous father-in-law cross-country, with the hopes of talking him out of getting euthanized.'),
(9278, N's9278', N'MOVIE', N'Welcome To The Jungle', NULL, 2014, N'NR', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Office co-workers become stranded when a corporate retreat led by an unhinged former Marine (Jean-Claude Van Damme) goes hilariously wrong. Also starring Adam Brody and Kristen Schaal.'),
(9279, N's9279', N'MOVIE', N'Twelve', NULL, 2010, N'R', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'A young drug dealer watches as his high-rolling life is dismantled in the wake of his cousin''s murder, which sees his best friend arrested for the crime.'),
(9280, N's9280', N'MOVIE', N'Tuck Jagadish (Malayalam)', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 145, N'MINUTES', N'145 min', N'When a doting elder brother has a dispute with the younger one over the inheritance, the latter tries to establish peace and keep the family together.'),
(9281, N's9281', N'TV_SHOW', N'Travel Man: 48 Hours in...', N'2021-10-02', 2018, N'13+', 7, N'SEASONS', N'7 Seasons', N'Richard Ayoade attempts to visit all the top tourist attractions in various cities in a 48-hour period. Richard hates long, boring holidays so he challenges himself to make trips as efficient as possible.'),
(9282, N's9282', N'MOVIE', N'Totò Eva e il pennello proibito', NULL, 1959, N'13+', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'The crooks Eva (Abbe Lane) and Raoul (Mario Carotenuto), devise a scam, The plan consists in ing the copyist Antonio Scorcelletti (Totò) paint La Maja Desnuda, adding a nightgown to the latter. In this way, thanks to the complacency of the unsuspecting professor Francisco Montiel (Luis De Funès), they will try to pass off the Maja in a shirt as an unpublished work by Goya...'),
(9283, N's9283', N'MOVIE', N'The Selling', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A too honest for his own good real estate agent learns how frightening the housing market can be when he tries to flip a haunted house.'),
(9284, N's9284', N'MOVIE', N'The Right Distance', NULL, 2007, N'13+', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'An aspiring journalist investigates the murder of the woman he once loved. After the suicide of the prime suspect, he unravels the harrowing truth behind the crime.'),
(9285, N's9285', N'MOVIE', N'The Prophecy 2', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'Aretha is giving a prophecy about one of her sons and immediately lost it all, where all hopes is gone. Will Aretha look up to God in prayers or will fear cause her to do anything for earthly results?'),
(9286, N's9286', N'MOVIE', N'The Prophecy', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 124, N'MINUTES', N'124 min', N'What happens in the dark will eventually comes to light. Aretha was giving a prophecy that scattered and Challenged her faith. In times like this, will she trust her God and look up to him for clarity, or will she will she allow a word lead her into darkness as she looks for solution?'),
(9287, N's9287', N'MOVIE', N'The Morning After', NULL, 2018, N'18+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'A hot one-night stand turns into an awkward morning after when GUY and HOLLY get STUCK in a dead-stopped traffic jam. As they begrudgingly get to know each other, we learn of their sexually raucous evening and then they''re led to their surprising destiny.'),
(9288, N's9288', N'MOVIE', N'The Magic Voyage', NULL, 1992, N'7+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'Christopher Columbus decides to go on a journey to prove that the Earth is not flat. His companion is a smart wood worm who''s on a quest of his own: to save a beautiful fairy princess from the evil lord Swarm and his insect army.'),
(9289, N's9289', N'MOVIE', N'The Last Exorcism', NULL, 2010, N'PG-13', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'HD. A phony preacher decides to record his final exorcism and expose his fraud…until he discovers the very real evil within a possessed woman.'),
(9290, N's9290', N'MOVIE', N'The Lady Doctor', NULL, 1957, N'7+', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'Two sisters are convinced that their nephew''s wife is a traitor and has an extramarital affair. In order to collect evidence, they turn to an investigative agency where, however, without their knowledge, they are helped by two cheaters who pretend to be professionals but in reality are only orderlies ...'),
(9291, N's9291', N'MOVIE', N'The Intruder', NULL, 1956, N'13+', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'A doctor saves a girl from suicide and marries her out of pity. Soon the evil man who had pushed her to the limit taking advantage of her re-enters her life. The ensuing crisis will help the newlyweds overcome their differences and start a fresh, better new life.'),
(9292, N's9292', N'MOVIE', N'The Ice Forest', NULL, 2014, N'13+', 107, N'MINUTES', N'107 min', N'As a snowstorm is about to rage, a young technician arrives in a high-altitude town to repair its electric power plant. He quickly discovers that it is used for sinister purposes.'),
(9293, N's9293', N'MOVIE', N'The Dog Who Saved Christmas', NULL, 2009, N'PG', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'The Bannister family''s newly adopted and crafty canine, Zeus (voiced by Mario Lopez) saves its home from two bumbling thieves while the family is away at Christmas.'),
(9294, N's9294', N'MOVIE', N'The Breaking Point', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 73, N'MINUTES', N'73 min', N'Shawn Dickerson, a street guy is accused of killing Brenda Sawyer, an overzealous Assistant D.A. name Ballard, who is willing to do whatever she has to do to make District Attorney, even if it means bending the rules.'),
(9295, N's9295', N'MOVIE', N'The Boyfriend School', NULL, 1990, N'PG-13', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'Gus Kubicek (Steve Guttenberg) isn''t exactly ladies'' man material...at least not until his romance writer sister (Shelley Long) gets hold of him. Soon he''s the buff and bronzed main character in the romantic fantasies of his dream girl, Emily.'),
(9296, N's9296', N'TV_SHOW', N'Tales of Para Handy', NULL, 1995, N'16+', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'A new season of the comedy drama starring Gregor Fisher as Para Handy, skipper of the ''Vital Spark'' the most unreliable puffer ever to have sailed round the Mull of Kintyre!'),
(9297, N's9297', N'MOVIE', N'Swallows and Amazons', NULL, 2017, N'ALL', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'In this delightful family adventure, four children dream of escaping the tedium of a summer holiday with their mother. When finally given permission to camp on their own on an island in the middle of a vast lake, they are overjoyed. But when they get there they discover they may not be alone...and the battle for ownership of a lonely island teaches the value of friendship!'),
(9298, N's9298', N'TV_SHOW', N'Strathblair', NULL, 1993, N'16+', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'The best thing to come out of Scotland since malt whisky. Ian Carmichael, Derek Riddell and Francesca Hunt bring more drama as our favorite newlyweds continue to make a go of their rundown hill farm.'),
(9299, N's9299', N'MOVIE', N'Six Three Times', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 50, N'MINUTES', N'50 min', N'A peaceful journey becomes a hikers nightmare as he encounters several disturbing interactions from obscured wanderers.'),
(9300, N's9300', N'MOVIE', N'Sins Of Desire', NULL, 1993, N'18+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'Suspecting foul play, Kay Egan goes undercover to work in a suspicious sex clinic where her sister went to therapy before killing herself. And Kay is not the only one watching the sinister married couple who runs the place.'),
(9301, N's9301', N'MOVIE', N'Side Chicks', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 75, N'MINUTES', N'75 min', N'Latifa is a well known love therapist and tv host she recently got engaged to the love of her life and have the best selling book preaching against side chick just for her fans and public to find out that she is a side chick herself, before she finds out herself'),
(9302, N's9302', N'MOVIE', N'Shutter', NULL, 2017, N'13+', 122, N'MINUTES', N'122 min', N'Jitya Bhau likes to be in control at all times. One fateful night, he finds himself locked in an empty shop, alone with a prostitute he knows nothing about. With no assurance of help from the outside, they must now fend for themselves.'),
(9303, N's9303', N'MOVIE', N'Savage Land', NULL, 1994, N'13+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Two women and some children travel across the mid-west. The elements are rough but then things get worse when they are pursued by two outlaws.'),
(9304, N's9304', N'MOVIE', N'Sashinka', NULL, 2018, N'16+', 79, N'MINUTES', N'79 min', N'When Sasha''s mother arrives on her doorstep without warning her, she tries to prepare for the most important concert of her career. The reasons for her mother''s visit come to light and Sasha must find a way to survive the remaining 24 hours.'),
(9305, N's9305', N'TV_SHOW', N'Rupert', N'2021-10-02', 1995, N'TV-G', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'The adventures of Rupert, a young bear who unintentionally ends up in faraway or mystical places but always makes it back safely to his home of Nutwood.'),
(9306, N's9306', N'MOVIE', N'Roommate (Hindi)', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'When Santhosh learns that his ex-girlfriend is getting married, he decides to get a reprisal by pushing an escort Saranya into a locked newly built space called Manhattan. Will she survive without water, food and electricity.'),
(9307, N's9307', N'MOVIE', N'Red Dog', NULL, 2011, N'PG', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'This is the story of a legendary, lovable red dog who roamed the outback looking for his original master, finding his way into the hearts of everyone he meets, bringing people and communities together, some who find love, and others who find themselves. Based on true events.'),
(9308, N's9308', N'MOVIE', N'Project A-ko 2: Plot of the Daitokuji Financial Group', NULL, 1987, N'16+', 49, N'MINUTES', N'49 min', N'Three weeks after an alien ship lands on Graviton City, A-ko and the gang go on summer vacation. Meanwhile, chaos breaks out when B-ko''s father arms the local military with new mecha to attack the alien ship.'),
(9309, N's9309', N'MOVIE', N'Perfect Romance', NULL, 2004, N'13+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'In the process of matchmaking for her daughter, a mother meets an unlikely romantic interest.'),
(9310, N's9310', N'MOVIE', N'Pati Patni Aur Woh', NULL, 1978, N'13+', 130, N'MINUTES', N'130 min', N'Sharda and Ranjeet lead a happily married life with their baby boy. However, things change when Ranjeet gets attracted to his new secretary and begins an illicit affair with her.'),
(9311, N's9311', N'MOVIE', N'Paradise by the Dashboard Light', NULL, 2016, N'13+', 42, N'MINUTES', N'42 min', N'Human-like droids living and serving among us in New York City begin to struggle with their identity as they grow more sentient each day, bringing out the monster in their creators and the poetry in these often undetected creations. A darkly humorous look at a future that is potentially right around the corner.'),
(9312, N's9312', N'MOVIE', N'Outlaws: The Legend of O.B. Taggart', NULL, 1995, N'R', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'After many years in prison, a changed robber comes home to see his sons again, one of them brain-damaged. Due to many misfortunate events and terrible tragic misunderstandings, they go on the run, leaving a bloody trail wherever they go.'),
(9313, N's9313', N'MOVIE', N'Nanak Dukhiya Sub Sansar', NULL, 1969, N'13+', 132, N'MINUTES', N'132 min', N'Two brothers, separated in the riots during the India-Pakistan separation, meet as friends. Even when they learn that they are real brothers, they do not refrain from opposing each other over a woman.'),
(9314, N's9314', N'MOVIE', N'Nambiar (Hindi)', NULL, 2016, N'13+', 123, N'MINUTES', N'123 min', N'Ramachandran, an IAS aspirant, keeps getting into difficult situations because of his id, Nambiyaar, who ends up creating havoc in his relationship with his parents and Saroja, the woman he loves.'),
(9315, N's9315', N'MOVIE', N'Naam', NULL, 2018, N'13+', 132, N'MINUTES', N'132 min', N'A group of college students is on their way to Chennai to meet someone extraordinary, for a noble mission. What makes them undertake the mission?'),
(9316, N's9316', N'MOVIE', N'Mugguru Monagallu', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 108, N'MINUTES', N'108 min', N'Mugguru Mongallu is a comedy thriller and Srinivasa Reddy is the biggest highlight of the film. It''s the story of Three people who are apparently deaf (Srinivas Reddy), dumb (Deekshit Shetty), and blind (Vennela Rama Rao) each, go to the police station with a few clues regarding the murders. Will the police catch the killers?'),
(9317, N's9317', N'MOVIE', N'Like Dogs', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Abducted and treated like animals, two university students are unwilling participants in a behavioral experiment gone horribly wrong. It gets personal when the pair learn they''ve each been specifically targeted. Once people start dying, it''s a race to escape and survive.'),
(9318, N's9318', N'MOVIE', N'Let There Be Light', NULL, 2017, N'ALL', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'A group of scientists are approaching the final steps of a machine decades in the making: an artificial star that could provide millions of years of clean energy. Are scientists about to crack nuclear fusion, or chasing a delusion?'),
(9319, N's9319', N'TV_SHOW', N'Landscape Artist of the Year', NULL, 2015, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Joan Bakewell and Frank Skinner welcome the artists of the series that aims to unearth a new star of the arts world. Portrait artist Tai Shan Schierenberg, curator Kathleen Soriano and art dealer Kate Bryan will circulate among the contestants, assessing their talents and skill'),
(9320, N's9320', N'MOVIE', N'Kanave Kalaiyadhe', NULL, 1999, N'ALL', 159, N'MINUTES', N'159 min', N'Just as everything was falling into place for Anand, he is distraught when the girl he loves dies in a blast. Fate plays yet another trick on him when he finds himself face to face with her lookalike.'),
(9321, N's9321', N'MOVIE', N'Jack''d Up', NULL, 2001, N'18+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'Dre gets caught up gang activity and accidentally murders an innocent person. Plagued by a guilty conscience, he does everything he can to make things right – and avoid falling back in with the gang.'),
(9322, N's9322', N'TV_SHOW', N'If You Give a Mouse a Cookie', N'2021-10-02', 2021, N'ALL', 10, N'SEASONS', N'10 Seasons', N'If You Give A Mouse A Cookie, Series: Based on the beloved books by Laura Numeroff and Felicia Bond. Meet Mouse, Pig, Moose, Dog and Cat and their favorite kids! When everyone gets together one thing always leads to another in the most unexpected ways. You never know where things will end up, but you can be sure that IF Mouse and Friends go on an adventure, THEN there is lots of fun to be had!'),
(9323, N's9323', N'MOVIE', N'High Wire', NULL, 2020, N'13+', 52, N'MINUTES', N'52 min', N'High Wire examines why Canada declined to take part in the 2003 US-led military mission in Iraq, shining a spotlight on the diplomatic tug of war that took place behind the scenes with our neighbours to the south. Canada''s historic refusal could have had disastrous consequences, but a number of key players and other analysts remind us of the terrible price we pay when diplomacy fails.'),
(9324, N's9324', N'MOVIE', N'Hawaii', NULL, 1966, N'7+', 161, N'MINUTES', N'161 min', N'In this spectacular film starring Julie Andrews, Max von Sydow, Richard Harris and Gene Hackman two cultures collide when the Rev. Abner Hale (von Sydow) and his wife (Andrews) attempt to convert early 19th-century Hawaiian natives to Christianity.'),
(9325, N's9325', N'MOVIE', N'Halloween With The New Addams Family', NULL, 1977, N'7+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'America''s first family of ghastly giddiness reunites for a Halloween celebration that will raise the...dead! John Astin, Carolyn Jones, Ted Cassidy, Jackie Coogan, Lisa Loring and Ken Weatherwax all reprise their roles from the hit original series!'),
(9326, N's9326', N'MOVIE', N'Guns of Banaras', NULL, 2020, N'13+', 127, N'MINUTES', N'127 min', N'A sincere and diligent young man, Guddu, is very attached to his bike since it became his streak of luck. One day, when his bike gets stolen, Guddu sets out to find it but gets entangled in the world of crime when he finds out that his bike is being used to transport drugs.'),
(9327, N's9327', N'MOVIE', N'Gli Onorevoli', NULL, 1963, N'13+', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'A series of candidates for the Chamber encounters difficulties during the electoral campaign: the Christian Democrat Bianca Sereni (Franca Valeri) falls in love with the photographer who wants to discredit her, Senator Rossani Breschi (Gino Cervi) is forced to stop his rally because of a gang of children, the monarchist Antonio La Trippa (Totò) torments the condominiums with endless speeches ...'),
(9328, N's9328', N'MOVIE', N'Get Shorty', NULL, 1995, N'R', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'HD. A Miami loan shark goes to Hollywood to collect a debt and tries to break into the movie business.'),
(9329, N's9329', N'MOVIE', N'Games of Desire', NULL, 1964, N'16+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'The wife of the Swedish Ambassador of Greece becomes involved in a romantic triangle, but the man who comes between husband and wife has a preference for the husband.'),
(9330, N's9330', N'MOVIE', N'Friends at Last', NULL, 1995, N'13+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'As the years go by, a woman finds herself trapped in her marriage, and asks for a divorce from her husband. Twelve years later, she discovers that her ex-husband is her best friend.'),
(9331, N's9331', N'MOVIE', N'Final Run', NULL, 1999, N'13+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A new, computer controlled train loses control due to an error in the system and speeds out of control while Urich attempts to stop it.'),
(9332, N's9332', N'MOVIE', N'Farm to Fork to Love', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'Focused chef, ALICE (Meggan Kaiser), works at one of the top restaurants in New York. After a disastrous night serving a food critic, she receives an invitation to judge the notorious food competition in honor of the annual fundraiser for the St. Andrew''s Children''s Hospital. Alice decides to go, and among the judges is the handsome chef CHRISTIAN (Scot Kooper), who attended school with Alice.'),
(9333, N's9333', N'MOVIE', N'Exit Humanity', NULL, 2011, N'18+', 114, N'MINUTES', N'114 min', N'A young man''s struggle to survive in the aftermath of a deadly undead outbreak during the American Civil War.'),
(9334, N's9334', N'MOVIE', N'Evidence of Blood', NULL, 1988, N'7+', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'A famous investigative reporter goes back to the small Southern town where he grew up to explore a murder involving his family''s past.'),
(9335, N's9335', N'MOVIE', N'Entanglement', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'A Late Night DJ at the hottest Radio station in Atlanta struggles to find his way back to the top after being dumped live on-air. In his journey to revive his career, a woman that once called his show seeking love advice enters his life and that is where things began to entangle.'),
(9336, N's9336', N'MOVIE', N'Electrician', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'Lonely electrician Mark wants to re-connect with his lost family unit, but he knows to achieve this it means re-opening doors to his past he has tried hard to get away from. The key to achieving his goal could also be his undoing and he must decide fast if he is willing to take that risk. Made over five years without a budget & using mostly non-actors. Multi award-winning independent British film.'),
(9337, N's9337', N'MOVIE', N'Dreaming of Braddock', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 79, N'MINUTES', N'79 min', N'The failed actor Rui (Pedro Monteiro) inherits a millionaire apartment and puts it up for sale to fulfill his dream: to star in the remake of a famous Chuck Norris film. While trying to sell the apartment, he has to negotiate the rights to produce the film, solve his love life and deal with an unusual problem: being a redhead.'),
(9338, N's9338', N'MOVIE', N'Dive', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'A young woman in Ireland must make a life changing decision when she discovers she''s pregnant and faces the harsh reality of Ireland''s lack of support for women in her situation.'),
(9339, N's9339', N'TV_SHOW', N'Di-Gata Defenders', N'2021-10-02', 2008, N'TV-G', 4, N'SEASONS', N'4 Seasons', N'Only one group can control the destiny of the Di-Gata Stones. With the help of the Guardian creatures, four teenage warriors are entrusted with finding the pure gems to save the good people of RaDos.'),
(9340, N's9340', N'MOVIE', N'Deya Neya', NULL, 1962, N'16+', 122, N'MINUTES', N'122 min', N'Prashant leaves home because of his differences with his father to build a career as a singer. He comes to the city and starts working as Haron, a driver in the house of beautiful Lady of Suchorita . Suchorita loves Singer of Abhijit. At the last time Suchorita knows Horan sings as Abhijit.'),
(9341, N's9341', N'MOVIE', N'Delusion', NULL, 2016, N'13+', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'A struggling married couple is offered a luxurious seaside mansion for a retreat by some rich friends. When a violent storm breaks out, they offer shelter to a couple of strangers, who think they are the owners. They do nothing to correct them and start playing into it.'),
(9342, N's9342', N'TV_SHOW', N'DEFA', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'A known writer named Aktan Koral, while continuing his work on his latest project called" Defa", goes to the house where he grow up cause of a mysterious call, in this house, main characters of the books he has written up to this time and his grandmother, who died many years ago, are waiting for him.'),
(9343, N's9343', N'MOVIE', N'Dancin: It''s On', NULL, 2015, N'PG', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'When Beverly Hills teen, Jennifer (Witney Carson), visits her distant father at his hotel in Panama City Beach, she encounters much more than she bargained for.'),
(9344, N's9344', N'MOVIE', N'Confessions of an American Bride', NULL, 2005, N'13+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'As a young woman plans her dream wedding she realizes she might not be walking down the aisle with the right person.'),
(9345, N's9345', N'MOVIE', N'Cold Turkey', NULL, 1971, N'PG-13', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Dick Van Dyke stars as Clayton Brooks, minister in a small Iowa town, who takes up the challenge presented by an ad exec (Bob Newhart) for a tobacco company: any city or town in America that can give up smoking for 30 days gets $25 million dollars.'),
(9346, N's9346', N'TV_SHOW', N'Clip: El Anti-Friendzone', NULL, 2019, N'18+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'A young man in his 30s is looking for the love of his life, but gets rejected all the time. His parents think he is a player but it is the complete opposite. He will try to find love in the very complicated 21st century.'),
(9347, N's9347', N'MOVIE', N'Child in the Night', NULL, 1990, N'13+', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'After a young boy witnesses the brutal murder of his father, he suffers from trauma and can''t remember the details. A detective and a child psychologist work together to emotionally heal him.'),
(9348, N's9348', N'TV_SHOW', N'Cavendish', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'A Scottish boarding school tucked away in the Highlands. Prefects for house parents. Peers who are more like siblings. High standards of discipline and excellence. Cavendish is everything English newcomer Gracie Bennett needs and nothing she wants, except to play on their football team. Talent got her there but clashing against the new normal may well cost her the season.'),
(9349, N's9349', N'MOVIE', N'Camouflage', NULL, 2014, N'16+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'An unscrupulous police detective corners the lead suspect of a murder investigation in executing a sinister plan.'),
(9350, N's9350', N'MOVIE', N'Bermuda Triangle', NULL, 1996, N'16+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'A sudden storm leaves the Everman family shipwrecked on an uncharted island inhabited by other stranded settlers and a tribe of natives with strange powers. In their attempts to escape, the Evermens befriend the island''s other inhabitants and create for themselves a unique interpretation of home.'),
(9351, N's9351', N'MOVIE', N'Bandslam', NULL, 2009, N'PG', 111, N'MINUTES', N'111 min', N'Music-obsessed misfits (Aly Michalka, Vanessa Hudgens, Gaelan Connell) cope with high school life by forming a band for the big Bandslam competition.'),
(9352, N's9352', N'MOVIE', N'Bagdad Cafe', NULL, 1988, N'PG', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Bagdad Cafe is a rusty gas pump, a greasy spoon and an oasis amid the dunes in this offbeat comedy about mismatched characters who find paradise off the beaten track. A bittersweet but delightful comedy from writer-director Percy Adlon.'),
(9353, N's9353', N'MOVIE', N'Attack of the Unknown', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'A SWAT team transporting a crime syndicate boss finds themselves trapped inside a county detention center during a alien invasion starring Richard Grieco (21 Jump Street, Tara Reid (American Pie) and Robert LaSardo (General Hospital).'),
(9354, N's9354', N'MOVIE', N'Apology for Murder', NULL, 1945, N'13+', 64, N'MINUTES', N'64 min', N'When a reporter helps his girlfriend murder her rich husband, an innocent man gets the blame and faces execution.'),
(9355, N's9355', N'TV_SHOW', N'Amnesia', NULL, 2004, N'16+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'When Detective Sergeant Mackenzie Stone''s wife disappeared without a trace five years ago, his life imploded. Meanwhile, for the last five years John Dean has suffered from total amnesia following a head injury. He has rebuilt his life, running a small shipyard repair shop with new wife Jenna. Stone''s continual search of missing person records causes their paths to cross.'),
(9356, N's9356', N'MOVIE', N'All That Matters', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'"All That Matters" is about an insurance adjuster who wants to be a travel blogger.'),
(9357, N's9357', N'MOVIE', N'Zombie Massacre', NULL, 2013, N'18+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'A team of soldiers who are assembled to help end a zombie outbreak in a Romanian town.'),
(9358, N's9358', N'MOVIE', N'Videola', NULL, 2016, N'13+', 72, N'MINUTES', N'72 min', N'A family with a grisly secret, led by their troubled matriarch (Sean Young), struggles to keep their vintage local video store afloat while in search for their missing twin daughter, who pulls them all into a global underworld of crime and mixed morals. A mysterious figure, with a vision of the world riding the line between better and worse, provides a possible outlet for the family in need.'),
(9359, N's9359', N'MOVIE', N'Unspeakable', NULL, 2003, N'R', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'Unspeakable is a tense and terrifying psycho-thriller that explodes and reconstructs a classic story, a compelling and modern retelling of Beauty and the Beast set in the extreme life of death row.'),
(9360, N's9360', N'MOVIE', N'Top Five', NULL, 2014, N'R', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Written, directed and starring Chris Rock, Top Five tells the story of New York City comedian-turned-film star Andre Allen, whose unexpected encounter with a journalist forces him to confront the comedy career-and the past-that he''s left behind.'),
(9361, N's9361', N'MOVIE', N'Timber the Treasure Dog', NULL, 2016, N'PG', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'If adventure has a name and is a dog, it''s Timber the Treasure Dog! Timber is an energetic Alaskan Husky who shows up at the doorstep of Mikey Jones, a 12-year-old boy living with his 16-year-old sister, Clair and his father, Emmet at their ranch in Montana. Left to Mikey by his grandpa, Timber arrives just in time because this family needs his help and fast!'),
(9362, N's9362', N'MOVIE', N'TikTok', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 43, N'MINUTES', N'43 min', N'TikTok: it''s the social media app which has come to define our perception of Gen Z, and which has firmly embedded itself within the covid-era zeitgeist. A phenomenally popular platform, more than a billion users scroll through its endless feeds, and it''s turned ordinary people into overnight internet stars.'),
(9363, N's9363', N'TV_SHOW', N'This is Us', N'2021-10-03', 2020, N'16+', 4, N'SEASONS', N'4 Seasons', N'This Is Us chronicles the Pearson family across the decades and reveals how the tiniest events in our lives impact who we become and can transcend time, distance and even death.'),
(9364, N's9364', N'MOVIE', N'The Right Kind of Wrong', NULL, 2014, N'R', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'A failed-writer-turned-dishwasher made famous for his many flaws and shortcomings in his ex-wife''s blog, "Why You Suck," meets the girl of his dreams... on the day she is marrying the perfect man.'),
(9365, N's9365', N'MOVIE', N'The Passion of The Christ', NULL, 2004, N'R', 127, N'MINUTES', N'127 min', N'Depicts the final twelve hours in the life of Jesus of Nazareth, on the day of his crucifixion in Jerusalem.'),
(9366, N's9366', N'MOVIE', N'The Pack', NULL, 2009, N'13+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'In a legally plausible case, inspired by true events, an ambitious Assistant District Attorney prosecutes a wife and mother (Lucie Arnaz) for murder after her forty-seven-year-old husband dies of lung cancer, potentially caused by her second-hand smoke. The case is further complicated as the DA loops in the woman''s twenty-four-year-old son to testify against his mother.'),
(9367, N's9367', N'MOVIE', N'The Human Solution', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'A harrowing family drama plays out, when August Persson, a doctor and participant in the eugenics program of 1930''s Sweden, reunites with his estranged wife, who he discovers is pregnant. August''s life is turned upside down when his wife dies in childbirth, leaving behind a mixed-race baby girl he decides to raise as his own. Recipient of the ReFrame stamp for gender-balanced production.'),
(9368, N's9368', N'MOVIE', N'The Girl Who Killed Her Parents', NULL, 2021, N'NR', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'A psychological thriller surrounding the real murders of Manfred and Marísia von Richthofen orchestrated by their own daughter, Suzane, along with her boyfriend and brother-in-law, the Cravinhos brothers.'),
(9369, N's9369', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Exorcist', NULL, 2017, N'18+', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'Opening an entirely new chapter in the iconic franchise, Season Two of THE EXORCIST finds FATHER TOMAS ORTEGA (Alfonso Herrera) and a newly collarless MARCUS KEANE (Ben Daniels) out of Chicago and heading west, on a collision course with Hell.'),
(9370, N's9370', N'MOVIE', N'The Boy Who Killed My Parents', NULL, 2021, N'NR', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'The Boy Who Killed My Parents presents de Suzane von Richthofen''s point of view of the events that led to the death of her parents. A real crime drama about one of the most shocking murder cases of Brazil.'),
(9371, N's9371', N'MOVIE', N'Terror Trap', NULL, 2010, N'R', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'While driving at night, the car of estranged couple Don and Nancy is hit twice by another car in the middle of nowhere. Nancy asks for help and sheriff Cleveland offers to take them to the nearby Motel Royal Vista. The couple is disturbed by noises and screams from inside the next room, but soon they realize that they are part of a sick and deadly game, and their lives are threatened.'),
(9372, N's9372', N'TV_SHOW', N'Startup', N'2021-10-03', 2016, N'18+', 3, N'SEASONS', N'3 Seasons', N'Forced to fund a tech company with dirty money from unsuspecting places while forming ties with a dangerous Haitian gang, the fight to build a business pales in comparison to the fight to stay alive, especially when there''s a vehement FBI agent who wields the power to make or break those he comes in contact with – and not always for the right reasons.'),
(9373, N's9373', N'MOVIE', N'Sight Unseen', NULL, 1990, N'16+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'A rich woman becomes paranoid after losing her daughter to a so-called Kabuki Killer.'),
(9374, N's9374', N'MOVIE', N'Secret of NIMH 2: Timmy to the Rescue', NULL, 1998, N'G', 69, N'MINUTES', N'69 min', N'The rats and mice, made intellectually superior in the original Secret of N.I.M.H., return to Thorn Valley to groom their destined leader - young Timmy Brisby.'),
(9375, N's9375', N'MOVIE', N'Prometheus (4K UHD)', NULL, 2012, N'R', 124, N'MINUTES', N'124 min', N'A team of explorers discover a clue to the origins of mankind on Earth, leading them on a journey through the universe. There, they must fight a battle to save the future of the human race.'),
(9376, N's9376', N'MOVIE', N'Prometheus', NULL, 2012, N'R', 124, N'MINUTES', N'124 min', N'HD. A space crew journeys to a remote world in search of man''s origins in Ridley Scott''s thrilling sci-fi opus.'),
(9377, N's9377', N'MOVIE', N'Nootokka Jillala Andagadu', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 119, N'MINUTES', N'119 min', N'Gotti Satyanarayana or GSN, a man with premature baldness is unmarried and works at a real estate company. There he meets the beautiful Anjali, and the sparks fly between the two. GSN keeps his baldness hidden from Anjali and the people around him. What happens once his secret gets out? Will Anjali still be with him? Forms the rest of the story.'),
(9378, N's9378', N'MOVIE', N'Noddy Saves Christmas', NULL, 2004, N'G', 26, N'MINUTES', N'26 min', N'As snow-covered Toy Town excitedly prepares for Christmas, Noddy''s mission is to finally meet Santa Claus. On a visit to Big-Ear''s house, Noddy''s wish actually comes true! But Santa Claus is in big trouble! With his new friends Santa and Dasher the reindeer, Noddy goes on a whirlwind adventure to Save Christmas...!'),
(9379, N's9379', N'MOVIE', N'New France', NULL, 2005, N'PG-13', 137, N'MINUTES', N'137 min', N'In the mid-18th Century, as England and France battle over control of Canada, an epic romance between a peasant woman and a trapper unfurls.'),
(9380, N's9380', N'MOVIE', N'Morphle Halloween Special - The Halloween Candy Magic Pet', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 22, N'MINUTES', N'22 min', N'Join Mila and Morphle on a mystery-filled Halloween adventure! Jam-packed with morphs, costumes, twists turns and spooky morphing fun. This 22-minute Halloween Special will be a kooky, spooky ride! We meet the new Magic Pet Candyray who can turn anything or anyone into candy!'),
(9381, N's9381', N'MOVIE', N'Maradona - the hand of god', NULL, 2007, N'13+', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'The life of the former football player Diego Armando Maradona is recreated in this film, from his childhood up to his first heart attack and his firm decision of recovering himself, passing through his stage of largest football glory when he was awarded with ten titles. This helped him to be chosen, in 2000, as the best athlete in the century, in a vote promoted by the FIFA.'),
(9382, N's9382', N'MOVIE', N'Love and Love Only', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 131, N'MINUTES', N'131 min', N'When a rich Indian International student falls for a working-class Australian girl, who is crazily in love with him, how will he handle the cultural differences and succeed in his love, against his parents'' plans for his future?'),
(9383, N's9383', N'MOVIE', N'Held up', NULL, 2010, N'16+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'Ray (Jon Dore) is a bored bank teller who hates everything about his life. Everything changes when not 1 but 2 groups of bank robbers bust through the door. Suddenly, Ray''s worst day has become his best day ever.'),
(9384, N's9384', N'MOVIE', N'Harlan County War', NULL, 2000, N'16+', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'A Kentucky woman whose mine-worker husband is nearly killed in a cave-in, and whose father is slowly dying of black lung disease, joins the picket lines for a long, violent strike.'),
(9385, N's9385', N'MOVIE', N'For You I Die', NULL, 1947, N'13+', 75, N'MINUTES', N'75 min', N'A young convict, Johnny Coulter, serving as a trustee and with only a year remaining on his sentence, is forced to participate in a prison break by one of the hardened criminals. They separate after the break but circumstances bring them together again. Johnny and a waitress, Hope Novak, fall in love and, together, they help the law recapture the escapee and his henchmen.'),
(9386, N's9386', N'MOVIE', N'Flawless', NULL, 1999, N'R', 111, N'MINUTES', N'111 min', N'After suffering a stroke, a tough and highly conservative cop-turned-security guard (Robert De Niro) requires voice lessons in order to heal, but his only option is his drag queen neighbor (Philip Seymour Hoffman)...whom he despises.'),
(9387, N's9387', N'MOVIE', N'Edgar Allan Poe''s Requiem for the Damned', NULL, 2012, N'16+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'Inspired by five of Poe''s most terrifying tales, five filmmakers have banded together to create the ultimate tribute to the master: Edgar Allan Poe''s Requiem For The Damned.'),
(9388, N's9388', N'MOVIE', N'Eddie Izzard: Circle', NULL, 2002, N'18+', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'Live comedy with the master of sublime weirdness, Eddie Izzard, recorded in New York, 26 June 2000.'),
(9389, N's9389', N'MOVIE', N'Criminal Mind', NULL, 1993, N'R', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A young District Attorney pays a visit to his older brother, who is a Mafia boss. The older brother forces his girlfriend and his brother to witness a double murder, then sets them up so an Asian organized crime gang believes they committed the murders.'),
(9390, N's9390', N'MOVIE', N'Cracking Up', NULL, 1977, N'R', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'California is devastated by a big earthquake and, in a series of hilarious vignettes, a television station conducts interviews with the citizenry.'),
(9391, N's9391', N'MOVIE', N'Code Red', NULL, 2014, N'16+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'A Special Forces soldier is sent into Bulgaria when a chemical agent from WWII is uncovered that can reanimate the dead.'),
(9392, N's9392', N'MOVIE', N'Vallanzasca angel of evil', NULL, 2011, N'18+', 128, N'MINUTES', N'128 min', N'One of Italy''s most infamous killers, Renato Vallanzasca is serving four life sentences for the murder of multiple police officers and armed robbery. The film is a biography of Renato Vallanzasca, the Milanese thief, kidnapper and underworld matinee idol who in the 1970s and early ''80s embarrassed the Italian police before his final apprehension and multiple life sentences.'),
(9393, N's9393', N'MOVIE', N'Undergods', NULL, 2021, N'R', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'An otherworldly journey through a Europe in decline...UNDERGODS is a collection of darkly humorous, fantasy tales about failed societies and doomed fortune.'),
(9394, N's9394', N'TV_SHOW', N'Two and a Half Men', N'2021-10-04', 2015, N'TV-NR', 11, N'SEASONS', N'11 Seasons', N'Walden Schmidt and Alan Harper (Ashton Kutcher and Jon Cryer) have spent another year searching for the ideal life in their Malibu beach house. In the 12th and final season, Alan and Walden will continue their search for true love, contentment and the meaning of life. And they may actually find a couple of those things!'),
(9395, N's9395', N'MOVIE', N'The Blackout Experiment', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'6 strangers wake up inside a room garnished with weapons and are forced to kill each other or watch someone they care deeply about die.'),
(9396, N's9396', N'MOVIE', N'Tell It to the Bees', NULL, 2018, N'18+', 108, N'MINUTES', N'108 min', N'In rural Scotland in 1952, a doctor (Academy Award winner Anna Paquin) develops a controversial relationship with her young patient''s mother (Holliday Grainger). Based on the best-selling novel.'),
(9397, N's9397', N'MOVIE', N'No Loss, No Gain', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'An unnamed idealist seeking justice for a massive banking scandal seizes a suburban bank. Caught in the vigilante''s web are ordinary people faced with an opportunity to make millions - if they go along with his mysterious "Robin Hood" plan.'),
(9398, N's9398', N'MOVIE', N'Medusa', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'After being bitten by a snake, a young woman experiences changes to her senses, needs and appearance. As she begins to shed her old self, she is guided by a mysterious leader, who shows her the true power of her mutations.'),
(9399, N's9399', N'MOVIE', N'Marathon', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'An unprofessional film crew follows five amateur runners as they train for Devil''s Canyon Marathon, an offbeat desert race organized by a desperate shoe store owner pulling out all the stops to celebrate its 15th year.'),
(9400, N's9400', N'MOVIE', N'Baby Brokers', NULL, 1994, N'13+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Debbie is an LA doctor keen on adopting a baby. She is ripped off by a couple who at first appear willing to sell their child to her.');
INSERT INTO dbo.content (id, source_id, content_type, title, date_added, release_year, rating, duration_value, duration_unit, duration_text, description) VALUES
(9401, N's9401', N'MOVIE', N'Abandoned and Deceived', NULL, 1995, N'13+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'The film is the story of woman who is denied the pensions for her children by her ex-husband. Therefore she has to fight for her rights by appealing the courts of justice and the bureaucracy of the state.'),
(9402, N's9402', N'TV_SHOW', N'Supermansion', N'2021-10-05', 2019, N'TV-NR', 3, N'SEASONS', N'3 Seasons', N'A group of superheroes, led by Titanium Rex, find it''s sometimes easier to take down villains than live together harmoniously under one roof.'),
(9403, N's9403', N'MOVIE', N'Sharks Of The Corn', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'Strange things are happening in Druid Hills, Kentucky. People are saying there are "large Great White sharks swimming in the corn stalks!" Meanwhile, serial killer Teddy Bo Lucas is arrested for killing dozens of people using shark jaws and teeth as weapons. Chief Vera Scheider is caught in the middle, trying to figure out if her missing twin sister Lorna might be one of them.'),
(9404, N's9404', N'MOVIE', N'Northmen: A Viking Saga', NULL, 2015, N'R', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'When a storm decimates their longboat and strands them behind enemy lines, a crew of Viking raiders must cut through the harsh, unknown territory to reach the safety of a Viking stronghold.'),
(9405, N's9405', N'MOVIE', N'Maggie Shayne''s Embrace the Twilight', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 140, N'MINUTES', N'140 min', N'A seductive vampire and an ex-soldier must protect the only human-vampire hybrid from dangerous mercenaries who seek the secrets of her immortality.'),
(9406, N's9406', N'MOVIE', N'Hell Behind Bars', NULL, 1984, N'18+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'A woman murders her boyfriends and steals some diamonds he has smuggled. She gets found out though, and locked in a prison with an evil sadistic lesbian warden. She immediately sets about planning her escape with some of her fellow inmates, but the plans are even more difficult than they seemed when set in motion.'),
(9407, N's9407', N'MOVIE', N'Head Count', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'During a weekend getaway to Joshua Tree, a group of teenagers find themselves falling prey to a supernatural creature that targets them to complete a vicious ancient ritual.'),
(9408, N's9408', N'MOVIE', N'Blame', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'While on vacation in rural Wisconsin, five friends seek refuge in a lone building after their vehicle crashes in a vicious snow storm. With no cell phone service, the group splits up to find help, but when they reunite, one of them is found dead.'),
(9409, N's9409', N'MOVIE', N'Behind The Sightings', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'Based on over 112 hours of footage recovered from the personal belongings of aspiring filmmakers Todd and Jessica Smith. The husband and wife filmmaking duo were investigating the 2016 creepy clown sighting epidemic.'),
(9410, N's9410', N'MOVIE', N'Almost Famous', NULL, 2000, N'R', 161, N'MINUTES', N'161 min', N'Director/Writer Cameron Crowe won an Oscar for this deeply personal and universally entertaining coming-of-age story, following a 15-year-old journalist on the road with an up-and-coming rock band in the early 1970s.'),
(9411, N's9411', N'MOVIE', N'Wolves', NULL, 2014, N'R', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A high-school student wakes to find he is changing into something vicious, unpredictable and wild. He goes in search of his true heritage after his parents are viciously murdered.'),
(9412, N's9412', N'MOVIE', N'Wishmaster', NULL, 1997, N'R', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'From executive producer Wes Craven comes this fantasy-horror cult classic that spawned three sequels. When a jewelry appraiser is given an ancient gem, she unwittingly unleashes an immortal spirit that grants humans wishes in exchange for their souls.'),
(9413, N's9413', N'TV_SHOW', N'Vroomiz', NULL, 2017, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Vroomiz is a high-octane series that features a cast of funny and lovable talking vehicles shaped like adorable animals. In Zippy City every adventure is a high-speed race filled with learning, leaning to the curves, swoop through the loop-de-loops and put the pedal to the metal.'),
(9414, N's9414', N'MOVIE', N'Us', NULL, 1991, N'16+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'In his final role, Michael Landon plays a man trying to reunite his family when, after eighteen years behind bars, he is proven innocent. Co-starring David Speilberg and Barney Martin.'),
(9415, N's9415', N'MOVIE', N'Tuhya Dharma Koncha', NULL, 2013, N'13+', 118, N'MINUTES', N'118 min', N'Kawdu and Bhulabai are a tribal couple living in a tiger reserve. When presented with a desperate hope for survival, Bhulabai willingly converts into Christianity, only to face the wrath of local sentiments and religious fanatics. The change in beliefs causes the family to be shunned by her community, but that''s just the beginning of their problems.'),
(9416, N's9416', N'MOVIE', N'Trophy', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 40, N'MINUTES', N'40 min', N'A joke that leads to disaster.Two male and female students begin a joke with their teacher. They play the teacher and make fun of him. The teacher who has been humiliated by his students is slowly becoming dominant and avenges them. This joke that started by the boy and the girl eventually leads to a disaster and a dramatic end.'),
(9417, N's9417', N'TV_SHOW', N'Tomorrow''s Joe 2 (Original Japanese Audio)', N'2021-10-06', 1981, N'13+', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'Joe, one of the top ranked boxers in the world, no longer has the yearning or desire to enter the ring again after killing his previous opponent by landing a wicked left jab to his temple. His confidence and competitive spirit is restored when he decides to overcome his fear by facing the uncrowned king from Venezuela, Carlos Rivera.'),
(9418, N's9418', N'MOVIE', N'The Tall Texan', NULL, 2021, N'NR', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'A group of disparate travelers journey together through the Southwest soon find trouble when they all get gold fever. The action and drama are heightened when they discover gold. The "Tall Texan" (Lloyd Bridges), is a suspected murderer in the custody of sheriff Lee J. Cobb, and now stranded in Indian territory after a Comanche attack on their stagecoach.'),
(9419, N's9419', N'MOVIE', N'The Slime People', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 77, N'MINUTES', N'77 min', N'"Golden Turkey" fans, attention! It''s a veritable voyage to the bottom of the sci-fi barrel as prehistoric "Slime People" emerge from the sewers of Los Angeles! The atom-age U.S. army is no match for this small band of spear-toting boogeymen and the city is evacuated.'),
(9420, N's9420', N'MOVIE', N'The Sacrament', NULL, 2014, N'R', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'Two journalists track a friend''s estranged sister to the remote world of "Eden Parish," a rural utopia overseen by a mysterious leader known only as "Father." It quickly becomes evident to the newcomers that this paradise may not be as it seems.'),
(9421, N's9421', N'MOVIE', N'The Rangers: Bloodstone', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'An elite King''s Ranger fueled by vengeance embarks on a journey to save his daughter and village from the forces of darkness.'),
(9422, N's9422', N'MOVIE', N'The Dark Dance', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'The clash between art and politics come to a head in this LGBTQ drama. It''s populism against smaller artistic endeavors in this beautifully shot Italian film.'),
(9423, N's9423', N'MOVIE', N'The Collingswood Story', NULL, 2002, N'16+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'Years before Zoom and FaceTime the micro-budget film "The Collingswood Story" took the indie horror scene by storm. When Rebecca went away to college her boyfriend John thought webcams would help them stay in touch. But idle curiosity leads to a dark secret when they video chat with Vera Madeline, an online psychic, who initiates a deadly reign of terror over their lives.'),
(9424, N's9424', N'MOVIE', N'Tarzan', NULL, 2014, N'PG', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'Tarzan must protect the jungle - and Jane - from greedy New York City businessmen who want to destroy his home for profit in this animated family adventure.'),
(9425, N's9425', N'MOVIE', N'Tainted Blood', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'A disturbed drug addicted killer, Stephen, is forced to produce snuff films for an underworld crime organization to repay a long standing debt. As the mutilated bodies start to pile up around him, his savage crimes increase in their intensity. Stephen becomes paranoid that the organization is out to destroy him. He realizes he must make a stand and in an ultra violent finale.'),
(9426, N's9426', N'MOVIE', N'Surrender: Hell!', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'The true-life WWII drama about Col. Blackburn who avoided capture by the Japanese in the Philippines by venturing far into the unforgiving jungle, battling disease, starvation, and hostile fire at every turn. He finally amassed a platoon of natives (including headhunters) to his cause, and lead successful attacks on the enemy.'),
(9427, N's9427', N'MOVIE', N'Spare Room', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'When a mysterious veteran plagued by flashbacks and guilt after a tour in Afghanistan rents a room from a struggling young waitress caring for her 15 year old brother with Down Syndrome, their attraction sparks unforeseen consequence.'),
(9428, N's9428', N'TV_SHOW', N'Song of Youth', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'During the Ming dynasty, under Long Qing''s rule, Lin Shao Chun''s family was destroyed when her father faced accusations of corruption. While attending a performance of the acting troupe Shao Chun has joined, Sun Yun Lou, a wealthy young master, quickly falls for her. With Yun Lou''s help, Shao Chun disguises herself as male, allowing her to take the national entrance exams.'),
(9429, N's9429', N'MOVIE', N'Sometimes Our Friends Come Over (and sometimes we''re all alone)', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'A Who''s Afraid of Virginia Woolf for Trump''s America of sorts, Sometimes Our Friends Come Over... is the story of a couple realizing that the future of their relationship and the future of the world will be worse than the present.'),
(9430, N's9430', N'MOVIE', N'Some Freaks', NULL, 2017, N'16+', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'Two college seniors, Matt and Jill, fall in love than ever thought possible. However, when graduation comes and Jill moves cross-country to go to college and undergoes a major physical transformation - much to Matt''s surprise when he arrives to visit her. While Matt struggles to accept Jill''s new look, Jill begins questioning whether Matt is really the man she thought she knew.'),
(9431, N's9431', N'MOVIE', N'Sleep Eaters', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 101, N'MINUTES', N'101 min', N'Rachel Stephens tries to uncover the truth behind the unspeakable "Cannibal" Kelly Anderson murders that happened in her town. Meanwhile, Kelly Anderson is now on the run from the law. When their blood-soaked paths cross, we uncover a world filled with more terror, more gore, and a diabolical doctor who has a "cure" and plenty of patients to experiment on.'),
(9432, N's9432', N'MOVIE', N'Shark Huntress', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'A woman takes up her environmentalist mother''s David-and-Goliath battle after a lethal shark attack. As she ventures into remote areas-trailed by a blood-thirsty Great White-stakes rise, the death toll mounts ... and she''s out for revenge!'),
(9433, N's9433', N'MOVIE', N'Road To The Lemon Grove', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'Road to the Lemon Grove is a heartwarming story about a deceased Sicilian father trying to negotiate his way into heaven. But the only way in is to first go back and repair his relationship with his reluctant son, reunite his feuding family back in Sicily, and help all find love in places they never imagined.'),
(9434, N's9434', N'MOVIE', N'Red Sun Rising', NULL, 1994, N'R', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'Thomas Hoshino (Willson) is a tough Japanese detective, who lost his partner by a deadly Yakuza killer Jaho (Lew). He tracks down the killer and his master to Los Angeles, where he teams up with Det. Karen Ryder (Farrell). Soon they discover that Yakuza prepares a gang war and weapon smuggling. Hoshino must find a way to defeat the killer who posses mystical ninja powers.'),
(9435, N's9435', N'MOVIE', N'Price Of Love', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'A Brother and Sister facing troubling times coming up in the hardcore streets of Detroit, MI. When one chooses a life of corruption the other choses their career, when faced with a difficult decision they both pay the ultimate Price Of Love.'),
(9436, N's9436', N'MOVIE', N'Picasso', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 74, N'MINUTES', N'74 min', N'A young student, Gandharva, from a remote village in the Konkan belt of Maharashtra, is selected for the national level of the Picasso Arts Scholarship. The winner of the competition gets to travel to Spain - Picasso''s birthplace - to hone their art. Gandharva informs his parents about his selection & also a fee that needs to be paid. But his parents tell him that they cannot afford it.'),
(9437, N's9437', N'MOVIE', N'Padmavyuha', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 139, N'MINUTES', N'139 min', N'Aravind (Laksh) and Disha (Digangana) are a happy couple enjoying their married life. Suddenly, to Aravind''s shock, Disha goes missing. A few clues lead him and the cops in different directions and further confusion. Aravind believes someone well known to Disha is behind this, but having only a little knowledge about Disha''s past, would he be able to trace the kidnapper?'),
(9438, N's9438', N'MOVIE', N'Open Marriage', NULL, 2017, N'UNRATED', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'Becca and Ron''s marriage is in a rut. To rekindle their passion, they agree to experiment in an open relationship with the neighbors. All goes to plan until a stranger creates a dangerous path to betrayal, heartbreak and bloodshed.'),
(9439, N's9439', N'MOVIE', N'Obsession', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'An entrepreneur hires Sonny (Mekhi Phifer) to work as his mechanic but soon Sonny begins an affair with his employer''s alluring wife. The illicit couple concoct a perfect murder but how far are they willing to go to cover their misdeed?'),
(9440, N's9440', N'MOVIE', N'Night Feeder', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Rising fear chokes the free-wheeling underbelly of San Francisco''s Music/Art/Drug/Punk scene as a killer stalks the night to feed an unspeakable appetite. Investigation becomes obsession for journalist Jean Michaelson when she probes the gruesome murders with Inspector Alonso Bernardo. Her story hits close to home as the quickening web of death devours neighbors, friends and lovers.'),
(9441, N's9441', N'MOVIE', N'Nicholas Nickleby', NULL, 2002, N'PG', 133, N'MINUTES', N'133 min', N'After Nicholas'' father dies and leaves the family penniless, the Nickleby family moves to London to stay with their Uncle Ralph. Ralph turns abusive and separates the family, which includes sending Nicholas to the cruel and wicked Wackford Squeers. At this horrible escape from the school and set off to reunite the Nickleby family.'),
(9442, N's9442', N'MOVIE', N'Mystery of the Nile', NULL, 2005, N'ALL', 48, N'MINUTES', N'48 min', N'In 2004, a team of scientists guided by geologist Pasquale Scaturro and kayaker Gordon Brown set out on a voyage to be the first people to traverse the entirety of Africa''s Nile River. The expedition takes the group past historic ruins at the heart of Ancient Egyptian Civilization, but this terrific journey also comes with countless dangers from one of the most famous rivers in history.'),
(9443, N's9443', N'MOVIE', N'Moonwalkers', NULL, 2015, N'R', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'After failing to locate the legendary Stanley Kubrick, an unstable CIA agent must instead team up with a seedy rock band manager to develop the biggest con of all time-staging the moon landing.'),
(9444, N's9444', N'MOVIE', N'Luxor', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'When British aid worker Hana returns to the ancient city of Luxor, she comes across Sultan, an archeologist and former lover. As she wanders, haunted by the familiar place, she struggles to reconcile the choices of the past with the uncertainty of the present.'),
(9445, N's9445', N'MOVIE', N'Kanabadutaledu', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'Surya(Sukranth) and Vaishali(Sasitha) loves each other but the Vaishali family oppose it. Vaishali planned to elope with Surya, but Surya didn''t turn up, after that she was forced to marry Adithya (Yug Ram). When she inquired about Surya no one knows what happened to him then She approached a detective RamaKrishna (Sunil). With many twists and turns how the detective solved this case is the story.'),
(9446, N's9446', N'MOVIE', N'Judas', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'Charles and Victoria are veteran lobbyists who work for one of the biggest firms in the country, Gordon Inc, managed by the ruthless Gideon. They get wind that a multi-million-naira contract is up for grabs and they decide to lobby for it.'),
(9447, N's9447', N'MOVIE', N'Joy & Hope', NULL, 2020, N'13+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'Joy and Hope McGregor run Two Sisters Ranch upstate New York with their dad and longtime friend. When a handsome stranger comes to town to find inspiration to get over writer''s block, he learns how special Christmas on the ranch really is.'),
(9448, N's9448', N'TV_SHOW', N'Ivanhoe', NULL, 1997, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Sir Walter Scott''s swashbuckling tale of chivalry, romance and bravehearts in medieval England, when Saxons hated their Norman conquerors. The plot is full of heroes and knaves, knightly tournaments and bloody battles. Wilfred of Ivanhoe is estranged from his family and torn between his feelings for a beautiful Jewess and a Saxon heiress.'),
(9449, N's9449', N'TV_SHOW', N'Infinity Paranormal Investigate.', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Investigators of the night. Tune in with us as we investigate haunted locations throughout the UK. With over 30 years experience we hope to provide you with an informative yet raw as it happens series of paranormal investigations from the comfort of your own home.'),
(9450, N's9450', N'MOVIE', N'Ide Antaranga Shuddhi', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 115, N'MINUTES', N'115 min', N'Four unconnected journeys of different characters that includes journey of love, crime, lust and patriotism. Various characters are part of these journeys without any clue of how and where it would end.'),
(9451, N's9451', N'MOVIE', N'Honor Among Thieves', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'After being injured at war, a civil war veteran returns home to Texas to find he''s now enlisted in a new battle, one for his life.'),
(9452, N's9452', N'MOVIE', N'Gerri Curls', NULL, 2021, N'NR', 74, N'MINUTES', N'74 min', N'Gordon (Mike Grogan) joins forces with an unlikely ally (KK Brunson) to fight his half-sister (Renata Bresciani) for the family inheritance and his rightful place among South Florida''s curling elite.'),
(9453, N's9453', N'MOVIE', N'Filth', NULL, 2014, N'R', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'While working on a murder case, a scheming, manipulative policeman starts coming unhinged, slowly losing his grip on reality and suffering from a series of increasingly severe hallucinations as he desperately tries to hold his life together.'),
(9454, N's9454', N'MOVIE', N'Faith In Humanity Restored', NULL, 2018, N'7+', 8, N'MINUTES', N'8 min', N'A short documentary exploring the decline in numbers of people being interested in religion and/or attending church.'),
(9455, N's9455', N'MOVIE', N'EurOpen People', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 62, N'MINUTES', N'62 min', N'Our film project is called EurOpen People, i.e. the face of the positive European related with the environment he lives in.'),
(9456, N's9456', N'MOVIE', N'Eric Clapton: Standing at the Crossroads', NULL, 2021, N'7+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Eric Clapton is one of the most influential guitarists of all time. He ranked 2nd in Rolling Stone magazines list of the "100 Greatest Guitarists of All Time" and 4th in Gibson''s "Top 50 Guitarists of All Time". In this documentary feature he is interviewed in depth with contributions from Keith Richards, John Mayall, The Yardbirds, Jack Bruce and many more. It is the definitive Clapton biography.'),
(9457, N's9457', N'MOVIE', N'Driven to Dance', NULL, 2019, N'UNRATED', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'Torn between her mother’s expectations and her own dreams, a ballet dancer must prove she has what it takes to make it big.'),
(9458, N's9458', N'MOVIE', N'Die Hard 2 (4K UHD)', NULL, 1990, N'R', 123, N'MINUTES', N'123 min', N'John McClane is forced to battle mercenaries who seize control of an airport''s communications and threaten to cause plane crashes if their demands are not met.'),
(9459, N's9459', N'MOVIE', N'Dangerous Afternoon', NULL, 1961, N'13+', 59, N'MINUTES', N'59 min', N'A boarding house run by a former criminal who''s made amends since she''s become paralyzed is home to a group of older women - all whom also have criminal pasts. Word soon arrives that a former associate of the housemistress is looking for her - with plans of blackmail.'),
(9460, N's9460', N'MOVIE', N'Cover-Up', NULL, 1991, N'R', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'A tough ex-U.S. Marine journalist battles against time to save the lives of thousands of innocent people after uncovering a complex terrorist plot.'),
(9461, N's9461', N'MOVIE', N'Constantine And The Cross', NULL, 1962, N'13+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'The might of the sword and the sign of the cross unite in the most thrilling story of faith every told on the screen!'),
(9462, N's9462', N'MOVIE', N'CoComelon Halloween Songs', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 40, N'MINUTES', N'40 min', N'It''s Halloween season! Join JJ, his family and friends on a CoComelon Halloween journey. Costumes! Candy! And of course some friendly spooky scares. Sing along with CoComelon to all the Halloween fun for kids!'),
(9463, N's9463', N'MOVIE', N'Clip: Act 5 - Title 5', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 61, N'MINUTES', N'61 min', N'1'),
(9464, N's9464', N'MOVIE', N'Clip: Act 5 - Title 3', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 61, N'MINUTES', N'61 min', N'1'),
(9465, N's9465', N'MOVIE', N'Cheyenne Wildcat', NULL, 1944, N'13+', 53, N'MINUTES', N'53 min', N'Red Ryder and Little Beaver solve a case involving a murdered banker and bank fraud in a small Western town. Starring "Wild Bill" Elliott, Robert Blake, and Alice Fleming.'),
(9466, N's9466', N'MOVIE', N'CBGB', NULL, 2013, N'R', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Alan Rickman stars as legendary NYC club owner Hilly Kristal, who during the 1970s, wanted to create a venue for country, bluegrass and blues music (thus the name CBGB). When those acts became difficult to book, he shifted the club''s focus to local bands playing original music, launching the careers of Patti Smith, Blondie, the Talking Heads and the Ramones and helping to define the punk scene.'),
(9467, N's9467', N'MOVIE', N'Brahmanandam Drama Company', NULL, 2008, N'13+', 138, N'MINUTES', N'138 min', N'When Anandam''s drama company gets a chance to perform in Bangkok, three actors run into several hilarious situations as they try to bag the lead role.'),
(9468, N's9468', N'MOVIE', N'Black Book', NULL, 2007, N'R', 146, N'MINUTES', N'146 min', N'In the Nazi-occupied Netherlands during World War II, a Jewish singer infiltrates the regional Gestapo headquarters for the Dutch resistance.'),
(9469, N's9469', N'MOVIE', N'All Good Things', NULL, 2010, N'R', 101, N'MINUTES', N'101 min', N'HD. Ryan Gosling stars as the heir to a real estate dynasty who is suspected of murdering his wife in this chilling psychological thriller.'),
(9470, N's9470', N'MOVIE', N'A Spark in Nothing', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 147, N'MINUTES', N'147 min', N'With one single choice, everything changes. One life splits into two realities. One chasing a chance at love, while the other finds solace in music.'),
(9471, N's9471', N'MOVIE', N'A Monkey''s Tale', NULL, 2000, N'G', 76, N'MINUTES', N'76 min', N'Two monkey tribes are divided by centuries of fear and prejudice. When curious teenager Kom plummets from his home, his family consider him lost forever. Below, however, his life is spared, and he soon becomes the King''s favourite - which angers the Chancellor, who plans seize power for himself. Kom and loyal maid, Gina, uncover the plot, plan to reunite the two tribes and save the day.'),
(9472, N's9472', N'MOVIE', N'50 Summers', NULL, 2020, N'7+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'Follow the evolution of Minor League Baseball over the last half century through the ups and downs of the Omaha franchise as they kick-off their historic 50th season as the affiliate of the KC Royals -the longest in Triple A baseball.'),
(9473, N's9473', N'MOVIE', N'What Lies Beneath', NULL, 2016, N'13+', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'After many years abroad, a woman''s homecoming becomes a nightmare as she''s the target of violent attacks. To stop them, she must dig deep into the darkness of her family''s past.'),
(9474, N's9474', N'MOVIE', N'Warning From Space', NULL, 1956, N'7+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'As Japan is rocked by mysterious sightings of UFOs over Tokyo and large one-eyed aliens attempting contact, scientists collaborate to investigate the unexpected rise in extraterrestrial activity. Unbeknownst to them, one of the aliens has already assumed human form and is about to deliver a very important message... that could be humanity''s last hope for survival.'),
(9475, N's9475', N'MOVIE', N'Wallflower', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'Based on the shocking untold American tragedy, a troubled loner is befriended by an eccentric group of ravers and finds himself conflicted about his intentions.'),
(9476, N's9476', N'TV_SHOW', N'True Horror', NULL, 2018, N'16+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Drawing on the testimonies from people at the centre of each story and other witnesses, this docudrama presents true encounters with the paranormal.'),
(9477, N's9477', N'MOVIE', N'Trapped Child', NULL, 2016, N'13+', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'A mother and her son plan a surprise visit to Los Angeles to see her husband/his father. Halfway there they get into a terrible accident in the middle of nowhere and now must fight to survive.'),
(9478, N's9478', N'TV_SHOW', N'Too Too Boy', NULL, 2019, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Too Too Boy is all set to laugh and learn! He''s full of wild ideas, but trouble seems to find him at every corner. Everything and anything amazes him as he explores the world around him with wonder and excitement.'),
(9479, N's9479', N'MOVIE', N'The Whistle Blower', NULL, 1987, N'PG', 104, N'MINUTES', N'104 min', N'In this gripping espionage thriller, English patriot & army vet Frank Jones (Michael Caine) is only mildly concerned when his son Bob, who works for the British Secret Service, says dirty dealings are afoot at the agency. But when Bob is murdered under mysterious circumstances, Frank''s inquiries thrust him into the middle of a rat''s nest of government deceit that could cost Frank his own life!'),
(9480, N's9480', N'MOVIE', N'The Undertaker', NULL, 1988, N'18+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'A deranged undertaker kills various people to keep as his friends in his seedy funeral home.'),
(9481, N's9481', N'MOVIE', N'The People of the Kattawapiskak River', NULL, 2012, N'13+', 50, N'MINUTES', N'50 min', N'The people of the Attawapiskat First Nation were thrust into the national spotlight in 2012 when the impoverished living conditions on their reserve became an issue of national debate. With The People of the Kattawapiskak River, Abenaki director Alanis Obomsawin quietly attends as community members tell their own story, shedding light on a history of dispossession and official indifference.'),
(9482, N's9482', N'MOVIE', N'The Host (English Subtitled)', NULL, 2006, N'R', 120, N'MINUTES', N'120 min', N'On 09 February 2000, the American military base of Yongson releases toxic chemicals in the drain to the Han River under the direct order of an arrogant coroner. Six years later, a mutant squid monster emerges from Seoul''s Han River and focuses its attention on attacking people.'),
(9483, N's9483', N'MOVIE', N'The Green Sea', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'A troubled musician lives in self-imposed isolation until a chance meeting lures her into a potent mystery, tied to the unexpected appearance of a wayward teen girl and an enigmatic stalker who lurks in the shadows of her every move.'),
(9484, N's9484', N'MOVIE', N'The Consequence', NULL, 2018, N'16+', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'Dave a struggling farmer from a poverty town of Haiti suddenly becoming a single father believes his wife death was the reason of a voodoo priest. Giving an opportunity to escape into the US, but however from the moment arrived trouble seemed to follow. this picture depict an immigrant man faced with no options is a dangerous one.'),
(9485, N's9485', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Best of Videogyan', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'From singing gorillas to classic nursery rhymes and fairy tales, the best of Videogyan is a collection of animated stories and sing alongs for young children.'),
(9486, N's9486', N'TV_SHOW', N'Piper''s Pony Tales', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'When Piper makes up stories about her toy ponies, they magically come to life through the power of her imagination, transporting her and her friends into amazing adventures!'),
(9487, N's9487', N'TV_SHOW', N'Pinkfong! Let''s Booksplore with Hogi: Space', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Welcome to the mysterious library where books fly around! Follow Hogi in this adventure. Which book will Hogi open next?'),
(9488, N's9488', N'MOVIE', N'Parched 2: Hangry', NULL, 2020, N'16+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'A social media influencer brings her friends to an Airbnb lake house to party. When an appetite stimulant is mistakenly dumped into the lake and the guests go for a dip, they emerge ravenous and insatiable.'),
(9489, N's9489', N'MOVIE', N'Open Five 2', NULL, 2012, N'16+', 66, N'MINUTES', N'66 min', N'A relationship drama set amid a winter van trip from New York to New Orleans. A loose continuation of the 2010 film Open 5.'),
(9490, N's9490', N'MOVIE', N'One', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 151, N'MINUTES', N'151 min', N'A righteous politician''s unflinching loyalty to his ideologies is sorely tested after some damning allegations are levelled against him.'),
(9491, N's9491', N'TV_SHOW', N'Nick Baker''s Weird Creatures', NULL, 2007, N'7+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Nick Baker searches for some of nature''s Weird Creatures - from the master of disguise the mimic octopus to the tiny primate who''s eyes are literary bigger than it''s belly. Some would dismiss these oddities as freaks of nature, but for Nick, these are the unsung heroes of evolutionary biology.'),
(9492, N's9492', N'MOVIE', N'My Ancestors Were Rogues and Murderers', NULL, 2005, N'13+', 55, N'MINUTES', N'55 min', N'Revisiting the PR coup that launched the animal rights movement onto the international stage: the 1977 Newfoundland visit, orchestrated by the International Fund for Animal Welfare, of actress turned activist Brigitte Bardot to protest the area''s ancestral sealing activities. Soon, inhabitants of the island''s northern outports we''re being introduced to the world as the epitome of brutality.'),
(9493, N's9493', N'MOVIE', N'Messalina', NULL, 1960, N'13+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'Scheming Messalina marries Roman Emperor Claudius but goes too far with a gladiator.'),
(9494, N's9494', N'MOVIE', N'Magari resto (Maybe I''ll stay)', NULL, 2020, N'13+', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'Francesca is getting ready for her wedding, when she realizes that something in her life doesn''t work. She starts asking herself important questions and looking for answers, even in faith, thanks to the help of Don Fabio. At the end she stumbles upon the truth that will become the only useful element for making her choice.'),
(9495, N's9495', N'MOVIE', N'Made in Chinatown', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'It''s Goodfellas meets Ip Man when a young Chinese nobody sets out to become a Don in the Italian Mafia. But tensions are high between the two cultures already as they move into each other''s turf and a dirty crime commissioner is playing both sides. It turns out that earning respect, finding love, and discovering his identity doesn''t come so easy. He''ll have to fight his way to the top.'),
(9496, N's9496', N'MOVIE', N'Lured Innocence', NULL, 2000, N'R', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'Elsie Townsend is a country towns-girl who wants to leave far away and get rich. She becomes the spoiled mistress of married local businessman Rick Chambers, but when his sickly wife Martha tells her to fear he wants to kill her to be free and yet keep her money, accepts to kill him together- which is a setup to scare Martha to dead.'),
(9497, N's9497', N'MOVIE', N'Legend of a Warrior', NULL, 2012, N'13+', 78, N'MINUTES', N'78 min', N'In this feature length documentary, filmmaker Corey Lee attempts to reconnect with his father, renowned martial artist Frank Lee. Frank''s status as legendary street fighter and coach have kept him at an emotional (and physical) distance from his son, but now the younger Lee has decided to re-enter his father''s world... a world where fighting rules.'),
(9498, N's9498', N'MOVIE', N'Lance Woods: Undeniable', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 59, N'MINUTES', N'59 min', N'In his first comedy special, Lance Woods shares his unique take on race relations, slave movies, dating and plenty of yeah-he-just-went-there moments. Undeniable showcases Lance''s distinctive ability to be an equal opportunity offender.'),
(9499, N's9499', N'MOVIE', N'La Cambiale', NULL, 1959, N'13+', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'An industrialist, who is considered rich and instead ends up in prison for insolvency, releases to two lestofanti a bill of exchange for one hundred thousand lire. The two turn it over to the owner of a tobacco shop, who in turn gives it to the owner of a pet store...'),
(9500, N's9500', N'MOVIE', N'Kept Woman', NULL, 2015, N'PG-13', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'Jessica and her fiancé finally move out of the city and into their dream home on a quiet suburban street. When their strange and mysterious new neighbor lures Jessica inside his home, she finds herself imprisoned in a meticulously decorated 1950''s bunker.'),
(9501, N's9501', N'MOVIE', N'Jurassic Galaxy', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 75, N'MINUTES', N'75 min', N'In the near future, a ship of space explorers crash land on an unknown planet. They''re soon met with some of their worst fears as they discover the planet is inhabited by monstrous dinosaurs.'),
(9502, N's9502', N'MOVIE', N'Invasion of the Cubecumbers', NULL, 2020, N'ALL', 22, N'MINUTES', N'22 min', N'When Kip applies too much fertilizer to a crop of cubecumbers, he and his family scramble to put the abundance to good use and learn some critical lessons in the process. Cubekins is a 3D animated Christian kids'' show for ages 4-7 that''s all about family, faith, and fun! Follow Kip''s adventures which show that even though the world may change from moment to moment, our Heavenly Father does not.'),
(9503, N's9503', N'MOVIE', N'Iberion', NULL, 2019, N'18+', 73, N'MINUTES', N'73 min', N'Jack is a loser who''s in love with a girl who doesn''t even know his name. His luck changes after finding the book... When he reads it, good things happen to him, but if a whole day goes by without reading the book, horrible things happen.'),
(9504, N's9504', N'MOVIE', N'I Motorizzati', NULL, 1962, N'16+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'A guy is about to become the millionth citizen to buy a car in Rome. Frightened, he decides to remain pedestrian, and recalls several stories, with new car owners as protagonists.'),
(9505, N's9505', N'MOVIE', N'Hyderabad Dreams', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 143, N'MINUTES', N'143 min', N'Five various people have dreams about their future and entered into Hyderabad but seffers a lot and finally one person helps them to come up of their problems and finally they succeeded to reaches their goal and all lives happy'),
(9506, N's9506', N'MOVIE', N'Hatched', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'An obsessive scientist discovers a way to bring dinosaurs back to life and when his family comes to visit, they find him dead, eaten by his creations. If they escape, these monsters could threaten the city, so they must be contained and destroyed.'),
(9507, N's9507', N'MOVIE', N'Gopyam - The Secret', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 121, N'MINUTES', N'121 min', N'Bahubali is a child who was sufferd by a bad police man and finally Bahubali kills shekar and rescues from all dangers. Another three girls involve in a murder and bahubali else them to came out of the problem'),
(9508, N's9508', N'MOVIE', N'Goodbye Seventies', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'In the 1970s, the golden age of gay pornography in New York City, a promising chorus boy is injured and told he will never dance again. Distraught and unimpressed with the "art" films playing seedy Times Square theaters, he gets his friends together to make their own hardcore movies. Against all odds the films are successful until drugs, AIDS and cheap video technology bring it all crashing down.'),
(9509, N's9509', N'TV_SHOW', N'Go Buster - Classic Nursery Rhymes & Songs (Made by Little Baby Bum)', N'2021-10-07', 2021, N'ALL', 5, N'SEASONS', N'5 Seasons', N'Go Buster is an animated online educational kids series watched all over the globe. Brought to you by the creators of Little Baby Bum, Go Buster encourages learning, creativity, and fun! Learn colors, shapes, and numbers with our well-loved characters! In this season, enjoy some original kids'' songs such as Where''s Buster?, Wash Your Hands, and special guest characters such as Cozy Coupe & more!'),
(9510, N's9510', N'MOVIE', N'Gaddappana Duniya (Hindi)', NULL, 2018, N'ALL', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'The story of the plight of farmers in rural villages who fall into debt traps and how one man tries to prevent them from doing so.'),
(9511, N's9511', N'TV_SHOW', N'Down Bad', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Down Bad follows three childhood friends with their own trials and tribulations as they navigate life in small town America.'),
(9512, N's9512', N'TV_SHOW', N'Cocomelon American Sign Language - Cartoons for Kids', N'2021-10-07', 2019, N'ALL', 3, N'SEASONS', N'3 Seasons', N'Watching good quality kids'' shows can be a great support in a child''s development. It is a way to explore emotions in a safe space, learn about relating to other people and about basic concepts such as vocabulary and counting. This is why we are making our hugely popular kids show ''CoComelon'' available to all kids in ASL.'),
(9513, N's9513', N'MOVIE', N'Bandivan Mi Yhya Sansari', NULL, 1988, N'ALL', 123, N'MINUTES', N'123 min', N'Bandivan Mi Ya Sansari narrates a tragic story of everywoman for whom each day has become a struggle for survival. From her early childhood, Kamal''s life is full of sorrow. As a young woman, Kamal contemplates a marriage with her best friend Keshav, but fate has other plans. Emotionally gripping, the film tells a touching story of love, sacrifice and hope.'),
(9514, N's9514', N'MOVIE', N'A Stormy Night', NULL, 2020, N'NR', 77, N'MINUTES', N'77 min', N'When a big storm threatens the city of New York, two strangers with very little in common -a Spanish documentary filmmaker and an app programmer- end up sharing shelter, challenging each other''s definitions of happiness, love and life.'),
(9515, N's9515', N'MOVIE', N'We Bought A Zoo: World Premiere', NULL, 2011, N'PG', 5, N'MINUTES', N'5 min', N'We Bought a Zoo is now available for download! Join Tava Smiley on the red carpet with the cast and crew of We Bought a Zoo featuring Matt Damon, Scarlett Johansson, Director Cameron Crowe and more!'),
(9516, N's9516', N'MOVIE', N'We Bought A Zoo: In Character with Scarlett Johansson', NULL, 2011, N'PG', 5, N'MINUTES', N'5 min', N'We Bought a Zoo is now available for download! Go behind the scenes with Scarlett Johansson as she reveals what it took to "get into character" for her role in We Bought a Zoo.'),
(9517, N's9517', N'MOVIE', N'We Bought A Zoo: In Character with Matt Damon and Scarlett Johansson', NULL, 2011, N'PG', 5, N'MINUTES', N'5 min', N'We Bought a Zoo is now available for download! Go behind the scenes with Matt Damon as he reveals what it took to "get into character" for his role in We Bought a Zoo.'),
(9518, N's9518', N'MOVIE', N'We Bought A Zoo: Direct Effect: Cameron Crowe', NULL, 2011, N'PG', 5, N'MINUTES', N'5 min', N'We Bought a Zoo is now available for download! Director Cameron Crowe lets you in on the production process. Find out what it took to make We Bought a Zoo a success.'),
(9519, N's9519', N'MOVIE', N'Untitled Horror Movie', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'A comedy about making a horror movie from the director who brought you Truth or Dare (2017). When six co-stars learn their hit TV show is about to be cancelled, they decide to shoot their own movie - after all, how hard can it be? Stuck for a plot, they unintentionally summon a demonic spirit with an aﬃnity for violence that starts picking them oﬀ, one vapid actor at a time.'),
(9520, N's9520', N'MOVIE', N'Tomorrow Never Dies (4K UHD)', NULL, 1997, N'PG-13', 119, N'MINUTES', N'119 min', N'James Bond starts another chapter in the longest-running movie series in history. The threat of World War III looms as media mogul Elliot Carver pits China and Britain against each other to complete his global communications empire.'),
(9521, N's9521', N'MOVIE', N'Tomorrow Never Dies', NULL, 1997, N'PG-13', 119, N'MINUTES', N'119 min', N'The Carver Media Group Network seems to know the news even before it happens. It''s up to James Bond to find out how and why.'),
(9522, N's9522', N'MOVIE', N'The World is Not Enough (4K UHD)', NULL, 1999, N'PG-13', 128, N'MINUTES', N'128 min', N'In the 19th film of the franchise, James Bond (Pierce Brosnan) is once again pitted against Valentin Zukovsky (Robbie Coltrane), the Russian mobster from Goldeneye. Judi Dench returns as M and Desmond Llewelyn returns as Q.'),
(9523, N's9523', N'MOVIE', N'The World Is Not Enough', NULL, 1999, N'PG-13', 128, N'MINUTES', N'128 min', N'Bond takes position as bodyguard of British oil tycoon''s daughter after a deadly mishap at MI6.'),
(9524, N's9524', N'MOVIE', N'The Wedding Trip', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'When Jack, a groomsman leaves for his best friends wedding several states away, he''s asked to pick up Samantha, a stranded bridesmaid. Jack discovers they''ve met before and had a less than friendly past.'),
(9525, N's9525', N'MOVIE', N'The Trench', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'In the vein of 1917, this epic drama is set against the ill-fated WWI backdrop where a restless platoon receives word that they will soon join the first wave of an attack. Led by a war-hardened Sargent, these young men, confined to a trench on the front lines and the dark abyss, face their destiny on the day the British Army lost the greatest number of soldiers in a single day in history.'),
(9526, N's9526', N'MOVIE', N'The Manor', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'After suffering a mild stroke, Judith Albright reluctantly moves into a historic nursing home where she becomes convinced a supernatural force is killing the residents.'),
(9527, N's9527', N'MOVIE', N'The Lumineers: III', NULL, 2019, N'13+', 44, N'MINUTES', N'44 min', N'The Lumineers'' III is a visual exploration of the band''s third and latest album. In three chapters corresponding with the album''s ten tracks, we follow three generations of a working-class family in the American Northeast.'),
(9528, N's9528', N'MOVIE', N'The Lazarus Effect', NULL, 2015, N'PG-13', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'A group of medical researchers discover a way to bring dead patients back to life.'),
(9529, N's9529', N'MOVIE', N'THE CHRISTMAS EDITION', NULL, 2020, N'ALL', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'Finding herself at a crossroads, up-and-coming journalist Jackie seizes the opportunity to run as small town newspaper in Alaska and runs a series of Christmas articles to help the struggling business.'),
(9530, N's9530', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Ambassador', N'2021-10-08', 1998, N'13+', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'Harriet Smith, the new British ambassador to Ireland, desperately wants to make her mark in this historically difficult posting and try to put the tragic murder of her husband behind her. However, the situation is made considerably worse for her by her son Nate who refuses to accept the consequences of her new ambassadorial role and still blames her for his fathers death.'),
(9531, N's9531', N'MOVIE', N'The A Team: Making a Scene', NULL, 2010, N'NR', 10, N'MINUTES', N'10 min', N'The A-Team is now available for download! The cast and crew of The A-Team bring you on set to the "Making of a Scene!" Get a behind-the-scenes look at how the action-packed Königsbank sequence was created.'),
(9532, N's9532', N'TV_SHOW', N'Sled Head 24-7', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Sled Head 24-7 is the most comprehensive snowmobile racing show on TV. Each episode provides news and information targeted to the active power sports enthusiast with destination rides, new product info, new sled reviews, and exclusive behind the scenes action at ISOC Snocross races and events.'),
(9533, N's9533', N'MOVIE', N'Quantum Of Solace (4K UHD)', NULL, 2008, N'PG-13', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'On a non-stop quest for justice that crisscrosses the globe, Bond (Daniel Craig) uncovers an intricate conspiracy by the mysterious Quantum organization to take control of one of the world''s most important natural resources! Judi Dench also stars.'),
(9534, N's9534', N'MOVIE', N'Quantum of Solace', NULL, 2008, N'PG-13', 106, N'MINUTES', N'106 min', N'HD. Seeking vengeance for his lover''s death, James Bond uncovers a conspiracy to take control of a country''s most precious natural resource.'),
(9535, N's9535', N'MOVIE', N'Pune 52', NULL, 2013, N'18+', 122, N'MINUTES', N'122 min', N'Amar Apte is a private detective based in Pune, circa 1990s. Amar spends his days snooping on cheating wives while his own wife is not too pleased, being married to an unsuccessful man. Enter Neha, a beautiful and mysterious femme fatale. As Amar works on her case, he is drawn into a mystery beyond what he bargained for.'),
(9536, N's9536', N'MOVIE', N'Pro Wrestlers VS Zombies', NULL, 2014, N'16+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Famous Wrestlers are pitted against hordes of undead when they unknowingly walk into a death trap.'),
(9537, N's9537', N'MOVIE', N'Plan', NULL, 2004, N'18+', 141, N'MINUTES', N'141 min', N'Plan Is A Bollywood Thriller Action Movie, Directed By Hriday Shetty, Starring Sanjay Dutt, Priyanka Chopra, Dino Morea and Sameera Reddy In The Lead Roles. Four Friends Bobby, Lucky, Jai And Omi Arrive In Mumbai With Dreams Of Making It Big. They Kidnap A Businessman Hoping To Extort Money From Him, But He Turns Out To Be A Gangster.'),
(9538, N's9538', N'TV_SHOW', N'Pan y Circo', N'2021-10-08', 2021, N'7+', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'Mexican actor and director Diego Luna returns with Bread and Circus, the winner series of Daytime Emmy for Best show in Spanish. In these specials, Diego Luna sets the table for guests, who will listen to others remotely, to talk about access to healthcare, the crisis of democracies, being an immigrant, and protest as a way to transform.'),
(9539, N's9539', N'MOVIE', N'Ong Bak 3', NULL, 2011, N'R', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'Martial arts legend Tony Jaa returns with more insane kicks & mind-blowing stunts in the finale to the ONG BAK trilogy, facing his ultimate challenge: a deadly showdown with a fierce supernatural warrior.'),
(9540, N's9540', N'MOVIE', N'Matthew Bourne''s The Car Man', NULL, 2017, N'13+', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'Loosely based on Bizet''s popular opera Carmen, The Car Man changes the 19th-century Spanish cigarette factory of the opera to a greasy garage-diner in the American mid-west of the 60s. The arrival of a handsome stranger disturbs the dreams and passions of those who live and work there.'),
(9541, N's9541', N'MOVIE', N'Mar Negro', NULL, 2013, N'18+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'A strange contamination strikes a fisherman''s village. When fish and shellfish become evil creatures that transmit death and destruction, the lonely Albino risks his soul for the love of his life, in a desperate fight for survival.'),
(9542, N's9542', N'MOVIE', N'Malevolent', NULL, 2017, N'13+', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'A summer camp turns into a nightmare for three high school students when paranormal events unleash.'),
(9543, N's9543', N'MOVIE', N'Madres', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'Expecting their first child, a Mexican-American couple move to a migrant farming community in 1970''s California where strange symptoms and terrifying visions threaten their new family.'),
(9544, N's9544', N'TV_SHOW', N'Like Father Like Son', NULL, 2005, N'16+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Dee Stanton seems to have it all - Progressing in her career and is engaged to her boyfriend Dominic. It''s a far cry from the day 11 years ago when she arrived home with her young son to discover that her husband had been arrested for brutally murdering four young women. Dee has moved on from those dark days, but her 15-year-old son Jamie is determined to find out more about his father.'),
(9545, N's9545', N'MOVIE', N'Lansky', NULL, 2021, N'R', 119, N'MINUTES', N'119 min', N'When the aging Meyer Lansky is investigated one last time by the Feds who suspect he has stashed away millions of dollars over half a century, the retired gangster spins a dizzying tale, revealing the untold truth about his life as the notorious boss of Murder Inc. and the National Crime Syndicate.'),
(9546, N's9546', N'MOVIE', N'Justin Bieber: Our World', NULL, 2021, N'PG', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'Justin Bieber: Our World takes viewers backstage and into the private world of the global superstar as he prepares for his NYE 2020 concert. Bieber delivers an electrifying show on the roof of the Beverly Hilton Hotel for 240 guests - and millions watching via livestream. Produced & directed by Michael D. Ratner, the film also captures personal self-shot moments between Justin & his wife, Hailey.'),
(9547, N's9547', N'TV_SHOW', N'Hidden Villages', N'2021-10-08', 2016, N'ALL', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'In this series, renowned actress Dame Penelope Keith travels through Britain''s charming villages to uncover why these places are so unique and special. Armed with her vintage ''Batsford'' travel books, Penelope explores the rich artistic, literary and royal histories of each region, discovers how time has changed village communities, and seeks out local traditions which continue to this day.'),
(9548, N's9548', N'MOVIE', N'Hero and the Terror', NULL, 1988, N'R', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'A murderer (Jack O''Halloran) escapes from an institution, determined to destroy the cop who sent him away, Chuck Norris. Norris must anticipate "The Terror''s" next move, knowing deep down he will have to face this homicidal beast alone.'),
(9549, N's9549', N'MOVIE', N'Goldeneye (4K UHD)', NULL, 1995, N'PG-13', 130, N'MINUTES', N'130 min', N'Bond is thrown right into the action before the title song with an eye-opening cliff dive onto a plane. Sporting his signature debonair attitude and pricey gadgets, Bond investigates the destruction of a Russian satellite base.'),
(9550, N's9550', N'MOVIE', N'Goldeneye', NULL, 1995, N'PG-13', 130, N'MINUTES', N'130 min', N'Bond is thrown right into the action before the title song with an eye-opening cliff dive onto a plane. Sporting his signature debonair attitude and pricey gadgets, Bond investigates the destruction of a Russian satellite base.'),
(9551, N's9551', N'MOVIE', N'Felícia 2', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 31, N'MINUTES', N'31 min', N'Some time passed and Felícia narrates important moments in her life that took place during this period. She and still has a feeling of incompleteness. Upon meeting Sandra, she will begin to question her dreams and goals in life.'),
(9552, N's9552', N'MOVIE', N'Evilution', NULL, 2009, N'18+', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'A microscopic alien form is secretly used by the Army to resurrect dead soldiers. After an experiment gone wrong, a scientist steals the last specimen and hides out in a residential building hoping to reverse the damage. One fateful night, the alien life form is set loose and turns the residence into the walking dead. He must find a way to destroy the alien possessed before the end of human race.'),
(9553, N's9553', N'MOVIE', N'Die Another Day (4K UHD)', NULL, 2002, N'PG-13', 133, N'MINUTES', N'133 min', N'James Bond''s newest mission begins with a spectacular high-speed hovercraft chase through a minefield in the demilitarized zone separating North and South Korea - and the action doesn''t let up until the credits toll.'),
(9554, N's9554', N'MOVIE', N'Die Another Day', NULL, 2002, N'PG-13', 133, N'MINUTES', N'133 min', N'Bond must discover the connection between a North Korean terrorist and an adventurous diamond broker whose looks may be deceiving.'),
(9555, N's9555', N'MOVIE', N'Death and All His Friends', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'Sean is planning to end his life, but first he must head north to say his goodbyes. But some unexpected encounters seek to interrupt his mission.'),
(9556, N's9556', N'MOVIE', N'DEAR CHRISTMAS', NULL, 2020, N'ALL', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'Natalie’s the host of a popular podcast, Holiday Love, which shares true stories of holiday romance with its listeners, but she’s never truly experienced a romance of her own. As Natalie prepares to embark on a tour for her new book, she stops back home to spend Christmas with her family where she unexpectedly begins to experience her own holiday romance as sparks ignite with firefighter, Jack.'),
(9557, N's9557', N'MOVIE', N'Dead Serious', NULL, 2021, N'NR', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'The sudden death of Javi (Nélson Polanía), a successful Influencer, comes as a surprise but he is not quite ready to leave this world so his spirit decides to stay with Martina (Jessica Cediel), his beloved wife, and take revenge from “El Severo” (Iván Marín) his most challenging rival on social media.'),
(9558, N's9558', N'MOVIE', N'Date Night: World Premiere', NULL, 2010, N'NR', 5, N'MINUTES', N'5 min', N'Date Night: World Premiere'),
(9559, N's9559', N'MOVIE', N'Date Night: Making a Scene', NULL, 2010, N'NR', 10, N'MINUTES', N'10 min', N'Date Night: Making a Scene'),
(9560, N's9560', N'MOVIE', N'Casino Royale (2006) (4K UHD)', NULL, 2006, N'PG-13', 145, N'MINUTES', N'145 min', N'Based on Ian Fleming''s first 007 novel, James Bond (Daniel Craig) must thwart a dangerous Russian spy who is funding global terrorists from winning a poker game worth millions. The 21st film in the most successful film series in cinematic history.'),
(9561, N's9561', N'MOVIE', N'C.R.Usher', NULL, 2016, N'16+', 104, N'MINUTES', N'104 min', N'A woman becomes the subject of a terror campaign from a psychotic killer when she helps police locate a wanted drug lord, who gets killed during the arrest. From award winning director Richard Groen, featuring award winning actress Julianne Carioto.'),
(9562, N's9562', N'MOVIE', N'Book Of Fire', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'On the eve of her 19th birthday, Nina finds out that she has been cursed since ancient Roman times by Emperor Justinian. She carries a plague that can wipe out the human race. The Book of Fire reveals that Nina can choose to live and infect millions, or avoid the fate by spending eternity in purgatory. She has three days to decide, and so Nina has no choice but to make her own destiny.'),
(9563, N's9563', N'MOVIE', N'Basement Jack', NULL, 2009, N'18+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'Karen, the lone survivor of a killing spree perpetrated by a teenage serial killer that''s known as "Basement Jack", has been living in fear that one day he would be released. Her worst nightmare comes true when a judge ordered his released. Soon, murders were occurring all over and Karen realizes that he was hunting her and that her only option is to find Jack and ends it. So the hunt began.'),
(9564, N's9564', N'MOVIE', N'American Renegades', NULL, 2018, N'PG-13', 105, N'MINUTES', N'105 min', N'A team of Navy SEALs is hired to salvage Nazi gold stored in a bank vault in a submerged town at the bottom of a Bosnian lake.'),
(9565, N's9565', N'MOVIE', N'A-Team: Life After Film School with Joe Carnahan', NULL, 2010, N'PG-13', 10, N'MINUTES', N'10 min', N'The A-Team is now available for download! A group of film students get the opportunity of a lifetime... to interview director Joe Carnahan of The A-Team! Join the students as they learn about the industry through the words of Joe himself.'),
(9566, N's9566', N'MOVIE', N'A Family Man', NULL, 2017, N'R', 110, N'MINUTES', N'110 min', N'Dane Jensen (Gerard Butler) is a hard-driven headhunter working at a cut-throat firm. When Dane''s boss (Willem Dafoe) pits him against Lynn Vogel (Alison Brie), Dane gears up for the professional battle of his life. When his son Ryan is given a harrowing diagnosis, Dane is suddenly pulled between achieving his professional dream and spending time with his family, who need him now more than ever.'),
(9567, N's9567', N'MOVIE', N'5th Street', NULL, 2013, N'16+', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'A vengeful husband takes on gangs and corrupt cops in this gritty vigilante thriller featuring Christian Monzon (Kill Speed) and Jason Giuliano (Red).'),
(9568, N's9568', N'MOVIE', N'Weapons Of Mass Discussion', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'A world renown atheist offers one million dollars to anyone who can prove the existence of Goa and challenge him to a debate on live radio. After defeating many unlearned Christians a small church goer faces him off and they battle for the next couple of weeks. The result will change the lives of many forever'),
(9569, N's9569', N'MOVIE', N'Villain', NULL, 2002, N'13+', 165, N'MINUTES', N'165 min', N'Shiva, a bus conductor, robs the corrupt in order to fund an organisation that aids those with disabilities. To avoid detection and trial, he pretends to be his twin, who has disabilities.'),
(9570, N's9570', N'MOVIE', N'Under the Greenwood Tree', NULL, 2005, N'7+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Amidst the surrounding farms and woodlands of the idyllic village of Mellstock, southern England, a love story grows between local boy Dick Dewey and beautiful schoolteacher Fancy Day. But in seeking her hand in marriage penniless Dick finds himself in competition with other more likely suitors, will true love win out or will the social traditions of Victorian England determine Fancy''s future?'),
(9571, N's9571', N'MOVIE', N'Un Mundo Secreto', NULL, 2013, N'18+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'A middle-class girl who embarks on a road trip across Mexico.'),
(9572, N's9572', N'MOVIE', N'The Starving Games', NULL, 2013, N'PG-13', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'In this Hunger Games spoof, Kantmiss Evershot must fight for her life in the 75th annual Starving Games, where she could also win an old ham, a coupon for a foot-long sub, and a partially eaten pickle.'),
(9573, N's9573', N'MOVIE', N'The Star', NULL, 2002, N'16+', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'World War II, 1944. Based on a novelette of the same by Emmanuil Kazakevich. The Star is a call-sign of a reconnaissance detachment behind enemy lines. Their task: to reveal the German army''s plans and find armored troops. At the cost of their lives, the soldiers inform headquarters about a massive, forthcoming attack.'),
(9574, N's9574', N'MOVIE', N'The Shadow', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 114, N'MINUTES', N'114 min', N'Juan and Lucía are two survivors in a post-apocalyptic Córdoba. After years together, both now have different goals in mind, but on their way they will meet Elena, a girl, who says she is looking for her family ...'),
(9575, N's9575', N'MOVIE', N'The Hound Of The Baskervilles (1959)', NULL, 1959, N'7+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'A hellish hound feeds upon the flesh of the heirs of Baskerville Hall. But before this beast can sink its teeth into the newest lord, it must pit its vicious fangs against the searing intellect of Sherlock Holmes (Peter Cushing) and Dr. Watson.'),
(9576, N's9576', N'MOVIE', N'The Gracefield Incident', NULL, 2017, N'PG-13', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'In Gracefield, three couples are spending a long weekend in a luxurious cabin when suddenly an uninvited guest in the form of a meteorite, comes crashing the party...'),
(9577, N's9577', N'MOVIE', N'The A-Team', NULL, 2010, N'PG-13', 119, N'MINUTES', N'119 min', N'The big screen, 21st century version of the action packed series THE A-TEAM.'),
(9578, N's9578', N'MOVIE', N'Surviving America', NULL, 2020, N'13+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'In the wake of the new Civil Rights Movement it is important to tell Black stories from those who actually live it. Shoot first and ask questions later, lynchings, redlining, food deserts, underfunded schools are just a day in the life struggle of being Black in America. Surviving America is an oral account of navigating while Black in America from the Revolutionary War until today.'),
(9579, N's9579', N'MOVIE', N'Suicide Commandos', NULL, 1968, N'13+', 95, N'MINUTES', N'95 min', N'Set in World War 2 - a British commando squad is tasked with attacking the "secret" German airfield from which German fighters have been attacking bombers which are trying to stop German tanks from reinforcing the D Day defences.'),
(9580, N's9580', N'MOVIE', N'Stomp The Yard', NULL, 2007, N'18+', 114, N'MINUTES', N'114 min', N'DJ (Columbus Short), an amazing underground street dancer, hasn''t been in college for a day before he''s entranced by a lovely co-ed, April (Meagan Good).Working as a gardener to pay the bills, DJ doesn''t fit in with the wealthier students around campus, but one thing does catch his attention – the rival fraternity competitions known as "stepping." With April''s help, DJ learns about the legacy ..'),
(9581, N's9581', N'MOVIE', N'Staying Afloat', NULL, 1993, N'16+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'In this made-for-television movie mystery, Larry Hagman stars as ex-millionaire Alexander Turnbull Hollingsworth III, who lost his fortune but maintains his lavish lifestyle by using his cunning and charm to help the Feds crack upper-crust crimes.'),
(9582, N's9582', N'TV_SHOW', N'Spoopy Movie Time', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Animated horror hosts watch public domain films and do sketches and songs about them.'),
(9583, N's9583', N'MOVIE', N'Silent Cries', NULL, 1993, N'13+', 100, N'MINUTES', N'100 min', N'A searing WWII saga of women prisoners-of-war caught in the clash between East and West. Though forced into submission, these indomitable women never cease to believe in freedom.'),
(9584, N's9584', N'MOVIE', N'Scarlet', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 114, N'MINUTES', N'114 min', N'The story of a hardworking, loving and devoted wife, mother of an autistic child who discovered her husband was having an affair with her sister'),
(9585, N's9585', N'TV_SHOW', N'Red Oaks', NULL, 2017, N'18+', 3, N'SEASONS', N'3 Seasons', N'It’s the summer of ’87 and change is in the air at Red Oaks. David is chasing his dream to become a director in NYC. Wheeler and Misty have taken their relationship to the next level but face unforeseen obstacles. Getty is making lemonade out of lemons in prison and Sam and Judy are finding new and unexplored passions. Meanwhile, back at Red Oaks, Nash finds that the club’s future is in danger.'),
(9586, N's9586', N'MOVIE', N'Rage and Honor', NULL, 1993, N'R', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'An inner city school teacher who uses the discipline of martial arts to set her students on the right path becomes involved in a police investigation of drug trafficking and gang warfare. She becomes professionally and emotionally involved with an Australian cop on special assignment to Los Angeles.'),
(9587, N's9587', N'TV_SHOW', N'NFL Next', NULL, 2021, N'TV-NR', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'It''s an all-new season of NFL Next! Join Kay Adams, Andrew Hawkins, Daniel Jeremiah and Chris Long for your weekly football fix. Ditch the suits and go beyond the X''s and O''s with Next Gen Stats as we get you ready each week for Thursday Night Football!'),
(9588, N's9588', N'MOVIE', N'Messenger of Death', NULL, 1988, N'R', 91, N'MINUTES', N'91 min', N'Charles Bronson is Garr Smith, a Denver police detective on the trail of a serial killer linked to a century-old cult of Mormon avenger – known as "unholy angels."'),
(9589, N's9589', N'MOVIE', N'Meet the Spartans', NULL, 2008, N'PG-13', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'From the creators of Date Movie comes this tongue-in-cheek parody of the sword-and-sandal epics, dubbed MEET THE SPARTANS.'),
(9590, N's9590', N'MOVIE', N'Legends of Sleepy Hollow', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'Sleepy Hollow is the home of America''s original horror story: the tale of the headless horseman. But horror doesn''t just disappear. Now, filmmakers from the area have tackled the new legends of terror in this iconic area.'),
(9591, N's9591', N'MOVIE', N'Knight and Day', NULL, 2010, N'PG-13', 110, N'MINUTES', N'110 min', N'"Big screen superstars Tom Cruise and Cameron Diaz come together in this fun, action-packed thrill-ride that will keep you on the edge of your seat. When a small-town girl named June (Diaz) meets a mysterious stranger (Cruise), she thinks she''s found the man of her dreams. But she soon discovers he''s a fugitive super-spy, who thrusts her into a thrilling cat-and-mouse chase that spans the globe. As the bullets and sparks fly, June must decide if her ""Knight"" in shining armor is a dangerous traitor or the love of her life. "'),
(9592, N's9592', N'MOVIE', N'Knifecorp', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'A group of young salespeople, who go door-to-door selling high-end knives, end up knocking on the wrong door - the home of an angry and dangerous recluse who intends to put the knives to good use against them!'),
(9593, N's9593', N'MOVIE', N'Klown Kamp Massacre', NULL, 2010, N'18+', 83, N'MINUTES', N'83 min', N'Fifteen years ago, Edwin went to clown camp to fulfill his lifelong dream of bringing laughter to the world... but nobody laughed. Now, Edwin slashes, stabs, strangles, and disembowels the clowns while laughing insanely at his own bad jokes.'),
(9594, N's9594', N'MOVIE', N'Kicking & Screaming', NULL, 1995, N'R', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'After college graduation, Grover moves in with several friends and loses his girlfriend to a fellowship in Prague. Reluctant to step into adulthood, Grover and his friends wrestle with leaving the past behind.'),
(9595, N's9595', N'MOVIE', N'John Tucker Must Die', NULL, 2006, N'PG-13', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'HD. Three high-school beauties plot to bring the cocky campus stud down after they discover they''ve all been dating him at the same time.'),
(9596, N's9596', N'MOVIE', N'Happy Little Bunnies', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'A psychotic, bunny-masked serial killer is on the prowl, carving up local perverts. Meanwhile, a disturbed young man''s therapy session takes a dark and violent turn. Is his therapist the bunny-masked killer? From the makers of How Not To Work & Claim Benefits (& other useful information for wasters).'),
(9597, N's9597', N'MOVIE', N'Haikara-San: Here Comes Miss Modern Part 1', NULL, 2018, N'13+', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'Adapted from Waki Yamato''s popular manga, Haikara-San is a heartfelt, and sometimes comical, tale of love surviving through the perils of war and separation.'),
(9598, N's9598', N'MOVIE', N'Gold Digger', NULL, 2016, N'18+', 82, N'MINUTES', N'82 min', N'A financially struggling fashion influencer meets the heir to a fortune. A relationship with one of the country''s wealthiest men is what she needs to finance her lavish lifestyle, but she finds herself conflicted when she starts to fall for him for real.'),
(9599, N's9599', N'MOVIE', N'Game on', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'A loving couple being set up by an ex boyfriend being a con in other to get a share of the wife''s huge inheritance he succeeded by using and expert who brings division among the couples and later ignite personal ego, which leads to ten playing a vindictive game to mix their marriage'),
(9600, N's9600', N'MOVIE', N'Fugitive Nights: Danger In The Desert', NULL, 1993, N'18+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Brenda Burrows (Teri Garr), a 20-year LAPD detective turned Palm Springs P.I., enlists the aide of soon-to-be-retired police detective Lynn Cutter (Sam Elliott) in an ordinary surveillance only to have another gung-ho police officer entangle them in a fugitive investigation which leads to murder.');
INSERT INTO dbo.content (id, source_id, content_type, title, date_added, release_year, rating, duration_value, duration_unit, duration_text, description) VALUES
(9601, N's9601', N'MOVIE', N'Doc West - Part 1', NULL, 2010, N'PG', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'After bandits steal his poker winnings this American legend makes his way to the next town in search of them. Seeking out his revenge during a poker game gone bad Doc West finds himself in the local town jail. When his past is exposed and a battle amongst the town breaks out in gunfire he will have to choose sides, between the outlaws or the law-abiding citizens.'),
(9602, N's9602', N'MOVIE', N'Date Night', NULL, 2010, N'PG-13', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'A typical suburban couple''s date night becomes much more than they expected when a case of mistaken identity hurtles them into non-stop adventure.'),
(9603, N's9603', N'MOVIE', N'Chinnanjiru Kiliye', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 120, N'MINUTES', N'120 min', N'A naturopathy practitioner with a strong distrust of allopathic treatments goes after the kidnappers of his daughter and expose a medical crime.dr'),
(9604, N's9604', N'MOVIE', N'Chinna Chinni Asha', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 76, N'MINUTES', N'76 min', N'Love stories are boring, really! - But are they? Well, not true. Love, even if it happened for a moment or for a decade. Fall in love with Chinna, the aspiring film maker and Chinni, the software engineer. Do their love reach the wedding destination ? How will Chinni face it when another guy (Bharath) who was challenged by Chinni takes her seriously.'),
(9605, N's9605', N'MOVIE', N'Bride Wars', NULL, 2009, N'PG', 89, N'MINUTES', N'89 min', N'When a clerical error causes a clash in wedding dates, two best friends who''d do anything for each other find themselves in a no-holds-barred, take-no-prisoners struggle that threatens to erupt into all-out war.'),
(9606, N's9606', N'MOVIE', N'Bojangles', NULL, 2001, N'18+', 101, N'MINUTES', N'101 min', N'Biography of the legendary showman Bill Robinson, better known as Mr. Bojangles.'),
(9607, N's9607', N'MOVIE', N'Blue Moon', NULL, 1999, N'18+', 92, N'MINUTES', N'92 min', N'Blue Moon is a multi-layered story about the complexities and conflicts of a family tearing apart at the seams. Sheila and Jimmy Keating run a financially-strapped restaurant and fishing business in Maine which is gradually taking a toll on their marriage. It takes a huge storm at sea for them to rekindle their love for one another.'),
(9608, N's9608', N'MOVIE', N'Ardha Shathabdham', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 116, N'MINUTES', N'116 min', N'After five decades of Independence, India''s rural landscape still throws up unanswerable questions. Can a love story bring a revolution? Witness this earthy love story of Ardhashatabdam set in the early 2000s.'),
(9609, N's9609', N'MOVIE', N'A Perfect Enemy', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'After missing his flight, a successful architect meets a mysterious young woman. They strike up a conversation that grows stranger and more twisted until it turns deadly.'),
(9610, N's9610', N'MOVIE', N'A Little Bit Zombie', NULL, 2013, N'R', 88, N'MINUTES', N'88 min', N'Infected by a virus during his bachelor party, Steve attempts to resist a deadly transformation from man to monster. But his strange mannerisms and overwhelming desire for brains are the least of his worries. With an obsessed Zombie Hunter hot on his trail, Steve must learn to resist his greatest temptations all while keeping it together so as not to incur the wrath of his Bridezilla-to-be.'),
(9611, N's9611', N'MOVIE', N'A Girl Like Grace', NULL, 2016, N'18+', 94, N'MINUTES', N'94 min', N'Raised by a single mother, a bullied 17 year-old girl seeks guidance from her best friend and the girl''s older sister.'),
(9612, N's9612', N'MOVIE', N'Wild Fire', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 80, N'MINUTES', N'80 min', N'Wild Fire is a drama about a young man, Ezie, who has been single for a while due to the high standards he has set for whoever is supposed to become his partner. Ezie finally meets Shizzle, his favourite actress and all-time crush, and they both get married despite the warnings from his family.'),
(9613, N's9613', N'MOVIE', N'White Night', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'The film unfolds during Nuit Blanche, a massive annual all night, city wide, art festival. It follows six different interweaving stories. All involved are in a period of transition in their lives, and on this one sleepless night, they will all come together, connecting, and changing each others lives forever. White Night was shot entirely in one night, by the five different directors.'),
(9614, N's9614', N'MOVIE', N'What Happens in Vegas (Extended Edition)', NULL, 2008, N'NR', 101, N'MINUTES', N'101 min', N'Jack Fuller (Ashton Kutcher) and Joy McNally (Cameron Diaz) are two strangers who awaken together to discover they''ve gotten married following a night of debauchery in Sin City...'),
(9615, N's9615', N'MOVIE', N'What Happens in Vegas', NULL, 2008, N'PG-13', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'Jack Fuller (Ashton Kutcher) and Joy McNally (Cameron Diaz) are two strangers who awaken together to discover they''ve gotten married following a night of debauchery in Sin City... and one of them has won a huge jackpot after playing the other''s quarter.'),
(9616, N's9616', N'MOVIE', N'We Bought A Zoo', NULL, 2011, N'PG', 124, N'MINUTES', N'124 min', N'HD. Widower Matt Damon comes up with a unique plan to lift his family out of their collective funk: by purchasing a ramshackle zoo.'),
(9617, N's9617', N'MOVIE', N'Tooth Fairy 2', NULL, 2012, N'PG', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'When dreamer Larry Guthrie (Larry the Cable Guy) loses his first love to the town hot shot, he decides to win her back by volunteering with the local children at her after-school program. But when Larry accidentally tells the kids the tooth fairy is make'),
(9618, N's9618', N'MOVIE', N'The Sitter (Unrated)', NULL, 2012, N'UNRATED', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'A 21-year-old guy has a night to remember when he babysits two boys and a wild eight-year-old girl.'),
(9619, N's9619', N'MOVIE', N'The Sitter', NULL, 2011, N'R', 81, N'MINUTES', N'81 min', N'HD. An adventure in babysitting leads college dropout Jonah Hill and his young charges on a raunchy adventure through New York City.'),
(9620, N's9620', N'MOVIE', N'The Shadow Side', NULL, 2020, N'18+', 54, N'MINUTES', N'54 min', N'Laura meets punctually every night with her friends in a group chat in which they explain their feelings after long days of confinement. Through the images that appear, they realize that there is something in Laura''s house that is not entirely normal. Soon, she herself will realize that, despite herself, she is not entirely alone.'),
(9621, N's9621', N'MOVIE', N'The Rocky Horror Picture Show', NULL, 1975, N'R', 99, N'MINUTES', N'99 min', N'Part campy musical, part horror film, the movie details the travails of a squeaky clean couple stranded at a creepy castle where the inhabitants sing and dance through a bacchanalian romp of murder, bisexuality and cannibalism.'),
(9622, N's9622', N'MOVIE', N'The Rocker', NULL, 2008, N'PG-13', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'Rainn Wilson (TV''s The Office) drums up huge laughs in this hilarious comedy about living in a rock ''n'' roll dream...and waking up in a midlife crisis.'),
(9623, N's9623', N'MOVIE', N'The Princess Bride (4K UHD)', NULL, 1987, N'PG', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'You''ve yet to hear the tale? Inconceivable! Join Westley (Carey Elwes) on his epic adventure to rescue the fair Buttercup (Robin Wright) from the clutches of the evil Prince Humperdinck (Chris Sarandon) in director Rob Reiner''s delightful classic!'),
(9624, N's9624', N'MOVIE', N'The Princess Bride', NULL, 1987, N'PG', 98, N'MINUTES', N'98 min', N'Based on William Goldman''s novel of the same name, The Princess Bride is staged as a book read by grandfather (Peter Falk) to his ill grandson (Fred Savage). Falk''s character assures a romance-weary Savage that the book has much more to deliver than a simpering love story, including but not limited to fencing, fighting, torture, death, true love, giants, and pirates.'),
(9625, N's9625', N'MOVIE', N'The Luzhin Defense', NULL, 2000, N'PG-13', 109, N'MINUTES', N'109 min', N'The story of an eccentric Russian Chess genius (Turturro) and the woman (Watson) who loves him, even as his obsession with the game tugs at his sanity.'),
(9626, N's9626', N'TV_SHOW', N'The Flaming Heart', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Focused on two special professions: firefighters and emergency doctors; it tells that through the test of life and death, "flame blue" and "angel white" hand in hand, sticking to the same rescue beliefs and beliefs on their respective "battlefields." It is a story of passionate love that is both romance and a comrade-in-arms.'),
(9627, N's9627', N'MOVIE', N'Thalaivii (Telugu)', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 151, N'MINUTES', N'151 min', N'Thalaivi is the dramatic story of a woman who has risen from humiliation and political defeat. Challenging the male dominated culture of Tamil Nadu politics to become the Chief Minster of the state. The movies describes the different shades of her life starting from her childhood till she became the Chief Minister for the first time in 1991.'),
(9628, N's9628', N'MOVIE', N'Thalaivii (Tamil)', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 151, N'MINUTES', N'151 min', N'Thalaivi is the dramatic story of a woman who has risen from humiliation and political defeat. Challenging the male dominated culture of Tamil Nadu politics to become the Chief Minster of the state. The movies describes the different shades of her life starting from her childhood till she became the Chief Minister for the first time in 1991.'),
(9629, N's9629', N'MOVIE', N'Thalaivii (Malayalam)', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 151, N'MINUTES', N'151 min', N'Thalaivi is the dramatic story of a woman who has risen from humiliation and political defeat. Challenging the male dominated culture of Tamil Nadu politics to become the Chief Minster of the state. The movies describes the different shades of her life starting from her childhood till she became the Chief Minister for the first time in 1991.'),
(9630, N's9630', N'MOVIE', N'Thalaivii (Kannada)', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 151, N'MINUTES', N'151 min', N'Thalaivi is the dramatic story of a woman who has risen from humiliation and political defeat. Challenging the male dominated culture of Tamil Nadu politics to become the Chief Minster of the state. The movies describes the different shades of her life starting from her childhood till she became the Chief Minister for the first time in 1991.'),
(9631, N's9631', N'MOVIE', N'Snow White', NULL, 1987, N'G', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'The ageless tale of a beautiful young princess whose jealous step- mother orders her killed so that she will be "the fairest in the land." When the henchman takes pity on her, he takes her to the house of the seven dwarves.'),
(9632, N's9632', N'MOVIE', N'Shanghai Knights', NULL, 2003, N'PG-13', 114, N'MINUTES', N'114 min', N'HD. Jackie Chan and Owen Wilson hop back in the saddle in this sequel to “Shanghai Noon” that finds the duo in London to solve a mystery.'),
(9633, N's9633', N'TV_SHOW', N'Saiyaan Way', NULL, 2018, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'3 Girls, Surrounded by intense jealousy, family intrigue & a thirst for Revenge. Qirat, Amber & Zobiya are 3 innocent, motherless sisters living with their father. Each one has her own dreams. But when the Evil tries to blackmail them, Qirat takes a painful decision. Now all of them are caught in a web of deceit and Qirat is blamed for it.'),
(9634, N's9634', N'MOVIE', N'Pretty Woman (Plus Bonus Content)', NULL, 1990, N'R', 139, N'MINUTES', N'139 min', N'When streetwise Vivian (Julia Roberts) meets billionaire Edward (Richard Gere), their lives are worlds apart. But Vivian''s energetic spirit challenges Edward''s no-nonsense approach to life, and soon they are teaching each other – and falling in love!'),
(9635, N's9635', N'MOVIE', N'Pretty Woman', NULL, 1990, N'R', 120, N'MINUTES', N'120 min', N'A classic rags-to-riches love story.'),
(9636, N's9636', N'TV_SHOW', N'Pokémon the Series: Diamond and Pearl', N'2021-10-10', 2011, N'ALL', 12, N'SEASONS', N'12 Seasons', N'Ash, Dawn, and Brock continue to travel across the Sinnoh region, facing challenges, battles, and the antics of Team Rocket! With Team Galactic out of the way, Ash can now focus on qualifying for the Sinnoh League. Meanwhile, Dawn trains to compete for her final contest ribbon, which would allow her to compete in the Sinnoh Grand Festival!'),
(9637, N's9637', N'MOVIE', N'Pieces of a Dream: A Story of Gambling', NULL, 2003, N'13+', 49, N'MINUTES', N'49 min', N'When Phillip Wong died by suicide, his family thought that silence would end their pain. Weaving together intimate conversations with those closest to Phillip, as well as her own candid reflections, his sister Michelle embarks on a personal journey. This heart-wrenching film is a sister''s uncompromising search for the truth and healing-for herself, her family, and others struggling with addiction.'),
(9638, N's9638', N'TV_SHOW', N'Paul Newman Trilogy', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'The early days of television were filled with live programs and these 3 feature a 31 year old Paul Newman in some of his first starring roles: As a punk on the road, accused of a crime he didn''t commit; a clothing manufacturer who stands up to hoodlums; and a cowardly soldier looking to get discharged from the army.'),
(9639, N's9639', N'MOVIE', N'Oven', NULL, 2019, N'7+', 2, N'MINUTES', N'2 min', N'A young mom''s lapse in attention leads to a calamity.'),
(9640, N's9640', N'MOVIE', N'No Sleep ''Til Christmas', NULL, 2018, N'16+', 85, N'MINUTES', N'85 min', N'Lizzie and Billy only fall asleep next to each other.'),
(9641, N's9641', N'MOVIE', N'Meet the Spartans (Uncut)', NULL, 2008, N'18+', 86, N'MINUTES', N'86 min', N'From the creators of Scary Movie and Date Movie comes this tongue-in-cheek parody of the sword-and-sandal epics. The heroic Leonidas, armed with nothing by leather underwear and a cape, leads a ragtag group of 13 - count ''em, 13! ? Spartans to defend their homeland against the invading Persians (whose ranks include Ghost Rider, Rocky Balboa, the Transformers, and a hunchbacked Paris Hilton... no one is safe when the Spartans take on the biggest icons in pop culture).'),
(9642, N's9642', N'MOVIE', N'Marley & Me', NULL, 2008, N'PG', 116, N'MINUTES', N'116 min', N'Jennifer Aniston and Owen Wilson unleash huge laughs as John and Jenny Grogan, a young couple contemplating the decision to have a baby. Then came Marley...an adorable Labrador pup who flunks obedience school and quickly turns his new home into a disaster area. But over the years, the Grogans come to realize that "the world''s worst dog" truly brings out the best in them.'),
(9643, N's9643', N'TV_SHOW', N'Lunkerville', N'2021-10-10', 2021, N'13+', 2, N'SEASONS', N'2 Seasons', N'Lunkerville''s launches "Get Folks Fishing", a social wellness initiative host Mike D hopes will inspire more people to add recreational fishing to their outdoor activities. Each episode is fun-packed with tips, tactics and interesting personalities and features real people with real fish stories. From bass fishing in NYC, to family fun fishing, to ice-fishing, there''s something for everyone!'),
(9644, N's9644', N'MOVIE', N'Love & Other Drugs', NULL, 2010, N'R', 112, N'MINUTES', N'112 min', N'A womanizing pfizer drug rep with no sense of direction or responsibility falls in love with a young woman afflicted with parkinson''s...'),
(9645, N's9645', N'MOVIE', N'Little Miss Sunshine', NULL, 2006, N'R', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'A family determined to get their young daughter into the finals of a beauty pageant take a cross-country trip in their VW bus. A quirky, heartfelt comedy-drama. Winner of two Oscars.'),
(9646, N's9646', N'TV_SHOW', N'Let''s Go Cozy Coupe! - Cartoons for Kids', NULL, 2021, N'ALL', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Cozy Coupe is an online series that helps kids to learn, get creative and have lots of fun! Join Cozy Coupe on his fun educational adventures for children. Tune in each week to enjoy new original kids videos.'),
(9647, N's9647', N'MOVIE', N'Knight and Day (Extended Edition)', NULL, 2010, N'PG-13', 117, N'MINUTES', N'117 min', N'SPECIAL EXTENDED EDITION! Get even MORE action and adventure in this special version of Knight and Day! Big screen superstars Tom Cruise and Cameron Diaz dazzle as action and comedy collide in this Extended Edition. When a small-town girl named June (Diaz) meets a mysterious stranger (Cruise), she thinks she''s found the man of her dreams. But she soon discovers he''s a fugitive super-spy, who thrusts her into a thrilling cat-and-mouse chase that spans the globe. As the bullets and sparks fly, June must decide if her "Knight" in shining armor is a dangerous traitor or the love of her life.'),
(9648, N's9648', N'TV_SHOW', N'Kids In The Hall', N'2021-10-10', 1995, N'TV-14', 5, N'SEASONS', N'5 Seasons', N'"The Kids in the Hall" is a unique and bizarre sketch comedy series that incites humor through an intellectual lens of comedic creativity and character driven sketches. The series brings to life the collision of art and comedy with an uncanny resemblance of current day realities and the human condition.'),
(9649, N's9649', N'MOVIE', N'Judge Dredd', NULL, 1995, N'R', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'Joseph Dredd is convicted for a crime he did not commit.'),
(9650, N's9650', N'MOVIE', N'Jack', NULL, 1996, N'PG-13', 113, N'MINUTES', N'113 min', N'Robin Williams stars as a 10-year-old in a grown-up''s body.'),
(9651, N's9651', N'MOVIE', N'I Can''t Breathe', NULL, 2017, N'18+', 32, N'MINUTES', N'32 min', N'An African American single mother''s emotional journey after her young son was gunned down by a police officer during a routine traffic stop and the consequences for both sides. Written & Directed by Kishore Tummala.'),
(9652, N's9652', N'TV_SHOW', N'Glass Room', NULL, 2019, N'16+', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Geography teacher Elena lives with her husband-businessman Artem and teenage daughter Masha in a large country house where love and peace reign. But one day the family finds a ginger kitten on the porch, and only Lena realizes that this is a sign addressed to her from the past, which she carefully hid from her husband. Will Elena be able to restore justice and maintain love and trust?'),
(9653, N's9653', N'MOVIE', N'Famo$o (4K UHD)', NULL, 2016, N'G', 111, N'MINUTES', N'111 min', N'Musicfilm with unpublished images from the life of the most famous Italian trapper: Sfera Ebbasta. Between concerts, studio sessions and lifestyle, the movie retraces his entire artistic career from the beginning together with producer Charlie Charles, to international success. With testimonials from Marracash, Shablo, Steve Aoki and Rvssian.'),
(9654, N's9654', N'MOVIE', N'Date Night (Extended Cut)', NULL, 2010, N'UNRATED', 102, N'MINUTES', N'102 min', N'A typical suburban couple''s date night becomes much more than they expected when a case of mistaken identity hurtles them into non-stop adventure.'),
(9655, N's9655', N'MOVIE', N'Dard Divorce', NULL, 2008, N'18+', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'What started with a routine divorce between Natalie Stein and her husband Tim, will soon take a turn into the unexpected and evolve into scenes of torture, bloodshed and slaughter.'),
(9656, N's9656', N'TV_SHOW', N'DaFUNdamentals Series', NULL, 2021, N'TV-Y', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'Learn "daFundamentals" through song and fun characters. This special series was born from a tune Solomon Ward wrote for his dad, Award-winning director Jon Ward who later teamed up with Grammy Award-winning songwriter Randall Crawford.'),
(9657, N's9657', N'MOVIE', N'Anaganaga Oka Nenu', NULL, 2021, N'18+', 135, N'MINUTES', N'135 min', N'Peter(hero) Who went to the forest to find a cure for his father disease there he went to the building with full of ghosts what happpned to him? Did he survive from that ghosts? Watch now'),
(9658, N's9658', N'MOVIE', N'A Place at the Table', NULL, 2013, N'PG', 84, N'MINUTES', N'84 min', N'The next chapter on America''s food crisis from the people that brought you FOOD, INC: 1 in 4 kids don''t know where their next meal is coming from. Hunger is a growing epidemic in the US, and we can fix it. Jeff Bridges, Tom Colicchio star.'),
(9659, N's9659', N'MOVIE', N'12 Dates of Christmas', NULL, 2011, N'PG', 87, N'MINUTES', N'87 min', N'Setup on a Christmas Eve date, a woman must relive the date over and over.'),
(9660, N's9660', N'MOVIE', N'10 Things I Hate About You', NULL, 1999, N'PG-13', 97, N'MINUTES', N'97 min', N'On the first day at his new school, Cameron instantly falls for Bianca the gorgeous girl of his dreams.'),
(9661, N's9661', N'MOVIE', N'The Man in the Hat', NULL, 2021, N'13+', 96, N'MINUTES', N'96 min', N'The Man in the Hat journeys through France in a Fiat 500 accompanied by a framed photograph of an unknown woman. He is pursued by five angry men in a Citroen Dyane. Why are they chasing him and how can he shake them off?'),
(9662, N's9662', N'TV_SHOW', N'Terrahawks', NULL, 1983, N'ALL', 3, N'SEASONS', N'3 Seasons', N'This thrilling, action-packed series saw Gerry Anderson making a spectacular return to puppet animation! Led by the heroic Tiger Ninestein, and assisted by a legion of charismatic robots known as Zeroids, the elite Terrahawks fighting force battle a cabal of evil adversaries - none more terrifying than android crone Zelda, the would-be conqueror of all "Earth-Scum"'),
(9663, N's9663', N'MOVIE', N'River', NULL, 2021, N'16+', 93, N'MINUTES', N'93 min', N'River is a grounded Sci-Fi mystery Thriller, that follows River Allen on her self discovery journey after she goes missing for over a week with the help of her friend Amanda. She soon discovers darker, undiscovered secret that taunts her.'),
(9664, N's9664', N'MOVIE', N'Pride Of The Bowery', NULL, 1940, N'7+', 60, N'MINUTES', N'60 min', N'New York City street principles get an East Side Kid in trouble at a Civilian Conservation Corps camp.'),
(9665, N's9665', N'TV_SHOW', N'Planet Patrol', NULL, 2018, N'13+', 4, N'SEASONS', N'4 Seasons', N'This is Earth, 2100AD - and these are the adventures of cult hit Space Patrol! Join Galasphere 347 and its intrepid crew on their voyages around the solar system: heroic Captain Dart, elfin Slim, sausage-mad Husky, Irish genius Professor Haggerty, mad Martian parrot Gabbler - and, keeping them all on a tight rein, Colonel Raeburn and his super-efficient secretary, Marla!'),
(9666, N's9666', N'MOVIE', N'Outpost', NULL, 2008, N'R', 90, N'MINUTES', N'90 min', N'In war-torn Eastern Europe, a world-weary group of mercenaries discover a long-hidden secret in an abandoned WWII bunker.'),
(9667, N's9667', N'TV_SHOW', N'Maradona: Blessed Dream', NULL, 2021, N'TV-MA', 1, N'SEASONS', N'1 Season', N'The series tells the story of Diego Maradona, a boy from an Argentine villa who turned into the legendary soccer star.'),
(9668, N's9668', N'MOVIE', N'Harry Brown', NULL, 2010, N'R', 103, N'MINUTES', N'103 min', N'Harry Brown, starring two-time Academy Award winner Michael Caine, follows one man''s journey through a chaotic world where teenage violence runs rampant. As a modest, law abiding citizen, Brown lives alone. His only companion is his best friend Leonard. When Leonard is killed, Brown reaches his breaking point. Harry Brown is a powerful, character driven thriller.');
